<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">- Kwere Bible Velsion</book>
  <para style="h">Isaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Isa</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaya</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Isaya kakala mulotezi wa Mulungu yakalile kudibululu da Yelusalemu. Fambulo da zina jake dikala, “Mndewa Mulungu kokombola.” Wasomi wengi wotogola kuwa Isaya kandika chitabu chino, mbali wamwenga wotogola kuwa mbuli zimwenga za ulotezi uwo zandikigwa na kongezigwa muna ichitabu chino lusita Isaya viyadanganike. Sang'hano ya Isaya ya kulotela yandusa mwaka uyadanganike mfalume Uzia (Isaya 6:1), mfalume Uzia kadanganika mwaka 740 KK. One mulotezi Isaya kandika chitabu chose, yolagusa kuwa chilondeka chikomelezeke lusita sang'hano yake viikomelezeke mwaka 680 KK. Chitabu cha Isaya chomanyika ng'hani muna ivitabu va ulotezi va Lagano da Umwaka. Ivo wanhu wamwenga womtanga Isaya, “Mkulu wa walotezi.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulotezi kolonga kwa ichimu cha Mulungu na kolava usenga kulawa kwa Mulungu. Kufosela Isaya, Mulungu kalonga viya Yelusalemu vondainangigwe (Isaya 39:6) na viya Waisilaili vondawabwele kulawa kuutumwa (Isaya 40:2-3). Isaya kalonga kuwa wanhu wezatagusigwa kwa uhasanyi wawo. Iviya Isaya kalotela wizilo wa mfalume kulawa muna uwelesi wa Daudi (Isaya 9:7). Wandikaji wa Lagano da Sambi wafambula kuwa mfalume iyamtambule Isaya muna uulotezi wake kakala Yesu. Chitabu cha Isaya cholotela wizilo wa Yohana Mbatizi yondayawasasale wanhu kumuhokela Yesu (Isaya 40:3)</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1-39 zandikigwa ing'hali Wayahudi hawanasoligwa na wanhu wa isi ya Babeli. Sula izo muna ichitabu cha Isaya zolonga kusonhela nhaguso ya Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 40-66 zolonga viya Isilaili vondaiwe isi kaidi na zowaguma moyo wanhu wake.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Yano malaguso yoyawone Isaya mwana wa Amozi kusonhela isi ya Yuda na bululu da Yelusalemu, lusita lwa mfalume Uzia na lusita lwa mfalume Yosamu na lusita lwa mfalume Ahazi na lusita lwa mfalume Hezekia, wawo wose wakala wafalume wa isi ya Yuda.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowazuma wanhu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Tegeleza weye ulanga, kinga digutwi weye isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">“Niwalisa wana na niwalela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">mbali wawo wanilema.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Ng'ombe kommanya yomdima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">na chihongwe kommanya munhu yomwing'ha ndiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">Mbali Waisilaili hawammanyile mwenevale wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">wanhu wangu hawanimanyile.”<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Mwizagaya mweye wanhu mukala muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">mohasanya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">mweye welesi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">mukala kwa kubamanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">Mweye mumulemile Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">Mumzeha Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili na mumuleka.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Habali molonda kutagusigwa kaidi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">Habali mogendelela kuwa watatali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">Ditwi jose doluma na moyo wausungu.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Kulawa kuulwayo mbaka kudidosi kwabule ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">mbali mawanga na kwiikubula na vilonda vilawa ufila havifungigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">na havisunhigwe na havifungigwe na havitoholigwe na mavuta.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Isi yenu iwa matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">mabululu yenu yotimbuligwa na moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">Muna iisi yenu wageni wasola vinhu venu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">na isi izanangigwa na wageni kuno mweye molola.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Bululu da Sayuni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bululu da Sayuni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bululu da Sayuni niijo zina dimwenga da bululu da Yelusalemu.</char></note> dilekigwa fana chiheha kumgunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">dilekigwa fana chiheha muna umgunda wa matanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">bululu da Sayuni dizingigwa na wehi.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />One Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi sigambeyachileke wamwenga chisulupuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:9">chahatimbuligwe fana mabululu ya Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Tegelezeni mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">mweye mulingile fana watawala wasede wa Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">Tegelezeni mafundizo ya Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">mweye mulingile fana wanhu wasede wa Gomola.<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">“Vino nhosa zenu nyingi zonifaya choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">Nizilegela nhosa zenu za mabebelu ya ng'hondolo wa kutimbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">na mabambala ya wanyama wenu wanenehe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">Silonda damu ya ng'ombe walume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">hebu silonda damu ya wanang'hondolo hebu luti.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Vino lusita vimwiza kumwangu kunitambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:12">yelihi yawalongele mubojoge muna ulubuga lwangu na wanyama wenu?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Sekemunigalile kaidi nhosa zenu hazifaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">nowihila ng'hani ubani wenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">Madugila ya Mwezi Ukwima na Siku ya Mhumulo na vomuiting'hana kutambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">sidaha kuvifunyila umoyo.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Moyo wangu woyehila Madugila yenu ya Mwezi Ukwima na madugila yamwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">Yawa mbahasha izamile kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">nilegela kuyafunyila umoyo.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Vimwinula makono yenu kutambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">nogubika chihanga changu sekenimuwoneni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">Muhapula mbuli, sizamtegelezani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">Makono yenu yamema damu za wanhu muwakomile.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Isafyeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:16">lekeni sang'hano zenu zihile haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:16">lekeni kutenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Ifunzeni kutenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">iyoheni kutenda voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">watazeni wawoneligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">weng'heni wana wachiwa haki yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">wagombeleni wanaake wagane.”<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Izoni chilonganye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">uhasanyi wenu uhawa mdung'hu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">wizagaluka mzelu fana seluji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">uhawa mdung'hu ng'hani fana damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">wizakuwa mzelu fana pamba.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />One muhatogola na kunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:19">mwizatemeligwa mate muna iisi.<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />Mbali muhalema na kunileka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:20">mwizakomigwa na panga.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:20">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowazuma wanhu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Bululu diya dikalile dokwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">sambi digaluka kuwa fana mgoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">lusita lumwe haki itawala umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">mbali sambi dimema wakomaji.<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Hela yenu iwa unyolodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:22">divai yenu ihanganyigwa na mazi.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Wakulu wako wonilema niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">woilumba na wabavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">chila munhu kozahila chitumetume na lushwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">kuno wanaake wagane na wachiwa hawagesigwa.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">mulangulizi yeli na nguvu wa Isilaili, kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">“Nizawawonela ludoko wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">nizawalihiza chisasi waja wonilema.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Nizamtagusani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">nizasegeza wihi wenu fana viya zahabu voilunguzigwa na moto muladi kusegeza nhaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">nizausegeza wihi wenu wose.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Nizaweng'ha wasemi walingile wa mwanduso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">na vinyandama walingile wa mwanduso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">Baho Yelusalemu dizatangigwa bululu ditenda voilondeka na bululu dikwaminika.”<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Sayuni izakomboligwa kwa viya wanhu wake viwozindilila malagilizo ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:27">waja weli mgati yake wasamile wezakomboligwa.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Mbali wanhu wonilema na wahasanyi wose wezanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:28">waja weli hawamtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu wezakomigwa.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />Mwizawona chinyala kwaviya mutambikila nyang'hiti muna imibiki ya miyaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:29">mwizawona chinyala kwaviya mutambikila nyang'hiti muna imigunda yomuisagule.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Mwizakuwa fana mbiki wa mwaloni unyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:30">fana mgunda upuwile mvula.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Wene nguvu wezatakamila fana mayani yanyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">sang'hano zawo zizakuwa fana sese za moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">Wezatakamila hamwe na sang'hano zawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">Habule munhu yondayadahe kuuzima moto uwo.<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s">Kukala kwa tindiwalo da siku zose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Mulungu kamwing'ha usenga Isaya mwana wa Amozi kusonhela isi ya Yuda na bululu da Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Siku zikwiza mulima uli na kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">wizagangamizigwa kufosa milima yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">wizakuwa mtali kufosa vilima vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">wanhu wa zisi zose wezahita uko.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Wanhu wengi wezauhitila na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">izoni chikwele mulima wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">chihite ukaye kwa Mulungu wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">Kezachifundiza viya vochilondeka kukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">muladi chikale fana viyolonda Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">Kwaviya lagilizo dizalawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu izalawa bululu da Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Kezahumiza muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">kezalamula migomvi ya zisi nyingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">Wanhu wezaponda yawo yawe magembe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">na migoha yawo iwe sengo za kukanhila mayani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">Isi haizaitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">iviya hawezaifunza kwiitowa ng'hondo kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siku ya Mndewa Mulungu ya kutagusa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Lelo mweye welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:5">izoni mukale kwa kusondelela mafundizo ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kawalema wanhu wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">Waja wotenda fana wahawi wolawa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">wolagula fana Wafilisiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">woilumba na wamhazi.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Isi yawo imema mabwe ya hela na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">ngama yawo ng'hulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">isi yawo imema falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">matololi ya ng'hondo ya kubululigwa na falasi hayapeteka.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Isi yawo imema nyang'hiti za milungu ya uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:8">wanhu wake wotambikila vinhu viwatendile wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:8">vinhu viwalumbile wenyewo.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Chila munhu kezakugwa chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:9">Weye Mulungu, sekeuwalekelele.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Ingileni muna yamatuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">muhimbe mumsanga mukaifise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">muyepule na ludoko lwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">mukaifise kutali na ukulu wake na bung'hulo jake.<verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Wanhu weli na magoda wezahumulusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:11">udugi wa wanhu wizamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:11">na Mndewa Mulungu yaidumwe kezatogozigwa siku iyo ikwiza.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Kweli siku ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi yokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:12">Wose weli na magoda na waja wose woitogoza wezatagusigwa.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />Kezakanha mibiki yose ya mielezi ya Lebanoni ili mitali na inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:13">na mibiki ya miyaloni yose ya isi ya Bashani.<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />Kezaipolomola milima yose mitali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:14">na vilima vose vitali.<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />Kezayabomola malingo yose yamatali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:15">na ng'huta zose za mhongono.<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />Kezazididimiza meli zose za Talishishi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:16">na ngalawa zose zinogile.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Lusita lwizafika chila yoigoda kezainyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17">na udugi wa wanhu wizamala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17">Mndewa Mulungu yaidumwe kezatogozigwa siku iyo.<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Nyang'hiti za milungu zizakuwa zahabule.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Wanhu wezakwingila muna yamatuka na muna yamakombo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">kwa kudumba ludoko lwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">wezaifisa kutali na ukulu wake na bung'hulo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">vondayeze kuidumbiza isi.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Siku iyo wanhu wezawasila nyang'hiti zawo ng'hulumbe na magombalima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:20">nyang'hiti zawo za hela na zahabu zowaitendele muladi wazitambikile.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Nawo wezakwingila muna yamatuka yeli muna uluwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">muna ulwatu lwa luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">kwa kudumba ludoko lwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">wezakimbila kutali na ukulu wa bung'hulo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">vondayeze kuidumbiza isi.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Lekeni kumuhuwila munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:22">kwaviya kabule chochose mbali mhumuzi muhala muna imhula yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:22">Vino munhu kofaya choni?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s">Nhaguso yondailawilile bululu da Yelusalemu na isi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yeli na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">kezasegezela wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu na isi ya Yuda vinhu vose viwohuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">kowasegezela ndiya na mazi.<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />Kezamsegeza munhu galu na mtowang'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:2">msemi na mulotezi na mulaguzi na mkulu,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />kezamsegeza mkulu wa watowang'hondo wa wanhu malongo matano na munhu yamanyike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:3">kezamsegeza chinyandama na galu wa kutenda vinhu na galu wa uganga.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Mulungu kalonga, “Nizaweka wabwanga kuwa walangulizi na wana ving'hele wezatawala.”<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Wanhu wezaiwonela wawo kwa wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">chila munhu kezamuwonela miyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">mkaya kezamuwonela mkaya miyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">mbwanga kezamuliga mulala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">yokwehuligwa kezamwehula munhu yohishimigwa.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Lusita ulwo munhu kezamulongela ndugu yake muna ikaye ya tati yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">“Weye kuna walo da sambi, uwe mkulu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">weye uchitawale lusita luno lwa magayo.”<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Mbali siku iyo kezamwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">“Niye sidaha kukutaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">kwaviya nabule ndiya hebu walo muna ikaye yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">Ivo sekeunisagule kuwa mtawala wako.”<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu waikwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">wanhu wa isi ya Yuda wagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">kwaviya wamulema Mndewa Mulungu kwa mbuli zawo na sang'hano zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">wokwehula ukulu wake.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Vihanga vawo volagusa uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">woigodela uhasanyi wawo fana viya wanhu wa bululu da Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">iviya hawaufisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">Wanhu wawo wezagaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">kwaviya waigalila magayo wawo wenyewo.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Walongeleni wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile kuwa wezatemeligwa mate kwa sang'hano zawo ziwasang'hane.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Wanhu wose wotenda mbuli zihile wezagaya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:11">wezalihigwa kwa chiya chowawatendele wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Wabwanga wowagaza wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">na wanaake wowatawala wanhu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">Mweye wanhu wangu, wakulu wenu womwagizani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">na hawawalagusa nzila yomulondeka kuisondelela.”<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kaisasala kulamula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:13">kokwima kuwahumiza wanhu wake.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kowahumiza wakulu na walangulizi wa wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">“Mweye muwakang'ana wanhu wangu fana mgunda wa mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">vinhu viwahokigwe ngayengaye vamuna zikaye zenu.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Vino fambulo jake choni kuwagaza wanhu wangu na kuwatendela usede wanhu ngayengaye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:15">Niye Mndewa Mulungu nili na Udahi nouza ivo.”<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanaake wa Yelusalemu wozumigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Wanaake wa Yelusalemu wana magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">viwogenda wokwinula matwi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">wolembula meso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">kuno wogenda woigoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">na vitindi vawo volila muna yamagulu yawo.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Lelo niye Mndewa Mulungu nizawatagusa wanaake wa Sayuni kwa kuwawegula nyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:17">na kuwahambula walo da kugubika maungo yawo muladi kuwaguma chinyala.”<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Siku zikwiza Mndewa Mulungu kezawahambula vitindi na mikufu na vigogela wanaake wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />Kezawahambula heleni na bangili na vilemba, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />na vitindi vibotigwe muna yamagulu na mikwiji na nyhupa za mavuta yonung'hila goya na mhinga, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />na mhete za vidole na vipini va muimhula, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />na mawalo ya madugila na ng'hanzu na vilemba na mifuko ya hela, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />na walo dinogile na kombelo na usalu na shela.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Hanhu honung'hila hezalava vundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">hanhu ha kuvaligwa mikwiji hezavaligwa nzabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">hanhu ha nyele zitendigwe goya hezaweguligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">hanhu ha kuvala mawalo yanogile hezavaligwa maguniya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">vihanga vawo vihambigwe vizakuwa va chakachaka.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Walume wenu wezakomigwa na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:25">iviya wanhu wenu magalu wezadanganika kuna ing'hondo.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Maabaho wanhu wezalila kwa usungu hana ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:26">Nawo wezabimbilika muna yamatimbwisi kuno wabule chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Siku zikwiza wanaake saba wezamuhitila mulume imwe na kumulongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">“Ndiya na mawalo chizazahila wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">mbali uchisegezele chinyala chetu na uchisole.”<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bululu da Yelusalemu dizazengigwa kaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Siku zikwiza tambi da Mndewa Mulungu dondadisuke dizanoga ng'hani na kutogozigwa, nayo matunda ya isi yezanogeza. Waisilaili wasigale wezatogoligwa na kuigodela isi viikwima ndiya. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Waja wasigale wagima kuna dibululu da Yelusalemu, lusita Yelusalemu viinangigwe wezatangigwa welile. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawasafya wanhu wa Yelusalemu muladi kusegeza damu itike umo kwa makono yawo. Kezatenda ivo kwa kuhumiza na kutagusa. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Maabaho kezatenda chila hanhu uchanyha ya mulima Sayuni na uchanyha ya wanhu woiting'hana uko, hawe na wingu da yosi lusita lwa imisi na moto wokwaka lusita lwa ichilo. Iviya bung'hulo da Mulungu dizatanda na kudikaliza bululu jose. <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Bung'hulo jake dizakuwa chiheha cha kuwakaliza na vuke da imisi, iviya dizakuwa hanhu ha kukimbilila lusita lwa mvula nyingi.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa mgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Nizamwimbila wila mbwiyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">wila wa mgunda wake wa mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">Mbwiyangu kakala na mgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">uchanyha ya mulima uli na ulongo unogile.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Kalima vinogile na kasegeza mabwe yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">umo kaombeka mizabibu inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">kazenga lingo hagati yake na katenda hanhu ha kubojogela zabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">Maabaho kalolela kupata zabibu zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">mbali mizabibu ima zabibu zili usungu.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Yelusalemu na Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:3">humizeni hagati ya niye na mgunda wangu wa mizabibu.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Vino nibananga choni muna umgunda wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:4">Vinilolele zime zabibu zinogile, habali zima zabibu zili usungu?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Lelo nizawalongela chiya chondanitende muna umgunda wa mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">nizasegeza konhi jake, nawo wizanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">nizaisung'ha wako jake, nawo wizabojogigwa.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Nizautenda mgunda uwe bwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">mizabibu yake haizahalililigwa hebu kuhambuligwa matambi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">uko kwizakota mbigili na visasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">Iviya nizayalongela mawingu sekeyatonye mvula.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Mgunda wa mizabibu wa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi niiyo kaye ya Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">na wanhu wa Yuda niuwo mbiki wake wa kunogeza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">Kalolela watende voilondeka mbali wakoma wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">kalolela watende mbuli zinogile mbali wawatenda wanhu walile.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Mwizagaya mweye mongeza kaye zimwenga muna zikaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">na mokongeza migunda imwenga muna imigunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">mbaka chila hanhu hokuwa henu na habule hanhu ha wamwenga muna iisi.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Nimuhulika Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">“Ukweli kaye nyingi zizasigala matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">kaye ng'hulu na zinogile zizapuwa wanhu wa kukala.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Mgunda wa mizabibu wa heka longo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">wizalava lita nane muhala za divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">munhu yohanda mbeyu chilo gana kezagobola chilo longo muhala.”<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Wezagaya waja woidawa na kung'wa upele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">waja wokala meso ichilo, mbaka wakoligwa ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Wana chinubi na bango muna yamadugila yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">wana ngoma na vilongelonge na divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">mbali hawagesa mbuli za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">na wokwehula sang'hano zake ziyasang'hane.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Ivo wanhu wangu wezagaligwa kuuhami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">kwaviya hawamtegeleza Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">Wakulu wawo wezadanganika na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">wanhu wengi wezadanganika na ng'hilu.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Kuzimu kulinga fana munhu yeli na mulomo mgalamu na yeli na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">kogozela wakulu wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">Umo wezahumuluka wakulu wawo na wanhu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">hamwe na wanhu wowosovula na wanhu wodeng'helela.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Chila munhu kezagumigwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:15">iviya wanhu wose weli na magoda wezagumigwa chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kezatogozigwa kwa kuwahumiza wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:16">yeye kolagusa ukulu wake kwa sang'hano zake zigoloke.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Wanang'hondolo wezakuja mgina fana muna umgunda wa kuwadimila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:17">Wanaluti wezakuja mgina muna yamatongo ya matajili.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Wezagaya waja wobulula uhasanyi kwa nzabi za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:18">wobulula wihi fana wobulula na nzabi za tololi.<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />Wezagaya waja wolonga, “Mulungu yalopole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">yatende sang'hano yake chipate kuiwona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">Mulungu Yeli Uchanyha, Yelile wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">yafikize lungilo jake muladi chivimanye kogesa choni.”<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Wezagaya wanhu woulonga wihi uwo unovu na unovu uwo wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">ziza wodilonga bung'hulo na bung'hulo wodilonga ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">chili usungu wochilonga chamulile na chili umulile wochilonga chausungu.<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Wezagaya waja woigesa wabala na wavimanya.<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Wezagaya waja woigesa magalu kwa kung'wa divai ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:22">na woiwona wadaha ng'hani kuhanganya ving'waji vovimtenda munhu yakoligwe.<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />Wezagaya waja womulekelela munhu yotenda mbuli zihile, muladi weng'higwe lushwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:23">na waja womtagusa munhu habanange.<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Ivo fana milambi ya moto viilunguza mbaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">na mayani yanyalile viyotimbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">niivo wanhu wano vondawanangigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">mazizi yawo yezawola na maluwa yawo yezahembeluka uchanyha fana timbwisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">Wezanangigwa kwaviya wayalema na kuyazeha malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yeli na Udahi, Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko wanhu wake na kawatagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Milima itingisika na mitufi ilinga nhaka muna yamakulugumbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Mbali Mndewa Mulungu halekile kuwawonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">kagendelela kuwatagusa.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Mndewa Mulungu kowatanga wanhu wa zisi zimwenga weze kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">kowatowela chimbeta wanhu wolawa kuuhelelo wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">nawo wolopola kwiza.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Hawalegela na hawaikwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">hawakukila na hawagona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">Mikwiji yawo haitohoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">na nzabi za vilatu vawo hazidumuka.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Misale yawo yokutwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">mhinde zawo zimala kukwegigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">mapaga ya falasi wawo madala fana mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">ugenzi wa mataili ya matololi yobululigwa na falasi yalinga fana vulavumbi.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Watowang'hondo wawo wotongoloma fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">wotongoloma fana wanasimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">wagwilile mnyama na kumgala kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">kulibule munhu wa kuwahoka.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Siku zikwiza wezatongoloma kwa ichimu cha ukala uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">wezatongoloma fana bahali viibuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">Munhu yahalola isi kezawona ziza na magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">iviya zuwa dizakikizigwa na ziza na mawingu.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu komulagusa Isaya malaguso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Mwaka uyadanganike mfalume Uzia, Mndewa Mulungu kanilagusa malaguso, muna yamalaguso, nimuwona Mndewa Mulungu kakala muna ichigoda chake cha chifalume chikalile uchanyha ng'hani. Mhindo ya walo jake yenela muna ikaye yose ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Uchanyha yake wakala vilumbe weli na mabawa, chila chilumbe chikala na mabawa sita, maidi yagubika chihanga na maidi yagubika lukuli na maidi ya kugulukila.<verse eid="ISA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Wakala woitanga wawo kwa wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">“Yelile, yelile, yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">zisi zose zimema ukulu wake.”<verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Madizi yawo yatingisa mibiki yamhilile zinyivi za Kaye ya Mulungu, nayo kaye imema yosi.<verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Nilonga, “Nizagaya, kwaviya nyambula mwiko na nokala hamwe na wanhu wambule mwiko na meso yangu yamuwona Mfalume niiyo Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.”<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Baho imwe mwa waja vilumbe weli na mabawa kaguluka na kanizila kuno kamha kala da moto muna umkono wake, kala ijo kadisola na batilo kulawa muna ulupango. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Kanidalisa mmulomo wangu na kalonga, “Kala dino didalisa mulomo wako, uhasanyi wako usegezigwa na uhasanyi wako ulekeleligwa.”<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Maabaho nihulika dizi da Mndewa Mulungu douza, “Nimtume yelihi? Vino yelihi yondayahite kwa ichimu chetu?” Niye nilonga, “Nabaha. Nhume niye.”<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Kanilongela, “Hita ukawalongele wanhu wano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">‘Mwizagendelela kutegeleza, mbali hamwizavimanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">Mwizagendelela kulola, mbali hamwizavimanya.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Maabaho kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">“Kwa kulotela ivo, kwizaitenda mizoyo ya wanhu wano iwe midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">magutwi yawo sekeyahulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">meso yawo sekeyawone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">buleivo wezadaha kulola kwa meso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">kuhulika kwa magutwi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">kuvimanya muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">na wezasama na kuhonezigwa.”<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Niye niuza, “Mndewa, mbuli ino mbaka zuwaki?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">Nayo kanidika, “Mbaka mabululu vondayasigale matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">na kaye vondazipuwe wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">na migunda vondainangigwe.<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />Mbaka niye Mndewa Mulungu vondaniwagale kutali wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:12">isi yose vondaiwe yabule chinhu na haifaya.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />One wahasigala hanhu longo ha wanhu, iviya wezanangigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">Wawo wezalinga fana mbiki wa mvinje hebu mbiki wa mwaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">uhakanhigwa wosigala chisiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">chisiki icho niiyo mbeyu yelile isuka.”<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa mfalume Ahazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Lusita Ahazi mwana wa Yosamu mzukulu wa Uzia, viyakalile mfalume wa isi ya Yuda, mfalume Lesini wa Shamu na mfalume Peka mwana wa Lemalia wa Isilaili, wahita kuditowa bululu da Yelusalemu, mbali wapotwa.<verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Mfalume wa Yuda viyahulike Washami wailumba na Waisilaili, yeye na wanhu wake wadumba ng'hani na wagudemeka fana mibiki yotingisigwa na mbeho.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Baho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Isaya, “Msole mwanago Sheali Yashubu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulania, Sheali Yashubu fambulo jake, “Wondawasigale wezabwela.” </char></note> uhite kuiting'hana na mfalume Ahazi kuuhelela kudikolongo digala mazi Kudilamba da Uchanyha. Kwizamfika kudikulugumbi hanhu ha kufuwila mawalo.<verse eid="ISA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />“Mulongele mfalume Ahazi, ‘Iteganye, nyamala na sekeudumbe. Sekeufe moyo kwa ichimu cha wanhu wano waidi weli fana ngodi vizizimika. Sekeufe moyo kwa ichimu cha ludoko lukulu lwa mfalume Lesini na Washami na mwana wa Lemalia. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Washami na Waisilaili hamwe na mwana wa Lemalia wafunga imwe muladi wakunange. <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />Walonga, “Chihite chikaiteke isi ya Yuda, chiwadumbize wanhu wake na chiinange isi yawo. Maabaho chizamtenda mwana wa Tabeeli kuwa mfalume wawo. ” ’<verse eid="ISA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />“Mbali niye Mndewa Mulungu nolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:7">‘Mbuli iyo haidahika na haizalawilila.<verse eid="ISA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />Kwaviya bululu kulu da Shamu niijo Damasiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">na Damasiki dolangulizigwa na Lesini muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">Muna imiyaka malongo sita na mitano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">ufalume wa Isilaili wizabanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">na Isilaili haizakuwa na ufalume kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Iviya bululu kulu da Isilaili niijo Samalia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:9">na Samaliya dolangulizigwa na mwana wa Lemalia muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:9">One hamuhuwile, hamwizagangamala.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilaguso cha kwelekigwa kwa Imanueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Ahazi kaidi, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />“Nipule niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako nitende chilaguso chochose kulawa hasi ng'hani muna iisi hebu kuchanyha ng'hani kuulanga.” <verse eid="ISA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Mbali Ahazi kedika, “Sizapula, sizakugeza weye Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ISA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Baho Isaya kalonga, “Tegelezeni mweye welesi wa mfalume Daudi. Vino haifaya kuwatenda wanhu walegele kufunya umoyo? Vino mwizamtenda Mulungu iviya yalegele kufunya umoyo? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu mwenyewo kezaweng'ha chilaguso. Mndele ino kezapata wimo na kezakweleka mwana, mwana iyo kezatangigwa Imanueli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulania mbuli Imanueli fambulo jake, “Mulungu kahamwe na cheye.” </char></note>. <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Kezakuja mtindi na uki lusita vondayavimanye kulema mbuli zihile na kusagula kutenda mbuli zinogile. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Kwaviya mwana iyo yang'hali hanavimanya kulema mbuli zihile na kusagula kutenda mbuli zinogile, zisi za wafalume wawo waidi wouwadumba zizasigala matongo. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kezamgalilani magayo weye na wanhu wako na kaye yako. Magayo yayo hayanalawilila kwandusila siku ija Waisilaili viwaibagule na wanhu wa Yuda. Kezamgalilani mfalume wa Ashulu yamtoweni.”<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Siku iyo Mndewa Mulungu kezawatowela muluzi wanhu wa Misili weze fana ng'honzi wolawa muna ivizanda va lwanda lwa Naili, iviya wanhu wa Ashulu weze fana dali kulu da nyuki dolawa muna iisi ya Ashulu. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Wose wezakwiza na kumemeza makolongo yeli na ngema na zimbane za mabwe na vibago vose vili na miwa na chila hanhu ha kudimila. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Siku iyo Mndewa Mulungu kezasang'hanila lumo kulawa kuna ulwanda lwa Efulate, niiyo mfalume wa Ashulu, kezamsenyani nyele zenu na ng'huli zenu na ndevu zenu. <verse eid="ISA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />Siku iyo munhu kezafuga dang'ang'a da ng'ombe na ng'hondolo waidi. <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />Wezalava maziwa mengi nayo kezakung'wa mtindi. Wose wondawasigale muna iisi wezakung'wa mtindi na uki. <verse eid="ISA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />Muna isiku iyo chila hanhu hahakalile na mizabibu 1,000 iguligwa kwa shekeli 1,000 za hela, hezakuwa na visasa na mbigili. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Wanhu wezahita uko kusaka kuno wana mhinde na misale, kwaviya isi yose izamema visasa na mbigili. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Nayo milima yose ikalile ilimigwa, izamema visasa na mbigili, mbaka habule munhu yondayageze kuhita uko. Hanhu baho hezatavangiligwa na ng'ombe na ng'hondolo.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwana wa Isaya kolagusa usenga wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela, “Sola gome kulu na ujandike vino, ‘Maheli Shalali Hashibazi,’ fambulo jake lopola kuteka na lopola kuhoka.” <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Mbali niye niwatanga Uliya mkulu wa nhambiko na Zakalia mwana wa Yebelekia wawe wakalangama wangu wokwaminika. <verse eid="ISA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Maabaho nimbandama muke wangu yakalile mulotezi, nayo kapata wimo na kavumbula mwana wa chilume. Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela, “Mtange mwana iyo, ‘Maheli Shalali Hashibazi.’ <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Yang'hali mwana hanadaha kulonga, ‘Tata’ hebu ‘Mama,’ utajili wa Damasiki na vinhu va Samalia vizasoligwa na mfalume wa Ashulu.”<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela kaidi,<verse eid="ISA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />“Wanhu wano wayalema mazi ya Shilo yokilima ugaluga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:6">na wawadeng'helela mfalume Lesini na mwana wa Lemalia.<verse eid="ISA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kezagala mazi ya lwanda yokilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">mazi yeli na nguvu ng'hani, niiyo mfalume wa Ashulu na watowang'hondo wake wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">Mazi yayo yezakwiza na kufosa kuna ulwanda lwa Efulate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">na yezamema ng'enge kwa ng'enge.<verse eid="ISA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />Yezakilima kwa nguvu na kwingila muna iisi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">yezamema na kukwela mbaka muna isingo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">Mbali Mulungu kahamwe na cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">ivo kezaikaliza isi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">fana viya ndege viyogubika na mabawa yake.”<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Dunhuleni ndilo mweye wanhu wa zisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">na mudumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">Tegelezeni mweye wose muli zisi za kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">isasaleni kuitowa ng'hondo na kugumigwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">kweli mwizagumigwa chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Ilungeni mweye wenyewo, mbali haizalawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">isasaleni, mbali moisasala bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">kwaviya Mulungu kahamwe na cheye.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulotezi kozumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />Mulungu kanizuma ng'hani sekeniwahige wanhu wa isi ino.<verse eid="ISA 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />Kalonga, “Sekeuilumbe nawo muna zimbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:12">iviya sekeudumbe chiya chiwodumba.<verse eid="ISA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi niiyo yolondeka kuhishimigwa na niiyo yelile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:13">Kolondeka umdumbe yeye muhala.<verse eid="ISA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Iyo kezakuwa hanhu ha kukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">mbali kwa wanhu wa Isilaili na Yuda kezakuwa dibwe da kuikwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">na kezakuwa kwangwa kwa wakaya wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Wanhu wengi wezaikwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:15">wezakugwa na kubemendeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:15">wezategigwa na kusoligwa.”<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Funga ukalangama wandikigwe na uyagume muhuli malagilizo yayo na weng'higwe wanahina wangu.<verse eid="ISA 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Nizamgozela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:17">iyo yawalemile welesi wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:17">Nizamuhuwila yeye.<verse eid="ISA 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Loleni niye na wana waja Mndewa Mulungu woyaning'hile fana chilaguso kwa wanhu wa Isilaili, chilawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi yoyokala uchanyha ya mulima Sayuni.<verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Wanhu wezamulongelani muhite mukatazigwe na wanhu wolonga na mizimu, waja mbuli zawo zilinga fana ndege viyolila, kwaviya wanhu wazowela kuipula milungu yawo. Vino habali muhite kuwapula wanhu wadanganike wawataze wanhu wagima? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />One wahamulongelani, kumbukeni mafundizo yangu. Walongeleni kuwa mbuli zonilongile zizalawilila. Wanhu wolonga fana ivo wamuna diziza na mbuli ziwolonga za uvwizi.<verse eid="ISA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Wanhu wezawegela muna iisi yose, wezakufa moyo na wezakuwa na nzala. Wezawona ludoko kwaviya wana nzala. Wezalongelela na kumduwila mfalume wawo na mulungu wawo kuno wolola kuulanga. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Wezailola isi yose, mbali wezawona magayo muhala na ziza na manhesa. Ivo wezakwingila muna diziza totolo.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s">Ufalume wa haki wa mfalume yokwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Mbali wanhu wakalile na uzidilwa hawezakuwa na usungu kaidi. Baho umwaka Mndewa Mulungu kazitenda zisi za Zabuloni na Nafutali zili muna iisi ya Isilaili zehuligwe, mbali baho hamwande kezaitenda isi iyo iheshimigwe, isi ili habehi na mhwani mbaka umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yoludani na muna isi ya Galilaya yowokala wanhu wa zisi zimwenga.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Wanhu wagendile muna diziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">wawona bung'hulo kulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">Bung'hulo diwamwemwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">wanhu wokala muna iisi ili na ziza totolo.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kongeza nyelesi muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">na kuwatenda wanhu wadeng'helele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">Wanhu wodeng'helela kuulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">fana viwodeng'helela kugobola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">fana wanhu wodeng'helela kuigolela vinhu viwatekile.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Kwaviya kuzitula mbahasha zizamile za utumwa ziwapapile na kuibena mibalati ya kulanhila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">fana viutendile siku iwahumigwe Wamidiani.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Chila chilatu cha mtowang'hondo chisang'haniligwe kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">na chila walo dili na damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">vizasasaligwa kwa kusomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">vizakuwa fana ngodi za kubwinhila moto.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Kwaviya mwana kelekwa kwa ichimu chetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">ching'higwa mwana wa chilume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">nayo kezatawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">Kezatangigwa, Chinyandama Yofaya Ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">Mulungu Yeli na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">Tata wa Siku Zose na Mfalume wa Tindiwalo.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Utawala wake wizagangamala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">tindiwalo da ufalume wake dabule uhelelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">kezatawala hana ichigoda cha chifalume cha Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">kezaugangamiza ufalume wake na kuutenda ukule kwa haki na kwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">kwandusila sambi na siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezatenda mbuli izo, kwaviya kochiwonela wivu.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowawonela ludoko Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela welesi wa Yakobo kuwa kezawatagusa.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Wanhu wose wa Isilaili na wanhu wa bululu da Samalia wezavimanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">Wawo wolonga kwa magoda,<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />“Kaye za matafali na kaye za mikuyu zigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:10">mbali chizazenga kaye za mabwe na kaye za mibiki ya mielezi.”<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kezawasongeza wehi wa Lesini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">nawo wezawatowa Waisilaili.<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Washami wolawa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa na Wafilisiti wolawa ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">waimela Isilaili fana mng'onyo yahamile mulomo wake.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:12" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">Mbali kwa mbuli zino zose Mndewa Mulungu halekile kuwawonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">kagendelela kuwatagusa.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Wanhu hawambwelele Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi yoyawataguse.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:13">Hawalondile yawataze.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Lelo kwa siku dimwe muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:14">Mndewa Mulungu kezasegeza muna isi ya Isilaili matwi na mikila, tambi na sina.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Matwi wawo walala na wohishimigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:15">mikila wawo walotezi wowofundiza uvwizi.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Waja wowalanguliza wanhu wano wowagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">na waja wolangulizigwa wokwaga.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Kwa ichimu icho Mndewa Mulungu hawawonela ubazi wabwanga wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">hawawonela ubazi wagane na wachiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">Kwaviya wose hawamdumba Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">na wotenda mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">Kwa mbuli izo zose Mndewa Mulungu halekile kuwawonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">kagendelela kuwatagusa.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Kweli mbuli za mdukula zokwaka fana moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">woulunguza mbigili na visasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">wokwaka kumbago na yosi jake dikwela kuulanga.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kana ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">isi yotimbuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">wanhu wano walinga fana ngodi zikong'higwa muumoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">habule munhu yomuwonela ubazi ndugu yake.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Wamwenga wezakuwa wogegeda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">mbali wezakuwa wang'hali na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">wamwenga wezakuwa woja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">mbali hawezakwiguta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">Chila munhu koja nyama ya miyage.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Kabila da Manase diditowa kabila da Efulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:21">kabila da Efulaimu diditowa kabila da Manase.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:21">Hamwande makabila yose maidi yaitowa isi ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:21">Mbali Mndewa Mulungu halekile kuwawonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:21">kagendelela kuwatagusa.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Wezagaya wasemi hawahumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:1">waja wolava malagilizo ya kuwonela.<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />Wowema ngayengaye haki zawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">na kuwakimilila wanhu wangu wawoneligwe sekewahumizigwe voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">muladi wawateke wagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">na wawahoke wachiwa vinhu vawo.<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Mwizatenda choni siku ya nhaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">lusita mahulo vondayamwizileni kulawa isi ya kutali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">Mwizamkimbilila yelihi kumpula yamtazeni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">Vino utajili wenu mwizauleka kulihi?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Hakwizasigala chinhu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">mbali kuinywata hamwe na wanhu watekigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">na kudanganika na wanhu wakomigwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 10:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">Mbali Mndewa Mulungu halekile kuwawonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">kagendelela kuwatagusa.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magoda ya mfalume wa Ashulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Kezagaya mfalume wa Ashulu, niijo balati da ludoko lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:5">muna umkono wake kamha lungu da ludoko lwangu.<verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Nomtuma kwa wanhu hawanimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">nizamulagiliza yawatowe wanhu woniguma ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">yawateke na yavisole vinhu vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">na yawabojoge fana nhope muna inzila.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Mbali mfalume wa Ashulu hailungila mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">yeye kana lungilo dimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">koilunga kuzinanga na kuzitimbula zisi nyingi ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Kwaviya mfalume wa Ashulu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:8">‘Wakulu wa watowang'hondo wangu iviya vinyandama muna uufalume wangu.<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Chidihuma bululu da Kalino fana vichidihumile bululu da Kalikemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">chidihuma bululu da Hamasi fana vichidihumile bululu da Alipadi na bululu da Samalia na bululu da Damasiki?<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Fana viya vinizinangile zisi zimwenga na nyang'hiti za milungu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:10">milungu mikulu ifosile nyang'hiti izo za bululu da Yelusalemu na Samalia,<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />lelo nizainanga Yelusalemu na nyang'hiti zake za milungu, fana viniinangile Samalia na nyang'hiti zake za milungu?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Mndewa Mulungu vondayakomeleze kuwatagusa wanhu kuna umulima Sayuni na Yelusalemu, kezalonga, “Nizamtagusa mfalume wa Ashulu, kwaviya koigoda na koitogoza.<verse eid="ISA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Kwaviya mfalume wa Ashulu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">‘Nitenda mbuli ino kwa nguvu zangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">na kwa ubala wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">kwaviya novimanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">Nisegeza mhaka za zisi na nizihoka ngama zawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">Kwa nguvu niwahumulusa wakalile muna ivigoda va chifalume.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Fana munhu viyoguma mkono muna ichisanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">niivo mkono wangu viusolile vinhu va wanhu wa zisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">Fana wanhu viwoduganya mafinga yasigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">niivo viniwaduganye wanhu wa zisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">Habule munhu yoyose yadahile kuipugunha hebu kulonga.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Vino nhemo yodaha kumgodela munhu yoisang'hanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">hebu msumeno wodaha kumgodela munhu yokanha?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">Vino balati dodaha kumwinula munhu yajamhile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">hebu mhome yodaha kumwinula munhu yoisang'hanila?”<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezawagalila watowang'hondo magalu utamu usokeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:16">ukulu wawo wizalunguzigwa fana kulunguzigwa na moto.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Mulungu yeli bung'hulo da Isilaili kezakuwa fana moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili kezakuwa fana milambi ya moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">woulunguza chila chinhu kwa siku dimwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">na kuwananga wehi wake fana kutimbula miwa ing'eng'ezale.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Mndewa Mulungu kezavinanga vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:18">mbago zake zing'hulu na migunda yake inogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:18">Izakuwa fana munhu yosoka na utamu mbaka kodanganika.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Mibiki yondaisigale muna imbago yake izakuwa midodo ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:19">mwana mdodo kodaha kuipeta.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowaguma moyo Waisilaili waja wasigale muna iisi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Siku zikwiza Waisilaili wondawasigale hawezawahuwila kaidi wanhu wawatowile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:20">mbali wezamuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Wanhu wadodo wondawasigale muna uwelesi wa Yakobo wezambwelela Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.<verse eid="ISA 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Sambi Waisilaili wawa wengi fana msanga wa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:22">mbali waja wondawabwele wadodo ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:22">Walungiligwa kunangigwa kwa haki.<verse eid="ISA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezafikiza chilagano chake cha kuwananga wanhu wa isi yose.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:24">“Mweye wanhu wangu womukala Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:24">sekemuwadumbe Waashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:24">womtowani na balati na womwinulilani lungu fana viwatendile Wamisili.<verse eid="ISA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Kwaviya lusita ludodo nizaleka kumuwonelani ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:25">mbali nizawawonela ludoko Waashulu na nizawananga.<verse eid="ISA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu nili na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:26">nizawalanha mibalati fana viya viniwalanhile wanhu wa Midiani kuna uluwe lwa Olebu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:26">Nizakwinula balati jangu uchanyha ya bahali fana vinitendile kuna iisi ya Misili.<verse eid="ISA 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Siku iyo nizaisegeza mbahasha iwampapizeni Waashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:27">na kuibena nila iwaikile muna zisingo zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:27">kwaviya muneneha ng'hani.”<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwihi kokwiza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Waashulu wafika Ayasi, wafosela Migiloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:28">mbahasha zawo wazileka Mikimashi.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Waloka lwanda kuno wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">“Chizakala bululu da Geba chilo chose.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">Wanhu wa bululu da Lama wogudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">Wanhu wa bululu da Gibea ya Sauli wokimbila.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Guteni nyangi mweye wanhu wa bululu da Galimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:30">tegelezeni mweye wakaya wa bululu da Laisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:30">mwizagaya mweye wanhu wa bululu da Anasosi.<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Wanhu wa bululu da Madimena wokimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:31">wanhu wa bululu da Gebimu woifisa.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Diyelo Waashulu wezakwima Nobu na kutingisa makono yawo kuwadumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:32">kuna umulima wa wanhu wa Sayuni, kuna ichilima cha Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Lola Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezawakanha Waashulu fana munhu viyokanha matambi kwa nguvu ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">fana viyokanha mibiki mitali ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Kezakanha mibiki na nhemo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:34">mbago za Lebanoni na mibiki yake inogile ng'hani ya mielezi izakugwa hasi.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s">Munhu yolawa welesi wa Yese kezagala tindiwalo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Munhu kezalawilila muna uwelesi wa Yese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:1">fana sukila vidisuka muna disiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:1">sukila ijo dizakwima matunda.<verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu kezakala nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">Muhe iyo kezamwing'ha ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">na kezamtenda yahumize goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">iviya kezamtenda yavimanye na yamdumbe Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />Kezadeng'helela kumtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:3">Hezatagusa kwa mbuli ziyowona kwa meso yake muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:3">na hezahumiza kwa mbuli ziyohulika kwa magutwi yake muhala.<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />Mbali kezaweng'ha haki ngayengaye na kugombela haki za wanyondenyonde muna iisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">Kezawatagusa wanhu wa isi yose kwa mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">kwa mbuli zake kezawakoma wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Haki izakuwa mkwiji wake wa kuvala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:5">uwaminika wizakuwa mkwiji muna ichigudi chake.<verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Mbwizi kezakala hamwe na mwanang'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">duma kezagona hamwe na luti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">dang'ang'a da ng'ombe na simba na ng'ombe yanenehe wezakala hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">na mwana mdodo kezawadima wawo wose.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Ng'ombe na dubu wezakuja hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:7">wana wawo wezagona hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:7">na simba kezakuja mayani yanyalile fana ng'ombe lume.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Mwana ching'hele kezakwangala habehi na mwina wa zoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:8">mwana mdodo kezakwingiza mkono wake muna umwina wa zoka.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Hawalumiza hebu kubananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">uchanyha ya mulima wangu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">kwaviya isi yose izamema wanhu wommanya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">fana mazi viyomema muna ibahali.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />Siku ikwiza siki da Yese dizakuwa fana bendela. Dizakuwa chilaguso kwa wanhu wa zisi zose weze kumwake, na hanhu hake ha kuhumula hezahishimigwa. <verse eid="ISA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Siku ikwiza Mndewa Mulungu kezawabweleza kaidi wanhu wake wasigale kulawa isi ya Ashulu na Misili na Pasilosi na Kushi na Elamu na Babeli na Hamasi na kulawa visiwa va bahali.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />Kezakwinula bendela muladi kuwaduganya wanhu wa zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">kuwaduganya Waisilaili wawingigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">kezawaduganya wanhu wa Yuda wapwililike banzi zose za isi.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Wanhu wa Efulaimu hawezawawonela migongo kaidi wanhu wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">na wanhu wa Yuda hawezawehula wanhu wa Efulaimu.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Wezawahulumukila muna yamakolongo ya Wafilisiti weli ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">wezailumba kuwahoka wanhu wa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">Wezawahuma Waedomu na Wamoabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">iviya wezawatawala Waamoni.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />Mndewa Mulungu kezainyaza bahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">kezagala beho muladi diugole lwanda lwa Efulate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">lwanda ulo lwizaigola vizanda saba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">Ivo wanhu wezaloka kuno wavala vilatu.<verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Kwizakuwa na kulugumbi kwa ichimu cha wanhu wake wasigale wolawa Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:16">fana viikalile kwa Waisilaili viwalawile kuna iisi ya Misili.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtogoza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Siku zikwiza kwizalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">“Nizakutogoza, weye Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">Kuniwonela ludoko, mbali ludoko lwako lunilekela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">na kuniguma moyo.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Mulungu niiyo mulopozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">nizamuhuwila yeye na sizadumba chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu niiyo nguvu yangu na wila wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">kawa mulopozi wangu.”<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Mwizadeng'helela lusita Mulungu vondayawakombole.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Siku zikwiza mwizalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">“Mwing'heni hewela Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">mpuleni kwa zina jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">walongeleni wanhu sang'hano zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">gong'ondeni zina jake kulu.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu wila wa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:5">kwaviya kasang'hana mbuli zinogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:5">Mbuli izo zimanyike muna izisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Mweye wanhu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:6">toweni ng'henze na mwimbe nyila kwa kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:6">kwaviya yeye niiyo Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.”<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kezawatagusa wanhu wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Yano malaguso yoyalagusigwe Isaya mwana wa Amozi kusonhela wanhu wa Babeli.<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">“Musimike bendela uchanyha ya mulima ulibule mibiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">muwagutile watowang'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">muwenulile makono wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">muladi watowe ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Niye niwalagiliza wanhu wasaguligwe kuitowa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">niwatanga wanhu wawo magalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">waja woitogoza kuno wodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">weze kufikiza lungilo jangu da kutagusa.”<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Tegelezeni nyangi kuna imilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">nyangi za bumbila kulu da wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">Tegelezeni nyangi za zisi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">nyangi za wanhu wa zisi ziiduganye hamwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kowaduganya watowang'hondo.<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Wawo wokwiza kulawa isi ya kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">wolawa hata uhelelo wa zisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">Mndewa Mulungu na waja yowatuma kulagusa ludoko lwake wokwiza kuinanga isi yose.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Lileni, kwaviya siku ya nhaguso ya Mndewa Mulungu yahabehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:6">yokwiza fana hulo dilawa kwa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.<verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Ivo makono ya chila munhu yezaboba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:7">chila munhu kezakufa moyo.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Wanhu wezadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">wezakuwa na usungu fana muke yoibasula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">Wezailola kwa kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">milomo yawo izakuwa ng'hwaa.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Siku ya nhaguso ya Mndewa Mulungu yokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">izakuwa siku ya ludoko na ng'hasiliki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">Kezaitenda isi kuwa matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">na kezawananga wahasanyi weli umo.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Nhondo zose hazizalava bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">zuwa vidisomoza dizagumigwa ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">mwezi hawizalava bung'hulo jake.<verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Nizaitagusa isi yose kwa wihi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">nizawatagusa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">nizakomeleza udugi wa wanhu weli na magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">na nizakomeleza magoda ya wanhu watatali.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Nizawatenda wanhu kuwa wadodo kufosa zahabu yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:12">wanhu wezakuwa wadodo kufosa zahabu ya isi ya Ofili.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Nizaugudemeza ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">na vandusilo va isi vizatingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">kwa ichimu cha ludoko lwangu niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Chila munhu kezakuwa fana mhala yosakigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">kezakuwa fana ng'hondolo yelibule mdimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">kezabwela kwa wanhu wake mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">kezakimbilila isi yake iyelekigwe.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Munhu yondayatekigwe kezahomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:15">wose wondawagwiligwe wezakomigwa na panga.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Wana ving'hele wezahondigwa haulongozi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:16">wezahokigwa kaye zawo na iwake zawo wezakwangaligwa.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />“Nizawakong'hela Wamedi weze kuwatowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:17">wanhu waja hawagesa hela na hawamelela mate zahabu inogile.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Misale yawo izawakoma wabwanga na hawezawawonela ubazi wana ving'hele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:18">iviya hawezawalola wana kwa ubazi.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Mulungu kezadinanga bululu da Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">fana viyanangile mabululu ya Sodoma na Gomola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">Babeli diwa bululu dinogile na kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">wanhu wake woigoda ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">mbali Mulungu kezadinanga.<verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Wanhu hawezakala umo kaidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">Habule mfosanzila yondayazenge hema jake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">na habule mdimi yondayadime ng'hondolo wake umo.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Mbali wanyama wa kuchuwala wezagona umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">mbwizi wezamemeza kaye za bululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">na bundi wezakala umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">na dondolo wezakwangala umo.<verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Fisi wezalila muna zimhongono zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">matukwa wezawoneka muna zikaye zawo ng'hulu na zinogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">Lusita lwa kutagusigwa Babeli lwa habehi na siku zake hazongezigwe.”<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Mulungu wobwela kumwawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kezauwonela ubazi welesi wa Yakobo, kezawasagula Waisilaili kaidi na kuwabweleza muna iisi yawo wenyewo, iviya wageni wezakwiza na kukala na wanhu wa kaye ya Yakobo. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wezawataza Waisilaili kubwela muna iisi yawo wenyewo, nawo Waisilaili wezawatawala wanhu wa zisi izo na wezakuwa watumwa wawo. Lelo waja wawatekile wezatekigwa na Waisilaili. Wezawatawala waja wawagazile.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume wa Babeli kohumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Mweye Waisilaili, lusita Mndewa Mulungu vondayamtendeni muhumule kulawa muna yamagayo na mawine na sang'hano ndala, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />mwizakwimba wila uno wa kumkeweza mfalume wa Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:4">“Munhu yogaza kakeng'enhigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:4">ukali wake ukasangigwa.<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kaugwisa utawala wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:5">kazibena fimbo za watawala.<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />Wawo wawawonela ludoko wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">wawatowa dimwe kwa dimwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">na kuwatawala kwa ludoko ng'hani na kuwagaza.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Mbali sambi wanhu wa zisi zose wohumula kwa tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:7">wokwimba kwa kudeng'helela.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Mibiki ya misonobali na mielezi ya Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">yodeng'helela haulongozi wawo na yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">‘Kwaviya mugwisigwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">habule yondayeze kuchikanha.’<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />“Kuzimu kusamhuka muladi kukuhokela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">Wafalume wadanganike wokwiza kukuhohela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">Wafalume wa zisi zimwenga wokwinuka muna ivigoda vawo va chifalume.<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Wose wezakulongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">‘Sambi weye kuwa nyondenyonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">na kulinga fana cheye.<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Ukulu wako wohulumusigwa kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">hamwe na ngoma na nyila za via vako va lusingija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">kogonela funza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">na koigubika mhembele.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Weye mfalume uli fana nhondo ya imitondo ikwaka na kumwemwesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">lola viugwile kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">weye kuwahuma wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Kugesa muna umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">“Nizakwela uchanyha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">nizachinula chigoda changu cha chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">uchanyha ya nhondo za Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">Nizakala uchanyha ya mulima wa Zafoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">kuwoiting'hana milungu, uko kutali na ubanzi wa kasikazi.<verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Nizakwela uchanyha kufosa mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:14">nizaitenda fana Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.”<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Mbali kuhumulusigwa mbaka kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:15">hasi ng'hani muna dikombo.<verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />“Wondawakuwone wezakubunhulila yameso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">wezakwazanywa na wezalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">‘Vino ino iyo yagudemeze isi yose na kuzitingisa falume?<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />Vino ino iyo yagalule isi yose iwe fana bwilingu na kutakamiza mabululu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:17">Vino ino niiyo yawalemese wafungwa wake sekewabwele ukaye?’<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Wafalume wose wa zisi wawandigwa kwa hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:18">chila munhu muna dileme jake.<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Mbali weye kwasigwa kunze ya dileme jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">fana tambi jasigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">mtufi wako ubojogigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">kutumbikiligwa mitufi ya wanhu wakomigwe na zele.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />Weye hwizawandigwa hamwe na wafalume wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">kwaviya kuibananga isi yako na kuwakoma wanhu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wazimizigwe siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Sasala hanhu ha kuwachinja wanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wa wasaho zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">sekeweze kuinuka muladi kuihazi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">na kuyamemeza mabululu yawo muna iisi yose.”<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kezainanga isi ya Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">“Nizaditowa bululu da Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">nizabananga chila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">nizawananga wanhu wose wasigale muna dibululu na welesi wawo.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />Nizaitenda isi iyo kuwa ukazi wa wanyama wa kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">iviya izakuwa na malamba ya mazi yatibuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">Nizawafyagila wanhu wa isi iyo kwa fyagilo da kunanga.” Mndewa Mulungu yeli na Udahi kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kezainanga isi ya Ashulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kailaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">“Chila chiniilungile chizalawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">nizatenda fana viniilahile.<verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Nizawananga Waashulu muna iisi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">nizawabojoga kuna imilima yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">nizawasegezela wanhu wangu nila ya kubabanyigwa na mbahasha ya magayo yawo.”<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Mndewa Mulungu kailunga kuwatendela ivo wanhu wa isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:26">lusita vondayawataguse wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Vino Mndewa Mulungu yeli na Udahi yahailunga mbuli, yelihi yodaha kugalula chiyailungile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:27">Yahagolosa mkono wake kutagusa yelihi yondayamulemese?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kezawatagusa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Mwaka uyadanganike mfalume Ahazi, Mulungu kalava usenga,<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />“Mweye Wafilisiti sekemudeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">kwaviya wehi wenu wahumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">wawo walinga fana zoka dili na sungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">Mbali dihalawa zoka ijo, dizakwiza zoka dikimbila ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Wanyondenyonde wezakwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">na wanhu wopuwa wezakala vinogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">Mbali wanenu wa udele nizawakoma na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">iviya yoyose vimwili yondayasigale nizamkoma.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Mweye wanhu wa bululu, guteni ng'hondo na mulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">mweye Wafilisiti wose dumbeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">kwaviya watowang'hondo wengi wokwiza fana timbwisi kulawa ubanzi wa kasikazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">na habule mtowang'hondo yondayakalame.<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Lelo wasenga wa isi ya Filisiti wezakwidikigwa vilihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">Wezalongeligwa, ‘Mndewa Mulungu kazenga vinogile Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">na wanhu wake wowoneligwa wezakimbilila uko.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s">Ulotezi kusonhela isi ya Moabu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Ulotezi usonhela isi ya Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">“Ichilo chimwe bululu da Ali muna iisi ya Moabu ditimbuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">na bululu da Kili muna iisi ya Moabu dinangigwa.<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Wanhu wa bululu da Diboni wahita kuna ikaye yawo ya kutambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">na hana ihanhu ha kutambikila uchanyha ya milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">muladi walile kwa ichimu cha mabululu ya Nebo na Madeba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">matwi yose na ndevu zose ziweguligwa.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Wofosa muna inzila kuno wavala maguniya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">wolila muna yamakulugumbi na hana yamating'hanilo ya wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">Wanhu wolila kuno wagona chingubingubi.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Wanhu wa bululu da Heshiboni na bululu da Eleale wolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">madizi yawo yohulikika mbaka kuna dibululu da Yahazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">Ivo watowang'hondo wa Moabu woguta nyangi kwaviya wodumba.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Moyo wangu woililila isi ya Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">wanhu wake wokimbilila bululu da Soali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">na bululu da Egiladi Shelishiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">Wokwela chilima cha kuhita Luhisi kuno wolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">muna dikulugumbi dodihita bululu da Holonaimu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">Wolila kwaviya isi yawo inangigwa.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Mazi ya kolongo da Nimlimu yanyala na mayani yanyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:6">mibiki inyala na habule chinhu chochose chikota.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Ivo wasola vinhu vawo na ngama zawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:7">na waloka Kolongo da Mielebi.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Ndilo ihulikika muna iisi yose ya Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:8">matanga yawo yahulikika bululu da Egilaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:8">kweli yafika kuna dibululu da Beeli Elimu.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Lwanda uli habehi na bululu da Dimoni wenela damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">mbali Mulungu kezakongeza ndilo muna dibululu ijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">wanhu wadodo wondawasigale wagima wezadigwa na simba.”<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="s">Wamoabu wopula kutazigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Wamoabu wolonga, “Chimgalile mtawala wa isi wanang'hondolo wa ushulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">chimgalile wanang'hondolo kulawa Sela muna dibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">mbaka kuna umulima Sayuni.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Fana ndege viwolawa muna zimvulu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:2">niivo wanhu wa Moabu viwoloka iviloko va Alinoni.”<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />Wamoabu wowalongela wanhu wa Yuda, “Chilongeleni mbuli ya kutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">muchikalize fana biki dili na mbeho muladi chihumule lusita lwa imisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">Chifiseni cheye chiwingigwe.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Cheye chikale hamwe na mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">muchikalize na wanhu wochinanga.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 16:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">Munhu yogaza kezasegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">na magayo yezamala.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Munhu kulawa welesi wa Daudi na kezawatawala wanhu kwa uwaminika na kulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">kezatenda mbuli zinogile haulongozi wa Mulungu na kezahumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamoabu wezatagusigwa kwa magoda yawo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Wanhu wa Yuda wolonga, “Chihulika magoda ya wanhu wa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">chivimanya viwoigoda ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">chihulika magoda na ukewezi na utatali wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">mbali woigoda bule.”<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Sambi Wamoabu wolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">woililila isi yawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">Wotenda matanga kwaviya wakumbuka ndiya zinogile za Kili Halesesi.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Migunda ya Heshiboni inyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">iviya mizabibu ya Sibima inyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">watawala wa zisi waibojoga mizabibu inogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">Umwaka ifika bululu da Yazeli na kwenela muna dibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">masukila yake yenela mbaka kuna ibahali.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Ivo nolila hamwe na Yazeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">kwa ichimu cha mizabibu ya Sibima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">masozi yonilawa kwa ichimu chenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">mweye mabululu ya Heshiboni na Eleale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">kwaviya ng'henze za kugobola ngano na matunda zihupika.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Kudeng'helela na kuseka kumala muna imigunda ya matunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Habule yoyose yokwimba muna imigunda ya mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Habule kukama zabibu kaidi hana ihanhu ha kukamila zabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Ng'henze zitowigwa lusita lwa kugobola zimala.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Ivo noililila isi ya Moabu fana chinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:11">na moyo wangu wodililila bululu da Kili Helesi.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Wanhu wa Moabu viwolawa kumtambikila mulungu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">viwoiyoha kutambika kuna ichilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">viwohita hanhu hawo helile ha kutambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">havizawafaya.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Mbuli ino Mndewa Mulungu kailonga kusonhela isi ya Moabu.<verse eid="ISA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Mbali sambi Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Miyaka mitatu voipetigwa fana viya msang'hani viyopeta siku zake za kusang'hana, ukulu wa Moabu wizahunguka. Ingawa wanhu wake wengi, wondawasigale wagima wezakuwa wadodo na wanyondenyonde.”<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kezawatagusa Waisilaili na Washami</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Ulotezi usonhela bululu da Damasiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:1">“Damasiki hadizakuwa bululu kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:1">mbali dizakuwa tongo.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Mabululu ya Aloeli yezasigala matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">yezakuwa ukazi wa mabumbila ya wanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">habule yondayawadumbize.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Mhongono za mabululu ya Isilaili zizatuligwa na utawala wa Damasiki wizamala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Washami wondawasigale wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">wezakuwa wadodo fana Waisilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nilonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />“Siku zikwiza ukulu wa Waisilaili wizahunguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:4">na utajili wawo wizakwaga.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Isilaili izakuwa yabule chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">fana mgunda viuwa bila chinhu uhagoboligwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">Kweli izakuwa fana kolongo da Lefaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">lusita wanhu wahakomeleza kugobola.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Wezasigala wadodo fana viya mzaituni viusigaza matunda madodo uhamala kuhutigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">zaituni mbili hebu nhatu muna ditambi da uchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">zaituni nne hebu tano muna yamatambi ya mbiki ukwima ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">Niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili nilonga ivo.”<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Siku zikwiza wanhu wezamulola mulumbaji wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:7">iviya wezamuhuwila Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Hawezahuwila kaidi chila lupango luwatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:8">hawezahuwila chinhu chochose chiwasang'hane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:8">wezazizeha nyang'hiti za mulungu Ashela ziwatendile na chila lupango lwawo lwa kufukizila ubani.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Siku zikwiza mabululu yawo yeli na mhongono yowayahamile kwa ichimu cha kuwingigwa na Waisilaili, yezakuwa fana chuwala. Mabululu yose yezakuwa matongo.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Kwaviya mweye Waisilaili mumzimiza Mulungu yamulopoleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">hamumkumbuke luwe lwenu lwa kukimbilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">Ivo hata muhahanda mimea inogile na mizabibu imusang'hanila kuitambikila milungu imwenga,<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />hata muhaitenda ikule siku iyo iyo imuihandile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">na kuitenda yalike imitondo iyo iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">mavuno yenu hayezafaya muna zisiku izo za usungu na mawine.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Tegeleza sindo za watowang'hondo wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">wotongoloma fana bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">Tegeleza mbumo wa wanhu wa zisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">wokuluma fana mazi mengi.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Wanhu wa zisi wobuma fana mazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">mbali Mulungu kezawabwakila, nawo wezakimbila kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">Wezawingigwa fana makang'ha viyohembelusigwa uchanyha ya mulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">fana yani vidihembelusigwa na vulavumbi.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Ichigulogulo wehi wochitowa na chodumba ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">mbali imitondo wokwaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">Mbali wanhu wochihoka wezawingigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">Chila munhu yogeza kusola vinhu vetu kezapotwa.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s">Ulotezi usonhela isi ya Kushi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Izagaya isi imemile mbumo wa mabawa ya nzige,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:1">isi ili kumgwazo wa nyanda za Kushi.<verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />Isi iyo yotuma wasenga wogenda muna yamazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">wokwela muna zingalawa zisang'hanigwe na matete.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 18:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">Mweye wasenga womuhita himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">hiteni kuna iisi yenu ng'hulu na igangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">isi ili na wanhu watali weli na mbende itelele, wowodumbigwa chila hanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">Hiteni kuna iisi yenu igoligwa na nyanda.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Mweye wose womukala muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">mweye moimemeza isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">bendela vondaikigwe kumulima, muilole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">na mhalati vondailile, muitegeleze.<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">“Nizakala hupi na kulola kulawa kuna ukazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">nizanyamala fana vuke muna dibung'hulo da zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">fana nhungwe lusita lwa kugobola.<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Kwaviya lung'hali lusita lwa kugobola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">lusita lwa kwalika luhamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">maluwa yopagatika na hamwande kuwa zabibu zikangale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">Mulungu kezadahulila matambi na panga na kuyasegeza.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Fana matambi yayo yakanhigwe na kugwisigwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">niivo yose yezalekeligwa ndege wa kumulima na wanyama wamwenga wa kumbago.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">Vilele wezakuja lusita lwa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">wanyama wa kumbago wezakuja lusita lwa chihuhwe.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Lusita ulwo Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezagaliligwa nhosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">kulawa kwa wanhu watali weli na mbende itelele, wowodumbigwa chila hanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">waja isi yawo ng'hulu na igangamale igoligwa kwa nyanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">Nhosa zizagaligwa kuna umulima Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">hanhu hoyotambikiligwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.”<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kezatagusa isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Ulotezi kusonhela isi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">Mndewa Mulungu kokwiza kuno kakwela wingu dohembeluka himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">kokwiza mbaka isi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">Nyang'hiti za milungu ya Wamisili zomgudemekela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">mizoyo ya Wamisili yogudemeka kwa kudumba.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />Mulungu kolonga, “Niye nizawakong'hela Wamisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">ndugu wezaitowa wawo kwa wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">wakaya wezaitowa wawo kwa wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">mabululu yezaitowa yenyewo kwa yenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">na falume zizaitowa zenyewo kwa zenyewo.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Wamisili wezakufa moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">niye nizayatibula malungilo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">wezapula kutazigwa na nyang'hiti za milungu na wanhu wolola bao na mizimu.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Nizaweka Wamisili muna yamakono ya mfalume msede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:4">mfalume msede kezawatawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:4">Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nilonga ivo.”<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Mazi ya bahali yezanyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:5">lwanda lwa Naili lwizanyala ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Mifulunda yake izanung'ha vundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:6">na mazi ya nyanda za Misili yezahunguka na kunyala ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:6">masavu na matete yezanyala.<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Mumgwazo wa lwanda lwa Naili kwabule chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">Vinhu vose vihandigwe umo vizanyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">vizahembelusigwa kutali na kwaga.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Wanhu wovuwa wezalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:8">wanhu wose wolowa muna ulwanda lwa Naili wezakufa moyo.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Woluka mawalo ya chitani wezakufa moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:9">wofuma chitani wezakuwa nyondenyonde.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Wanhu wotenda usang'hano wa kuluka mawalo wezaholola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:10">na waja vibaluwa wezalongelela.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Vinyandama wa Soani wabozi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">vinyandama wabala wa mfalume wa Misili wolonga mbuli za chibozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">Kodahaze kumulongela mfalume wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">“Niye munhu nili na ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">mwanahina wa wafalume wa umwaka”?<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Lelo weye Mfalume wa Misili, wakulihi vinyandama wako weli wabala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">Wakulaguse na kukulongela mbuli ija Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi iyawalungile Wamisili.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Vinyandama wa Soani wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">walangulizi wa bululu da Memfisi wavwiziligwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">Makolo wawo wawavwizila Wamisili.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kaweng'ha muhe wa tibwilitibwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">wawavwizila Wamisili muna zimbuli zose ziwailungile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">wawa fana munhu yakoligwe yozazalika na kudeka.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Habule munhu yoyose muna iisi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">yawe mulangulizi hebu mkaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">yawe yomanyika hebu hamanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">yodaha kutenda chinhu chochose chifaya.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Siku izo Wamisili wose wezadumba fana wanaake viwodumba, wezagudemeka kwa kudumba vondawamuwone Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kawagolosela mkono wake muladi yawataguse. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Isi ya Yuda izawadumbiza Wamisili. Wose wondawalongeligwe mbuli za isi ya Yuda wezadumba kwa ichimu cha mbuli ija Mndewa Mulungu yeli na Udahi iyailungile kuwatendela.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamisili na Waashulu na Waisilaili wezamtambikila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Siku zikwiza ulonzi wa Chiebulania wizalongigwa muna yamabululu matano ya Misili. Wanhu wa mabululu yayo wezailaha kumuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi. Bululu dimwe dizatangigwa, “Bululu da zuwa.”<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Siku zikwiza hagati ya isi ya Misili hezakuwa na lupango lwa Mndewa Mulungu, iviya kuna imhaka ya Misili kwizakuwa na mhanda ya lukumbuso kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Ivo vizakuwa vilaguso va kumulagusa Mndewa Mulungu yeli na Udahi muna isi ya Misili. Wanhu wahapula kutazigwa kwa ichimu cha wehi wawo, Mndewa Mulungu kezagala mkombola muladi yawalopole na kuwagombela. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kezailagusa kwa Wamisili na Wamisili wezammanya Mndewa Mulungu siku izo. Wezamsang'hanila kwa nhambiko na nhosa, iviya wezamulahila Mndewa Mulungu vilaho na kuvifikiza. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawagalila hulo Wamisili na kuwahonya. Wezambwelela, nayo kezawategeleza mbuli zawo ziwapulile na kuwahonya.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Siku izo kwizakuwa na kulugumbi dilawa isi ya Misili kuhita isi ya Ashulu. Waashulu wezahita isi ya Misili na Wamisili wezahita isi ya Ashulu. Wamisili na Waashulu wezatambika hamwe. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Siku izo Waisilaili wezapetigwa hamwe na Wamisili na Waashulu. Wanhu wa zisi izo wezawatemela mate wanhu wamwenga. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Mndewa Mulungu yeli na Udahi kezawatemela mate na kulonga, “Watemeligwe mate Wamisili wanhu wangu na Waashulu sang'hano ya makono yangu na Waisilaili woniwasagule kuwa wanhu wangu.”<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s">Isaya kolagusa isi ya Misili na Kushi vozigumigwa chinyala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Mfalume Saligoni wa Ashulu kamtuma mkulu wake wa watowang'hondo yahite kuna dibululu da Ashidodi. Nayo kaditowa na kaditeka. <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />Lusita ulwo Mulungu kalonga kufosela Isaya mwana wa Amozi. Mulungu kamulongela, “Vula walo da guniya diuvalile na vilatu viuvalile.” Isaya katenda ivo, kakala yogenda ukengele na bila vilatu.<verse eid="ISA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Msang'hani wangu Isaya kakala yogenda ukengele na bila vilatu kwa miyaka mitatu, kuwa chilaguso cha mbuli yondailawilile muna iisi ya Misili na muna iisi ya Kushi. <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />Mfalume wa Ashulu kezawasola mateka Wamisili na Wakushi, wakulu na wadodo. Wezasoligwa na wezagenda ukengele na bila vilatu kuno madako kunze muladi Wamisili wagumigwe chinyala. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Maabaho wose waihuwile isi ya Kushi na kuigodela isi ya Misili wezadumba na kugumigwa chinyala. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Lusita ulwo wanhu wokala mhwani wezalonga, ‘Loleni chowachipatile wanhu wochiwahuwile na kuwakimbilila wachitaze na wachilopole na mfalume wa Ashulu. Vino cheye chodahaze kuhonyokwa?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s">Ulotezi wa kunangigwa kwa bululu da Babeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Ulotezi usonhela bwilingu dili habehi na bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">Fana vulavumbi vidibuma kulawa kusi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">niivo wehi viwokwiza kulawa kudibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">kulawa kuna iisi idumbiza.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Nilagusigwa malaguso ya kudumbiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">wanhu wasede wotenda usede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">wananzi wonanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Mweye watowang'hondo wa Elamu hiteni mukaitowe ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">mweye watowang'hondo wa Media dizingeni dibululu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Mulungu kezayasegeza magayo yose yoyagaligwe na bululu da Babeli.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Kwa malaguso yayo nidumba ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">nipata usungu ng'hani fana usungu wa mwanamke yoibasula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">nidumba kwa mbuli inihulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">na nyazanywa kwa mbuli iniwone.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Moyo wangu udinhila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">na nigudemeka kwa kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">nilonda ichigulogulo chifike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">mbali vichifikile chinidumbiza.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Ndiya isasaligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">malili yatandikigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">wanhu waja na kung'wa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">Bahaja dizi dihulikika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">“Inukeni mweye watawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">Sasaleni via va ng'hondo.”<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:6">“Hita ukeke mkalizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:6">yalonge chila mbuli iyowona.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Yahawona bumbila da wakwelafalasi waidi waidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">na wakwelangamia na wakwelamhunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">yakale meso.”<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Maabaho mkalizi iyo kalandula dizi, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:8">“Mwenevale, imisi yose nima kuna dilingo da kukalizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:8">nikaliza ichilo chose.”<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Lola bumbila dokwiza, wakwela falasi waidi waidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">Wolonga, “Bululu da Babeli dihumigwa, dihumigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">nyang'hiti zake zose za milungu zasigwa hasi na zibenigwa.”<verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Mweye Waisilaili, wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">mweye mutwangigwe na kubetigwa fana ngano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">lelo nomulongelani mbuli zonizihulike kwa Mndewa Mulungu yeli na Udahi, Mulungu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulotezi usonhela isi ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Ulotezi usonhela isi ya Edomu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">Nihulika munhu konitanga kwa dizi kulu kulawa Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">“Mkalizi, ichilo chomala zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">Kuna mbuli imwenga yoyose ichilo cha diyelo?”<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Mkalizi kedika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">“Imitondo yokwiza na ichilo iviya yokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">uhalonda kuuza kaidi, ubwele hamwande uuze.”<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulotezi kusonhela isi ya Alabiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Ulotezi usonhela isi ya Alabiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:13">Mweye womuwapapiza mbahasha ngamia kulawa Dedani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:13">womukwika lago muna ichibago ya Alabiya,<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />mweye womukala muna iisi ya Tema, muweng'he mazi wanhu weli na ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:14">muwagalile ndiya waja wogendagenda.<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Kwaviya wakimbila zele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:15">mazele yanoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:15">wakimbila mhinde zikwegigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:15">na wakimbila ng'hondo ng'hulu.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela, “Kwa lusita lwa mwaka umwe, bila kongezeka hebu kuhunguka, ukulu wose wa isi ya Kedali wizamala. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Wakwega mhinde hagati ya magalu wa wanhu wa Kedali niiwawo wadodo wondawasigale. Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nilonga ivo.”<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s">Ulotezi usonhela bululu da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Ulotezi uno usonhela kolongo da malaguso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:1">Habali wanhu wose wakwela kuna ivisuwili vawo vibadagale kudeng'helela?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Habali modeng'helela na kulandula madizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">habali bululu jose disangalala na dimema ng'henze?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">Wanhu wakomigwe hawakomigwe na zele na hawakomigwe kuing'hondo.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Wakulu wa watowang'hondo wako wose wakimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">watekigwa wang'hali hawanakwega msale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">Wawo wose wasoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">ingawa wakala wakimbila kutali.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Lekamana nomulongelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">“Nilekeni nilile kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">kwa ichimu cha kunangigwa kwa wanhu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">Sekemugeze kunigela moyo.”<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kasagula siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">siku ya tibwilitibwili na kuibojoga na kudumba ng'hani muna dikolongo da malaguso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">Ng'huta za bululu zibomoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">iviya ndilo ya wakaya wake yohulikika mbaka kuna imilima.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Watowang'hondo wa Elamu wapapa misale na mhinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:6">wakwelafalasi weza na matololi yobululigwa na falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:6">watowang'hondo wa Kili wazisasala ngao zawo.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Weye Yelusalemu, mabawe yako yanogile yamema matololi ya kubululigwa na falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:7">wakwelafalasi wamala kuisasala muna zinyivi zing'hulu za bululu.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Mulungu kasegeza ukalizi muna iisi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:8">siku iyo muhita kusola via va ng'hondo vikigwe muna ikaye itangigwa kaye ya muimbago.<verse eid="ISA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Muwona nyatu za ng'huta za bululu da Daudi kuwa nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:9">iviya musola mazi kulawa kudilamba dili hasi.<verse eid="ISA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Muzilaula kaye za Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:10">muzibomola kaye zimwenga muladi kupata mabwe ya kuzengela ng'huta za bululu.<verse eid="ISA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Mgati ya ng'huta izo muhimba mfulunda wa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">mazi yayo yalawa lamba da umwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">Mbali hamuhuwile Mulungu yoyailungile mbuli zino zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">hamumgesile yeye yailungile mbuli zino umwaka.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Siku iyo Mndewa Mulungu yeli na Udahi kamulondani mulile na mulave masozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:12">muwegule yamatwi na muvale maguniya.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Mbali mweye musekelela na kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">muchinja ng'ombe na ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">muja nyama na kung'wa divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">Iviya mulonga, “Leka chije na kung'wa kwaviya igolo chizadanganika.”<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kaniloteza, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:14">“Kweli hawezalekelelwa wihi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:14">wezadanganika na hawezalekelelwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:14">Niye Mndewa Mulungu Nili na Udahi nilonga ivo.”<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shebina kozumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Mndewa Mulungu yeli na Udahi kanilongela nihite kwa Shebina, ndolezi wa kaye ya mfalume, nimulongele,<verse eid="ISA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />“Kotenda choni hano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:16">Vino yelihi yakutogolele uwandigwe hano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:16">mbaka koihimbila leme muna uluwe lwa mulima?<verse eid="ISA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />Lola weye kuna nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:17">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kezakugwila na kukwasa kutali ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Kezakuzingiliza na kezakwasa fana mpila mbaka muna iisi ngalamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">Kwizadanganikila uko habehi na matololi yako ya kubululigwa na falasi yougodela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">weye kuiguma chinyala kaye ya mfalume wako.<verse eid="ISA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Mndewa Mulungu kezakusegeza muna ukulu wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:19">na kukulava hanhu hawili.”<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />Siku iyo nizamtanga msang'hani wangu Eliakimu mwana wa Hilikia. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Nizamvaza walo jako diuvala, nizamfunga mkwiji wako na kumwing'ha ukulu wako, iyo kezakuwa tata kwa wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu na wanhu wa Yuda. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Nizakwika muna diyega jake luvugulo lwa lukolo lwa Daudi. Yahavugula habule yodaha kuhinda na yahahinda habule yodaha kuvugula. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Nizamgangamiza Eliakimu fana msumali muna ing'huta, nayo kezahishimigwa muna ikaye ya tati yake. <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Wanhu wose wa kaye yake na lukolo lwake, wadodo na wakulu wotumbika kumwake fana nongo na mahamha viyotumbikigwa muna ing'huta.<verse eid="ISA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, “Siku iyo msumali ugongomigwe muna ing'huta wizalagala. Wizabeneka na kugwa kwa nzamo woutumbikiligwe.” Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s">Ulotezi usonhela mabululu ya Tilo na Sidoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Ulotezi usonhela bululu da Tilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">Mweye wasang'hani muna zimeli zilawa Talishishi muwe na ndilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">kwaviya bululu da Tilo dinangigwa na dilekigwa bila kaye na bila bandali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">Vimufikile isi ya Kitimu, muhulika mbuli iyo.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Mweye womukala mhwani, nyamaleni hupi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:2">Mtende matanga mweye wachuuzi wa bululu da Sidoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:2">niiwawo wasang'hani muna zimeli wawatendile muwe matajili.<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Wagenda muna zibahali nyingi kugala ndiya za Shiholi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">mavuno ya bawe da lwanda lwa Naili yakala faida ya bululu da Tilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">Bululu ijo dikala gulilo da zisi.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Chinyala chako weye Sidoni, bululu dili na mhongono mumgwazo wa bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">Bahali yogong'onda, “Sinakuwa na usungu wa kuibasula na sinaibasula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">sinalela wana wa chilume hebu kulolesa goya wana wa chike.”<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Wamisili vondawahulike bululu da Tilo dimala kunangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:5">wezakuwa na usungu ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Lileni mweye wakaya wa mhwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:6">iyoheni kukimbilila bululu da Talishishi.<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Vino dino ijo bululu da kudeng'helela da Tilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">bululu da umwaka ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">Niijo bululu da wakaya wahitile kukala zisi za kutali?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Vino yelihi yailungile mbuli zino kusonhela bululu da Tilo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">Bululu ijo dikala na wachuuzi wakalile na utajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">iviya wachuuzi wake wakala wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">wahishimigwe muna izisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">niiyo yailungile mbuli zino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">Katenda ivo muladi kuchimala chibuli chawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">Iviya kawaguma chinyala wanhu wahishimigwe muna izisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Mweye wanhu wa bululu da Talishishi, limeni muna iisi yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:10">kwaviya habule bandali kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kaugolosa mkono wake kuna ibahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">Kazitenda falume zitingisike kwa ludumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">kalagiliza mhongono za isi ya Kanaani zibomoligwe.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Kalonga, “Mweye wanhu wa bululu da Sidoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">hamwizatenda dugila kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">hata muhakimbilila kuna ichisiwa cha Kitimu, uko nako hamwizapata mhumulo.”<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Lola muna iisi ya Wakalidayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">wanhu hawawoneka fana wabaho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">Waashulu waitenda isi iyo kuwa hanhu ha wanyama wa kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">waizinga na malingo yawo ya ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">wazibomola mhongono zake na wazileka bila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">waitenda isi kuwa tongo.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Mweye wasang'hani muna zimeli zilawa Talishishi mulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:14">kwaviya mhongono yenu ibomoligwa.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Lusita ulwo bululu da Tilo dizazimizigwa kwa miyaka malongo saba, ulwo lusita lwa ugima wa mfalume. Mbali uhelelo wa miyaka iyo malongo saba, bululu da Tilo dizakuwa fana viwili wila wa malaya.<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />“Sola chinubi uhite kudibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">weye malaya kuzimizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">towa chinubi vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">imba nyila nyingi muladi ukumbukigwe.”<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Ihamala miyaka malongo saba, Mndewa Mulungu kezaleka kuwatagusa wanhu wa bululu da Tilo, nawo wezabwelela uchuuzi wawo na zisi zimwenga fana malaya viyoichuuza. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Mbali hela yondaipatike umo izakwikigwa hakwe kwa Mndewa Mulungu, haizakwikigwa ngama hebu kufisigwa. Hela izo zizasang'haniligwa kwa waja womsang'hanila haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu muladi wagule ndiya nyingi na mawalo yanogile.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kezaitagusa isi yose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kezainanga isi yose na kuileka yabule chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:1">nayo kezavibananga vinhu vili muno muna iisi yose na kuwawinga wanhu wokala umo.<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Ivo vondaiwe kwa wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">wakulu wa nhambiko na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">wenevale na wasang'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">wenevale wa chike na wasang'hani wa chike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">wanhu wochuuza na wanhu wogula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">wanhu wokwazimisha na wanhu wokwazima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">wanhu matajili na wanhu ngayengaye.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Isi yose izanangigwa na kulekigwa bila ya chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:3">Mndewa Mulungu kalonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Wanhu wa isi yose wezalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:4">isi izaholola na kunyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:4">wanhu wohishimigwa wezakuwa nyondenyonde.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Isi izakwambula mwiko na wanhu wake wezaleka kuzindilila malagilizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">wezaleka malagilizo yake na wezabena lagano jake da siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Ivo isi izaduwiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">wakaya wake wezagaya kwa uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">na wanhu wokala muna isi wezanangigwa na kusigala wadodo.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Mizabibu izanyala na divai izamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:7">wanhu wose wakalile wodeng'helela wezakuwa na lugano.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Ngoma zizaleka kudinhila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:8">ng'henze na nyangi zizamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:8">vinubi vizaleka kulila.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Habule kaidi kung'wa divai na kwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:9">upele wizakuwa wa usungu kwa wang'waji.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Bululu dondadinangigwe dizakuwa matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:10">lwivi lwa chila kaye lwizahindigwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Muinzila wezalilila upele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:11">kudeng'helela kwizagaluka kulava masozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:11">madizi ya kudeng'helela hayezahulikika muna iisi yose.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Bululu dizasigala fana tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:12">na nyivi ng'hulu zizabenigwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Fana viya zaituni ndodo muna umbiki wa mzaituni zisigale kwahigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">hebu nhini ndodo muna umbiki wa nhini zisigale kwahigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">niivo wanhu wadodo vondawasigale wagima muna iisi.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Wanhu wawo wolandula madizi yawo na woguta nyangi kwa kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:14">wogong'onda ukulu wa Mndewa Mulungu kulawa ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Wanhu waja wa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa womtogoza Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">wanhu wa visiwa wezaditogoza zina da Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Chozihulika nyila za nhogolwa kulawa zisi za kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">nyila za kumtogoza Mulungu yohumiza voilondeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Mbali niye niholola, kweli niholola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">nizagaya, wavwizi wezagendelela kuwa wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">na uvwizi wawo woiyoha ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Kudumba na makombo na mitego, vinhu ivo vowagozela mweye womukala muna isi.<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Yondayakimbile kudumba kezakwingila muna dikombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">yondayalawe muna dikombo kezanamatigwa na mtego.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">Mvula za gombo zizatonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">na vandusilo va isi yose vizatingisigwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Isi izabeneka beneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:19">izatulika na kutingisigwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Izazalika fana viya munhu yakoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">izahembelusigwa fana chiheha chisoligwe na mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">izakandamizigwa na mbahasha ya uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">iviya vondaigwe haizakwinuka kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Siku ikwiza Mndewa Mulungu kezaitagusa milungu imwenga na wafalume wa isi.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Wose wezaduganyigwa fana wafungwa muna dituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">wezakwikigwa hamwe muna ichifungo kwa siku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">maabaho wezatagusigwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Bung'hulo da mwezi dizakwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">na bung'hulo da zuwa dizakwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">kwaviya Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezatawala kudibululu da Yelusalemu muna umulima Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">Wakulu wezawona ukulu wake.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtogoza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">nizakuhishimu na kuditogoza zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">kwaviya kutenda mbuli za mwazanyo kwa uwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">mbuli izo kuilungila umwaka.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Kuditenda bululu diwe bugulu da msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">bululu dili na mhongono diwa tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">kaye za wageni zahabule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">na hazizazengigwa kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Lelo wanhu weli na nguvu wezakutogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:3">wanhu wa mabululu ya wasede wezakudumba.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Kwaviya weye kuwa hanhu ha kukimbilila ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">na hanhu ha kukimbilila wachiwa muna yamanhesa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">weye kuwa hanhu ha kukimbilila lusita lwa vulavumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">na mbeho lusita lwa vuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">Mhumuzi za wanhu wasede zilinga fana beho disung'ha mhongono,<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />zilinga fana vuke muna dibwilingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">Mbali weye kukomeleza ndwagi za wageni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">Fana wingu vidikikiza vuke da zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">ivo viuzikomeleze nyila za kuhuma za wanhu watatali.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Hana umulima uno Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezasasala dugila dili na ndiya inogile kwa wanhu wa zisi zose na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:6">dugila dili na divai inogile ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Iviya Mndewa Mulungu kezadisegeza wingu da lugano dodiwagubike wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:7">ngubiko ya usungu ya wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kezasegeza nguvu ya ifa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">kezayahangusa masozi muna ivihanga vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">na kezawasegezela chinyala wanhu wose muna iisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">Mndewa Mulungu kalonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Siku iyo wanhu wezalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">“Kweli ino niiyo Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">chimuhuwila yeye, nayo kachilopola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">Ino niiyo Mndewa Mulungu yochimuhuwila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">Mwize chideng'helele na kusekelela kwaviya kachikombola.”<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kezaukaliza mulima uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:10">mbali Wamoabu wezabojogigwa muna iisi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:10">fana mayani yanyalile viyobojogigwa muna dikombo da cholo.<verse eid="ISA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Wezayagolosa makono yawo fana munhu kogeza kogelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:11">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kezaumala utatali wawo.<verse eid="ISA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />Kezazibomola ng'huta nhali za mhongono za Moabu na kuzigwisa hasi.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kuhuma wa wanhu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Siku ikwiza wila uno wizakwimbigwa muna iisi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">“Chinajo bululu dili na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">Mulungu kochikaliza fana ng'huta na mhongono.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Vuguleni zinyivi za bululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:2">wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wengile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:2">wanhu wokwaminika.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Weye Mulungu kowakaliza muna ditindiwalo waja weli na moyo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:3">kowakaliza kwaviya wokuhuwila.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Mumuhuwile Mndewa Mulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:4">kwaviya yeye niiyo luwe lwa siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Kawatenda wanhu wohishimigwa wainyendenyende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">kadigwisa hasi bululu kulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">na kajasa mumsanga.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Lelo bululu ijo dizabojogigwa na wanhu ngayengaye na dizabojogigwa na wanhu wowoneligwa.”<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Nzila za wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile zigoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:7">weye Mulungu utenda goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:7">koisasala nzila ya munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Viuhumiza, chokugozela weye Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:8">Cholonda ng'hani zina jako ditogozigwe.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Moyo wangu wokulonda lusita lwa ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">muhe wangu wokulonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">Lusita vondauwahumize wanhu wa ziisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">wanhu wose wezaifunza kutenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahatendeligwa mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">hawaifunza kutenda mbuli zinogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">Hata wahakala muna iisi ya haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">wogendelela kuwonela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">na hawahishimu ukulu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kwinula mkono wako kuwatagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">mbali wawo hawauwona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile walole viuwalonda ng'hani wanhu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">muladi wagumigwe chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">Moto wizawatimbula wehi wako.<verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kuching'ha tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:12">kuchitenda chidahe kusang'hana mbuli zetu zose.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Weye Mulungu, Mulungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">chilangulizigwa na wandewa wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">mbali siyo weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">lelo chotogola kuwa weye muhala niiyo Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Wanhu wawo wadanganika na hawezakuwa wagima kaidi, wagaluka mizimu na hawezazilibuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">Kwaviya weye kuwatagusa na kuwakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">habule yondayawakumbuke kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu kuyongeza isi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">kuitogoza mwenyewo na kutagamula mhaka zose za isi.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu vichigaiye chikuzahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:16">viuchitaguse chikupula uchitaze.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Fana mwanamke yolumwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:17">viyotugutila mawine yeli nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:17">niivo vichikalile kuulongozi wako weye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Cheye chipata mawine ya kulela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">mbali chilela mbeho muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">Hachitendile chinhu chochose cha kuikombola isi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">iviya hachidahile kongeza peta ya wanhu muna iisi.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Wanhu wako wadanganike wezakuwa wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">na mitufi yawo izazilibuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">Wagonile muna dileme wezalamka na kwimba nyila za kudeng'helela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">Mulungu kezagala nhungwe igala ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">wanhu weli kuzimu wezalawa wagima.<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Mweye wayangu izoni mwingile muna iviheleto venu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">muihindile umo na muifise kwa lusita luguhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">mbaka ludoko lwa Mndewa Mulungu vondalumale.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Lola, Mndewa Mulungu kokwiza kulawa hanhu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">muladi kuwatagusa wanhu wa isi kwa uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">isi haizawafisa waja wakomigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">mbali izawalagusa.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s">Isi ya Isilaili izakomboligwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />Siku zikwiza Mndewa Mulungu kezausola mwele wake ukutwa na mdala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">na kuditagusa ng'onyo ditangigwa Lewiasani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lewiasani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna zisimo za Wakanaani, Lewiasani kakala chilaguso cha nguvu ya bahali na nguvu haiwoneka. </char></note> dizumha na dizinga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">Mndewa Mulungu kezadikoma dizoka ijo dikulu dodikala muna ibahali.<verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Muna zisiku zikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:2">imbeni kusonhela mgunda unogile wa mizabibu.<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu noulolesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">nowitilila mazi chila lusita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">Noukaliza imisi na ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">muladi munhu yoyose sekeyaubanange.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Sipatile ludoko kwa mgunda uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">one kuwile na miwa na mbigili va kunikimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">nihaitowile navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">na kuvisoma moto vose.<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Wehi wa wanhu wangu wahalonda niwakalize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:5">wolondeka watende tindiwalo na niye.<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Siku zikwiza welesi wa Yakobo wezakuwa fana mizizi ikwingila hasi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">wezakuwa fana mibiki isuka na kwalika maluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">na matunda yake yezamema muna iisi yose.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Mndewa Mulungu hawatowile ng'hani Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">fana viyawatowile wehi wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">Waisilaili wakomigwe kuing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">wakala wadodo kufosa wehi wawo.<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Kawatagusa wanhu wake kwa kuwahamiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:8">kawawinga kwa vulavumbi dilawa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:8">kawasegeza kwa magayo makulu.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Uhasanyi wa welesi wa Yakobo wizalekelelwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">Uhasanyi wawo wizasegezigwa ng'hani vondawabomole chila lupango lwa mulungu Ashela na milungu imwenga.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Mabululu yeli na mhongono yasigala matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">yalekigwa bila chinhu fana bwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">umo ng'ombe woja na wotumbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">na wogudula matambi ya mibiki ili umo.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Matambi vondayanyale na kubeneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">wanaake woyadondola na kuyasoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">Kwaviya wanhu wawo hawavimanyile chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">ivo Mulungu yawalumbile hezawawonela ubazi na hezawatemela mate.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Lusita ulo Mndewa Mulungu kezabeta ngano yake kuna iisi ili hagati ya lwanda lwa Efulati na kolongo da Misili, mweye Waisilaili mwizaduganyigwa imwe imwe. <verse eid="ISA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Lusita ulo mhalati ng'hulu izatowigwa. Wanhu wagile muna iisi ya Ashulu na wanhu wakalile kuuhami muna iisi ya Misili wezakwiza na kumtambikila Mndewa Mulungu kuna umulima welile uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kezawatagusa wanhu wa Samalia</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Dizagaya bululu da Samalia, diwa fana kombelo uchanyha ya kolongo kuna uulongo unogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">Wanhu wokoligwa wa isi ya Isilaili woigodela kombelo ijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">mbali hishima yake izamala fana luwa vidinyala.<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kaisagulila munhu galu na yeli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">iyo kalinga fana mvula ya mabwe na vulavumbi kulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">fana mazi mengi ng'hani yokilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">kwa mkono wake kezawasa hasi.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Kombelo da magoda da wanhu wokoligwa wa Isilaili dizabojogigwa.<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Hishima yake izasegela fana luwa vidinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">ukulu uwatawala kuna dikolongo dili na ulongo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">wizakuwa fana nhini za mwanduso lusita lwa mavuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">wanhu wahaziwona wozaha na kuzija bahobaho.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Siku zikwiza Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezakuwa kombelo da hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:5">fana chilemba chinogile kwa wanhu wake wosigala.<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />Kezawalongoza wasemi kuhumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:6">na kezaweng'ha nguvu wakalizi wa bululu.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaya kowazuma walotezi wokoligwa muna iisi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Wanhu wamwenga wakoligwe divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">na kuzazalika kwa ichimu cha kukoligwa upele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">wakulu wa nhambiko na walotezi wozazalika kwa ichimu cha upele na wakoligwa divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">Walotezi wawo waga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">woikwala muna ukuhumiza.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Meza zose zimema madesi na unyolodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:8">habule hanhu helile.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Wawo wonizeha na wouza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">“Vino mulotezi ino kolonda yamfundize yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">Vino kogesa kezachilongela cheye usenga wake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">Vino kezachilongela cheye ving'hele vilekile kong'ha?”<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Kochifundiza fana wana ving'hele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">malagilizo yahamala malagilizo, msitali na msitali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">lusita chino lusita chiya.<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Lelo Mndewa Mulungu kezalonga na wanhu wawo kufosela wageni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:11">na kwa ulonzi mgeni.<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />Yeye kawalongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">“Nizamwing'hani mhumulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Mweye mulegele nizamtendani muhumule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Hano hanhu ha mhumulo.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Mbali wawo walema kumtegeleza.<verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Ivo mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu izakuwa ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">malagilizo yahamala malagilizo, msitali na msitali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">lusita chino lusita chiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">Wawo wahagenda wezaikwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">wezabeneka na wezanamatigwa na wezagwiligwa.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Lelo mtegeleze mbuli ilawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:14">mweye muzehaji, womuwatawala wanhu wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Mweye womuigoda mwika lagano na ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">mutenda lagano na kuzimu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">Mweye molonga mwila haumpatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">kwaviya mohuwila uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">na moutenda uvwizi kuwa kimbililo jenu.<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">“Lola nizakwika dibwe muna dibululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">dibwe da chandusilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">dibwe ditogile da bei ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">Munhu yodihuwila hezadumba.<verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Nizaitenda haki kuwa luzabi lwa kulingila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">na kutenda mbuli zinogile kuwa timazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">Mvula ya mabwe izausegeza uvwizi wenu womukimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">mazi yezamema hanhu henu ha kuifisa.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Lagano jenu na ifa dizabenigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">iviya lagano domutendile na kuzimu dizasegezigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">Hulo kulu vondadize dizamgazani.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Chila lusita vondadize dizawakumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">najo dizafosa chila imitondo na imisi na ichilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">Dizakwandusila mwanduso mbaka uhelelo.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">Kuumanya usenga uno kogala kudumba ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Kwaviya mweye mwizakuwa fana munhu yogona muna dikomwa bimhi hadaha kuigolosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:20">na mgolole mguhi haufaya kuigubika.<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezakwima fana viyemile kuna umulima wa Pelasimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">kezawona ludoko fana viyawonile kuna dikolongo da Gibeoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">Kezafikiza sang'hano yake ya kuwatagusa.<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Lelo lekeni kuzeha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">buleivo minyololo yenu izatoga ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kanilongela kuwa kailunga kuitimbula isi yose.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubala wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Kingeni digutwi mutegeleze chinilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:23">mutegeleze vinogile mbuli zangu.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Vino mulimi yolonda kuhanda mbeyu kogendelela kulima lusita lose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:24">Vino kogendelela kuhimbula na kutulatula madongo?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Yahakomeleza kulima mgunda wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">kohanda mbeyu za binzali na binzali sisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">kohanda ngano hanhu hake na shayili hanhu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">na kohanda uhemba hanhu hake.<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Kwaviya Mulungu wake komulongela na komfunza viyolondeka kumsang'hanila.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Ng'hunde hazihwagigwa kwa chiya chikutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:27">iviya mbeyu za viungo hazihululigwa kwa tololi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:27">mbali ng'hunde zohwagigwa kwa biki na mbeyu za vilungo kwa fimbo.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Munhu yolima kodunda ngano yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">hagendelela kuhwaga lusita lose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">Kavimanya kuhwaga na taili da tololi da kuhwagila uchanyha yake, mbali haidunda.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Udahi uno wolawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:29">Malungilo yake yokwazanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:29">iviya ubala wake wafosa ubala wa wanhu wose.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s">Bululu da Yelusalemu dozingigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Mwizagaya mweye wanhu wa Alieli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alieli niijo bululu da Yelusalemu.</char></note> bululu diyakalile Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:1">Miyaka yogendelela na madugila yenu yogendelela, mbali uzidilwa wokwiza.<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Nizadizinga bululu da Alieli kwa bumbila da watowang'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">wanhu wake wezalila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">kumwangu dizakuwa fana hanhu ha kukong'hela moto kuna ulupango.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Nizakwika watowang'hondo waditowe bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:3">nizadizinga na kuditowa.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Mwizagwisigwa hasi ng'hani muna umsanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">mwizaguta muna dileme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">mbuli zenu zizalawa uko kumsanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">madizi yenu yezalawa mumsanga fana mizimu.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Bumbila da wehi wenu dizakuwa fana timbwisi vidihembeluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:5">wasede wezakuwa fana makang'ha yohembelusigwa na mbeho.<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kezakwiza kuwataza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:6">kezakwiza na mibumo na gudemeko da isi na dizi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:6">kezakwiza na beho na vulavumbi na moto utimbula.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Baho watowang'hondo wa zisi zose woditowa bululu da Alieli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">wose wobananga mhongono zake na kuwawonela wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">wezazimizigwa fana nzozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">fana malaguso ya ichilo.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Mabumbila yayo yoditowa bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">yezakuwa fana munhu yeli na nzala na kolota yoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">mbali yahalamka kuwona yang'hali na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">yezakuwa fana munhu yeli na ng'hilu na kolota yong'wa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">mbali yahalamka kowona yang'hali na ng'hilu.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Lelo mweye gendeleleni kuwa wabozi na kwazaganyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">mutulike yameso sekemulole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">Mukoligwe mbali siyo kwa divai, mzazalike mbali siyo kwa upele.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zondazilawilile kwa kulema kuzumigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kamtendani muwe na nhongo ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:10">kagubika meso yenu mweye walotezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:10">kamgubikani yamatwi mweye watowabao.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Kwaviya kumwenu mweye malaguso yano yose yalinga fana usenga wandikigwa muna ichitabu chisingigwe na uhula. Uhamgala munhu yoyose yavimanyile kusoma na uhamulongela, “Unisomele chitabu chino,” kezalonga, “Sidaha, kwaviya chisingigwa na uhula.” <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Hebu uhamwing'ha munhu yoyose hadahile kusoma na uhamulongela, “Unisomele chitabu chino,” kezalonga, “Sidaha kusoma.”<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">“Wanhu wano wonitambikila mmilomo muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">mbali mizoyo yawo yakutali na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">wonitambikila kwa kusondelela mbuli zowafunzigwe na wanhu.<verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Ivo nizawatendela kaidi mbuli za kwazanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">mbuli za kudumbiza na kwazanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">Ubala wa wabala wizamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">umanyi wa wanhu wavimanyile wizasegezigwa.”<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Huwilo da siku zikwiza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Mwizagaya mweye mumfisa Mndewa Mulungu malungilo yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">mweye musang'hana mbuli zenu muna diziza na molonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">“Vino yelihi yochiwona?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">Vino yelihi yodaha kuvimanya mbuli zochitenda?”<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Mweye mohindula mbuli uchanyha hasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Vino ulongo ulinga fana munhu yolumba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Nongo haidaha kumulongela yailumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">“Weye hunilumbile.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Chinhu chilumbigwe hachidaha kumulongela yachilumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">“Weye huvimanyile chochose.”<verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Lung'hali lusita luguhi mbago ya Lebanoni izagalusigwa kuwa mgunda uli na ulongo unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:17">iviya mgunda uli na ulongo unogile wizagalusigwa kuwa mbago.<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Siku iyo wasuwamagutwi wezahulika usenga usomigwa muna ivitabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:18">na vipofu wezakwandusa kuwona.<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Wanyendanyenda wezamdeng'helela Mndewa Mulungu kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:19">iviya wanhu wolonda kutazigwa wezamdeng'helela Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Wasede wezakwaga na wakewezi wezakwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:20">na wanhu wose wogesa mbuli zihile wezanangigwa.<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />Wanhu wawo wovavagiza mbuli kuna ichitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:21">wolava lushwa kwa wasemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:21">na wolonga uvwizi muladi ngayengaye watagusigwe.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu yamkombole Bulahimu kolonga kusonhela welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">“Welesi wa Yakobo hawezagumigwa chinyala kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">hawezaidulika kaidi kwa chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Vondawawawone wana wawo woniwalumbile niye mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">wezaditogoza zina jangu jelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">kweli wezanidumba niye Mulungu Yelile wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">na wezanitambikila niye Mulungu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Wanhu wabozi wezavimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:24">na wanhu wolongelela wezatogola kufunzigwa.”<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s">Ubozi wa kuilumba na Wamisili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">“Wezagaya wanangu wonilema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">waja wolonda kutenda voilonda mizoyo yawo na siyo vonilonda niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">woitogolela kutenda lagano diya hadilawile muna umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">woimemezela uhasanyi.<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Wohita Misili bila kulongeligwa na niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">Wolonda kutazigwa na mfalume wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">ivo wakimbilile kuna iisi ya Misili wakakalizigwe nayo.<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Mbali wahakalizigwa na mfalume wa Misili wezapata chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:3">sisila da Misili dizawagalila chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Ingawa vinyandama wawo wafika bululu da Soani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:4">na wasenga wawo wafika muna dibululu da Hanesi,<verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />wose wezagumigwa chinyala kwaviya wowahuwila Wamisili weli hawafaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">Wamisili hawawataza na hawafaya chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">mbali wogala chinyala na kuzehigwa.”<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Ulotezi usonhela wanyama wa isi ya Negebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">“Wasenga wofosa muna iisi ya manhesa na magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">umo muna simba na mazoka yeli na sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">wowapapiza mhunda wawo vinhu vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">na wowapapiza ngamia ngama zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">wavigale kwa wanhu hawafaya chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Kwaviya kutazigwa na wanhu wa Misili hakufaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:7">ivo noitanga isi ya Misili ‘Lahabu’ ng'onyo haditenda chochose.”<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu hawamtegeleza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Mulungu kanilongela niwandikile mbuli ino muna ichitabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">muladi iwe ukalangama siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Wanhu wano walema kumtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:9">niiwawo wana wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:9">wolema kutegeleza mafundizo yake.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Wowalongela walotezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">“Sekemulole na sekemulave ulotezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">Sekemuchilongele ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">mbali muchilongele mbuli za kuchitogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">laveni ulotezi wa uvwizi muhala.<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Hindukeni na kuleka nzila ya ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:11">sekemuchilongele kaidi mbuli za Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.”<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Ivo Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">“Mweye muulema usenga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">muilunga kubamanya na kuvwiza.<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />Ivo kumwenu uhasanyi uno wizakuwa fana ng'huta nhali ili na lwatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:13">voigwa himahima kwa kusinhukila.<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Kugwa kwa ng'huta iyo kulinga fana kutulika kwa nongo itulike vihile ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">bila kusigala chizae cha kuhalila moto hebu kutekela mazi.”<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">“Muhanibwelela na kusama mwizakomboligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">muhanyamala na kunihuwila mwizapata nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">Mbali mweye hamulondile.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Mulonga, ‘Cheye chizakimbila na falasi wokimbila.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">Ona mwizakimbila na falasi wokimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">mbali falasi wa wehi wenu wokimbila ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Wanhu 1,000 wezakimbila kwa kumdumba munhu imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">iviya wanhu watano wezamdumbizani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">wose mwizakimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">mbaka vondamulekigwe fana biki da kutumbikila bendela vodikwima diidumwe uchanyha ya mulima.”<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kezawatemela mate wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kogozela muladi yamuwoneleni ubazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Mulungu wa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">wamweda wanhu wose womgozela.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Mweye wanhu wa Sayuni womukala Yelusalemu, kweli hamwizatenda matanga kaidi. Kweli Mulungu kezamuwonelani ubazi, vondayahulike vimupula kutazigwa kezamwidikani. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Ingawa Mndewa Mulungu komwing'hani magayo na manhesa fana ndiya ya chila siku, Mulungu yomfunzani hezaifisa kaidi. Mwizamuwona kwa meso yenu. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Muhahindukila kulume hebu kumoso, magutwi yenu yezahulika dizi kuchisogo chenu dolonga, “Koleni nzila ino.” <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Mwizainanga milungu yenu ya hela na nyang'hiti zenu za zahabu. Mwizavasa fana vinhu vambule mwiko kuno molonga, “Sekemuwoneke kaidi.”<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Vondamuhande mbeyu zenu, Mndewa Mulungu kezagala mvula kwa lusita lwake, nazo zizakula na kulava mavuno mengi. Fugo nayo izapata ndiya nyingi. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Ming'ombe yenu imilume na vihongwe wenu wa kulimila wezapata mgina usasaligwe vinogile. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Lusita lwizafika wehi wezakomigwa na malingo yezabomoligwa, vizanda vizakilima kulawa muna imilima na vilima. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Iviya mwezi wizabung'hula fana zuwa na zuwa dizabung'hula miyanza saba ya bung'hulo jake da chila siku, fana bung'hulo da siku saba muna isiku imwe. Mbuli zose zizalawilila lusita Mndewa Mulungu vondayavifunge na kuvihonya vilonda viyaweng'hile wanhu wake.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kezaitagusa isi ya Ashulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Loleni Mndewa Mulungu kokwiza kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">kana ludoko na kokwiza na yosi dofuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">mbuli zake zolagusa ludoko lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">mbuli zoyolonga zilinga fana moto utimbula.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Mhumuzi yake ilinga fana lwanda lukilima ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">mazi yake yofika muisingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">kokwiza kuwabeta wanhu wa zisi na kuwananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">kowafunga nzabi izisingo na kowagala hanhu hawahalonda.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Mwizakwimba fana viya vimwimba muna yamadugila ya ichilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">fana vimutenda muna ingonelela ya dugila jelile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">Mizoyo yenu izadeng'helela fana viya wanhu viwokwela na vilongelonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">viwokwela muna umulima wa Mndewa Mulungu yeli luwe wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawatenda wanhu wose wadihulike dizi jake kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:30">wezawona viyeli na ludoko ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:30">Kwizakuwa na lumwemwe na vulavumbi na mbumo wa ng'huwa na mvula ya mabwe.<verse eid="ISA 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Waashulu wezadumba vondawahulike dizi da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:31">kezawalanha na balati jake.<verse eid="ISA 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />Chila hulo da nhaguso ya Mndewa Mulungu kusonhela Waashulu dizahulikika hamwe na ngoma na bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:32">yeye mwenyewo kezaitowa na Waashulu.<verse eid="ISA 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Kweli hanhu ha kumdanganizila mfalume wa Ashulu hasasaligwa mwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">Hanhu baho niijo kombo kulu na galamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">moto na ngodi nyingi vokwaka umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">Mndewa Mulungu kezahuvila mhumuzi yake muna umoto uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">na kuukwacha fana chibiliti.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s">Misili haizadaha kuwataza Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Wezagaya waja wohita Misili kupula kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">wezagaya wohuwila falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">wohuwila matololi mengi yobululigwa na falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">na nguvu za wakwelafalasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">nawo hawamuhuwila Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">hawampula Mndewa Mulungu yawataze.<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Mulungu kana ubala na kodanganiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">hagalula chiyolonga, mbali kaisasala kuwatagusa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">hamwe na wanhu wowataza.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Wamisili wanhu fana cheye na siyo Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">falasi wawo wanyama siyo muhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">Mndewa Mulungu yahaugolosa mkono wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">wanhu wowataza wezaikwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">na wanhu wotazigwa wezakugwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">Wose wezanangigwa hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kodikaliza bululu da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">“Nizakuwa fana simba yotongoloma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">fana simba yotongoloma kuukala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">Ingawa bumbila da wadimi woiting'hana kuniwinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">sidumba nyangi zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">na sisinhuligwa na madizi yawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">Ivo Mndewa Mulungu vondayahumuluke na watowang'hondo wake kuitowa uko kuna umulima Sayuni na vilima vake.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Fana viya ndege viyokaliza mvulu yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">niivo vondanidikalize bululu da Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">Nizadikaliza na kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">sizaditagusa mbali nizadika goya.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">Ivo Mndewa Mulungu vondayeze kuitowa ng'hondo kuna umulima Sayuni.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Mweye Waisilaili, mbweleleni ija yomulemile kumtegeleza. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Siku zikwiza mwizakwasa nyang'hiti zenu za hela na zahabu zimuzitendile.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />Baho Waashulu wezakomigwa kwa zele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">mbali siyo zele da chiunhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">Wezadanganizigwa kwa zele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">Wezakimbila, wana wawo wa chilume wezatenda sang'hano za chitumwa.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Mhongono zawo zizatekigwa kwaviya wodumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">wodumba na kuikimbila bendela ya ng'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">Mndewa Mulungu yotambikiligwa uko Yelusalemu na yeli na moto ukwaka uko.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume yotawala voilondeka</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Kezalawilila mfalume yondayatawale voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:1">vinyandama wake wezahumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Wawo wezakuwa fana hanhu ha kuikaliza na mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">fana hanhu ha kuifisa lusita lwa mvula ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">Wezakuwa fana vizanda va mazi muna iisi inyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">na fana sisila da luwe muna dibwilingu.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Meso ya wanhu wolola hayezafinya kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:3">magutwi ya wanhu wohulika yezahulika.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli bila kugesa wezavimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:4">wanhu weli na vigagaziko wezalonga vinogile.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Wabozi hawezatangigwa kaidi wahishimigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:5">iviya wavwizi hawezatangigwa wahishimigwa.<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Wabozi wolonga mbuli za chibozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">wogesa kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">wotenda mbuli za kumuliga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">na wokweneza uvwizi kusonhela Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">Wowaleka wanhu weli na nzala bila ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">na wowema mazi wanhu weli na ng'hilu.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Chiwotenda wavwizi chiha ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">na wotunga mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">wowadanganiza wachiwa kwa mbuli za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">hata ngayengaye yahadai haki yake.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Mbali wanhu weli na hishima wotenda mbuli za hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:8">na wogombela mbuli za hishima.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa wanaake wailegehe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Inukeni, mweye wanaake muhumule na munitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:9">mutegeleze mbuli zonilonga mweye wali womuilegehe.<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Uhafosa mwaka umwe mwizagudemeka, mweye womuilegehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">kwaviya hamwizapata mavuno yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">mavuno ya mizabibu hayezakuwa baho.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Gudemekeni kwa kudumba, mweye wanaake womuilegehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">gudemekeni kwa kudumba, mweye muli moyo hole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">Vuleni mawalo yenu na muvale maguniya.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Itoweni zimhambaga kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:12">Ililileni migunda ikalile inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:12">ililileni mizabibu ikalile ihwatuke.<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />Ililileni isi ya wanhu wangu ikota miwa na mbigili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">zililileni kaye zose zimemile wanhu weli na seko na bululu dikalile na deng'ho.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Kwaviya kaye ya chifalume izalekigwa tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">bululu ijo da wanhu wengi dizalekigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">Mulima na lingo da ukalizi vizakuwa ukazi wa wanyama wa kumbago siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">mhundambago wezafosa umo kwa deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">ng'hondolo wezapata ndiya yawo umo.<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />Mbali hamwande Mndewa Mulungu kezaching'ha muhe wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">na bwilingu dizakuwa mgunda wili na ndiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">Mgunda wili na ulongo unogile wizakuwa na ndiya nyingi.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Wanhu wezahumiza voilondeka muna dibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:16">mbuli zinogile zizatendeka muna umgunda wili na ndiya.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Kuhumiza voilondeka kwizawatenda wanhu wakale moyo hole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:17">kwizawatenda wailegehe na wakalizigwe siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Wanhu wangu wezakala hanhu heli na tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:18">hanhu haholile.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Mbali mvula ya mabwe izatonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:19">na kugwisigwa mibiki ya muna imbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:19">na bululu dizadanganizigwa.<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />Mbali mwizamweda mweye muhanda mbeyu mumgwazo ya nzasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:20">na mowalekela mhunda na ng'ombe wailegehe kuja mgina.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s">Kupula kutazigwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Kwizagaya weye unanga bila kunangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">kwizagaya weye ubiduka bila kubidukigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">Uhamala kudanganiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">na weye kwizadanganizigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">Uhamala kubiduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">na weye kwizabidukigwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, uchiwonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">chokuhuwila weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">Uching'he nguvu chila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">uchilopole lusita lwa magayo.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Uhaduma wanhu wokimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:3">uhenuka, wanhu wa zisi zimwenga woimwaga.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Wehi wawo wowateka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">fana nzige viwoja.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />Mndewa Mulungu mkulu wa chila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:5">kokala kuchanyha kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:5">kawatenda wanhu wa bululu da Sayuni watende voilondeka na wawe waminika.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Mweye wanhu wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">Mndewa Mulungu kezamwikani goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">kezamulopolani kwa kumwing'hani ubala na kuvimanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">Kumdumba Mulungu kwizalinga fana chinhu cha hela nyingi kumwenu.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Lola wanhu magalu wolila muna dikulugumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:7">wasenga wa tindiwalo wolila kwa usungu.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Makulugumbi yasigala yabule chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">habule yogenda umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">Malagano yobenigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">wakalangama wozehigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">habule munhu yoyose yohishimigwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Isi inyala na haidaha kwima ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">mbago za Lebanoni zinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">bawe dinogile da Shaloni diwa bwilingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">Mibiki ili kuna dibawe da Bashani na mulima wa Kalimeli yopaganhika mayani.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowazuma wanhu wa zisi zimwenga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:10">“Lelo nizakwinuka na nizalagusa udahi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:10">na nizaitogoza.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Malungilo yenu yose yalinga fana makang'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">chiya chondachilawilile choguma unyolodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">mhumuzi yenu ilinga fana moto wondaumtimbuleni.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wezatimbuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:12">fana miwa viitimbuligwa muna umoto.<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Mweye muli kutali, tegelezeni mbuli zonizitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:13">mweye muli habehi togoleni udahi wangu.”<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Wahasanyi muna dibululu da Sayuni wodumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">wanhu hawamuhuwila Mulungu wogudema na wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">“Vino yelihi yodaha kufunyila umoyo moto uno ukwaka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">Vino yelihi yodaha kukala na moto uwo ulunguza siku zose?”<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Wanhu wowokala voilondeka na wogolosa zimbuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">waja wowokwehula utajili wa kuhoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">na wowolema kuhokela lushwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">na hawatogola kuhulika malungilo ya kukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">iviya hawatogola meso yawo yalole mbuli zihile,<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />wanhu wawo wezakala hanhu haholile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">hanhu hanogile heli na mhongono na luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">wezakwing'higwa ndiya zawo siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">na mazi yawo ya kung'wa.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusita lunogile lukwiza</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Meso yenu yezamuwona mfalume muna viyonogeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:17">mwizaiwona isi ng'hulu iyotawala.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Mwizakumbuka vimudumbile na mwizaiuzagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">“Vino wakulu wa Ashulu wakulihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">Vino wakulihi waja vinyandama wasolile kodi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">Vino wakulihi vinyandama wokwimiliza ya malingo?”<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Hamwizawawona kaidi wanhu waja wadugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:19">wowolonga ulonzi wa chigeni.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Loleni mulima Sayuni kochitenda madugila yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">uko kuna dibululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">ukazi wenu uholile, hema digangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">nzabi zake hazizakanhigwa hata imwe.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Uko Mndewa Mulungu kezalagusa ukulu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">kwizakuwa na lwanda na vizanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">umo meli za ng'hondo hazizafosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">na meli ng'hulu hazingila.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu msemi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">iyo yoching'ha malagilizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mfalume wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">na yochikombola.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Nzabi za meli za wehi zotohoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">haidahika kwamhilila matanga yake hebu kuyanzanza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">Vinhu viwasolile vizagoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">mbaka vilema wodaha kusola hanhu hawo.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Habule mkaya wa Sayuni yondayalonge kaidi, “Niye mtamu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:24">Wanhu wokala umo wezalekelelwa wihi wawo.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowatagusa wanhu wa zisi zose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Kwenhukeni habehi mutegeleze mweye wanhu wa zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">kingeni digutwi mweye wanhu wa isi yose na vinhu vikala umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">Tegelezeni mweye zisi zose na vinhu viliumo.<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kezawawonela ludoko wanhu wa zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:2">kezawawonela ludoko watowang'hondo wawo wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:2">kezawadanganiza na kezawachinja.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Mitufi yawo izakwasigwa kunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:3">vundo da mitufi iyo dizakwenela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:3">na damu zawo zizakilima kulawa kumulima.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Nhondo za kuulanga zizasegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">langa dizavunganyizigwa fana talatasi na kwasigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">nhondo zose zizalagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">fana mayani ya mzabibu viyopagatika muna umbiki wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">fana nhini zinyalile vizilagala.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Panga da Mulungu dikomeleza sang'hano yake kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">Lola dohumuluka kuwatagusa Waedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">wanhu waja Mulungu woyailungile kuwadanganiza.<verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Panga da Mndewa Mulungu dizakuwa na damu na mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">dizatapagala damu ya ng'hondolo na luti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">fana viya mabambala ya figo ya bebelu da ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezalava nhambiko uko Bosila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">na wanhu wengi wezakomigwa uko Edomu.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Ng'ombembago wezakufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">na madang'ang'a ya ng'ombe na ng'ombe walume. Isi yawo izatapagala damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">iviya ulongo wizatibwilizika na mavuta yawo.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kanayo siku ya kulihiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:8">mwaka wa kuwalihiza wehi wa Sayuni.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Vizanda va isi ya Edomu vizagaluka lami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:9">ulongo wake wezagaluka baluti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:9">isi yake izakuwa lami ikwaka.<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Isi izakwaka ichilo na imisi na haizazimika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">na yosi jake dizakwela uchanyha siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">isi haizakwima ndiya kwa nyelesi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">Habule munhu yondayafose muna iisi iyo kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Bundi ng'hengeu na bundi matuwa wezakala umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">Mndewa Mulungu kezailinga isi yose muladi yainange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">kuuhelelo isi izakuwa bwilingu.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Wanhu wohishimigwa hawezakuwa na chochose uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:12">nawo wakulu wezasegela.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Mbigili zizakota muna zimhongono zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:13">masavu na milengeja vizakota muna ya matongo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:13">isi iyo izakuwa kaye ya mbwizi na bundi.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Ng'hanu na fisi wezakala umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:14">dondolo wezaitanga umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:14">vilumbe wa ichilo wezahumula umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:14">umo wezakala moyo hole.<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Bundi wezataga mafinga umo na kwalamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">wezakang'anhula wana na kuwakikiza na mabawa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">chamhanga wezaiting'hana uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">chila imwe na miyage.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Someni muna ichitabu cha Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">“Habule chilumbe chochose chondachiswele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">chila chilumbe chizakuwa na miyage.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu mwenyewo kalonga ivo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">Muhe wake wizawakunzagiza wawo wose.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kazele hanhu ha chila mnyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">kasang'hanila luzabi kulingila isi iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">izakuwa yawo siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s">Wakomboligwe wabwela Yelusalemu kwa kudeng'helela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Bwilingu na isi inyalile vizadeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:1">chuwala chizasekelela na kwalika maluwa.<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Chuwala chizakwalika maluwa mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">chizasekelela na kwimba kwa kudeng'helela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">Chizakwing'higwa ukulu wa milima ya Lebanoni na unovu wa mulima Kalimeli na bawe da Shaloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">Wanhu wose wezauwona ukulu wa Mndewa Mulungu, ukulu wa Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Gangamizeni makono yenu yabobile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:3">yagangamizeni mavindi yenu yabobile.<verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Walongeleni wafile moyo na wodumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">“Imeni chilume, sekemudumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">Loleni, Mulungu wenu kokwiza kulihiliza chisasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">kokwiza kuwatagusa wehi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">iviya kezakwiza kumkombolani.”<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Baho vipofu wezawona kaidi na wasuwamagutwi wezahulika kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Mbetembete wezazumha fana mhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">iviya mabubu wezakwimba kwa deng'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">Mazi yezakilima ng'hani muna ichuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">na muna ivizanda vili kudibwilingu.<verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Msanga wa usoma muna dibwilingu wizakuwa lamba da mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">isi inyalile izafakuka mazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">Hanhu hawakalile mbwizi hezamema mazi na mibiki ya milanzi.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Umo mwizakuwa na kulugumbi dondaditangigwe “Nzila Yelile,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">wanhu wambule mwiko hawezafosa umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">mbali wanhu wa Mulungu muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">Wabozi hawezakwaga muna inzila iyo.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Umo hamwizakuwa na simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:9">na wanyama wakali hawezapatika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:9">mbali wanhu wakomboligwe niiwawo wondawafose.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />Wakomboligwe na Mndewa Mulungu wezabwela Yelusalemu kuno wokwimba na kutowa ng'henze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">Wezabwela wosekelela lusita lose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">wezapata deng'ho na seko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">Luholozi na ndilo vizasegela kumwawo.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s">Waashulu wowadumbiza wanhu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Muna umwaka wa longo na nne wa utawala wa mfalume Hezekia, mfalume Senakelibu wa Ashulu kawatowa wanhu wa mabululu yose ya Yuda yeli na mhongono, maabaho kayateka. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Lusita ulo mfalume wa Ashulu kamtuma mkulu wa watowang'hondo na watowang'hondo wengi walawile bululu da Lakishi wamuhitile mfalume Hezekia uko Yelusalemu. Wema hana dizimbu da uchanyha hana ichilima habehi na dikulugumbi dihitile kuna ulubuga lwa kufua viwalo. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Vinyandama wa isi ya Yuda wawo wahitile kuiting'hana na iyo mkulu wa watowang'hondo, Eliakimu mwimilizi wa kaye ya mfalume yoyakalile mwana wa Hilikia na Shebina mwandikaji na Yowa mwandikaji wa mbuli za lukumbuso za mfalume yoyakalile mwana wa Asafu.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Mkulu wa watowang'hondo kawalongela, “Mulongeleni Hezekia kuwa mfalume mkulu wa Ashulu, kouza, ‘Vino yelihi youmuhuwila yakutaze? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Vino kogesa mbuli muhala uwo ubala na nzewele na nguvu muna ukuitowa ng'hondo? Weye kunibiduka, lelo yelihi yondayakutaze? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Lola sambi koihuwila isi ya Misili. Kuihuwila isi ya Misili kulinga fana munhu yokwamha fimbo ibeneke yondaimuhome umkono munhu yoyose yoihuwila. Vino niivo viyeli mfalume wa Misili kwa wanhu wose womuhuwila. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Weye uhanilongela, “Cheye chomuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu,” nizakwidika, “Mfalume Hezekia kasegeza chila lupango na chila hanhu helile ha kumtambikila Mulungu wenu. Kawalongela wanhu wa Yuda na Yelusalemu kuwa wolondeka kumtambikila Mulungu muhala hana ulupango luno lwa Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="ISA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />“ ‘Lelo muitogolele na mwenevale wangu mfalume wa Ashulu. Niye nizakwing'ha falasi 2,000, one uhadaha kupata wakwelafalasi 2,000. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />One moihuwila isi ya Misili kupata matololi ya kubululigwa na falasi na wakwelafalasi, hamudaha kumuhuma hata mtowang'hondo imwe muna iwatowang'hondo wa mwenevale wangu. <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Vino kogesa silagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu kuitowa na kuinanga isi ino? Mndewa Mulungu iyo yanilongele, “Itowe isi ino na uinange.” ’ ”<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Baho Eliakimu na Shebina na Yowa wamulongela ija mkulu wa watowang'hondo, “Chokulamba longa na cheye wasang'hani wako kwa ulonzi wa Chialamu, kwaviya choumanya. Sekeulonge na cheye kwa ulonzi wa wanhu wa Yuda, kwaviya wanhu weli uchanyha kuing'huta wokutegeleza.”<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Ija mkulu wa watowang'hondo kedika, “Vino mwenevale wangu kanituma nilonge mbuli zino kwa mwenevale wenu na kumwenu muhala? Vino hanitumile kwa wanhu wano weli kuing'huta wondawaje mavi yawo na kung'wa makozo yawo wenyewo?”<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Maabaho ija mkulu wa watowang'hondo wa Ashulu kema wima na kalandula dizi kwa ulonzi wa wanhu wa Yuda, kalonga, “Tegelezeni mbuli ya mfalume mkulu, mfalume wa Ashulu. <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Mfalume kolonga, ‘Sekemutogole Hezekia yamvwizileni, kwaviya hezadaha kumkombolani. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Sekemutogole Hezekia yamtendeni mumuhuwile Mndewa Mulungu kwa kulonga kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kezamkombolani na bululu dino hadizatekigwa na mfalume wa Ashulu.’<verse eid="ISA 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />“Sekemumtegeleze Hezekia, kwaviya mfalume wa Ashulu kalonga, ‘Muilumbe na niye, laweni muna dibululu. Muhatenda ivo, chila munhu kezadaha kuja matunda yolawa muna umzabibu wake na mnhini wake mwenyewo, na kung'wa mazi ya sima jake mwenyewo, <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />mbaka vondanimgaleni muna iisi ilingile fana isi yenu wenyewo, isi ili na ndiya na divai na magate na migunda ya mizabibu.<verse eid="ISA 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />“ ‘Lelo muteganye Hezekia sekeyamvwizileni kwa kumulongelani kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kezamkombolani. Vino kuna milungu yoyose muna izisi zimwenga iwakombole wanhu wake kulawa muna yamakono yangu niye mfalume wa Ashulu? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Vino yakulihi milungu ya Hamasi na Alipadi? Vino yakulihi milungu ya Sefalivaimu? Vino milungu iyo idikombola bululu da Samalia kulawa muna yamakono yangu? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Vino yelihi muna imilungu ino yose kazikombola zisi zawo kulawa muna yamakono yangu? Vino Mndewa Mulungu kezaikombola Yelusalemu?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Mbali wanhu wakalile wotegeleza wanyamala hupi, iviya hawedike mbuli yoyose kwaviya mfalume Hezekia kawalongela, “Sekemumwidike.”<verse eid="ISA 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Maabaho Eliakimu mwimilizi wa kaye ya mfalume yoyakalile mwana wa Hilikia na Shebina mwandikaji na Yowa mwandikaji wa mbuli za lukumbuso za mfalume yoyakalile mwana wa Asafu, wawo wamuhitila Hezekia kuno mawalo yawo yadegigwa kwa usungu na wamulongela mbuli ziyalongile mkulu wa watowang'hondo.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia komuuza Isaya mbuli ya kutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Mfalume Hezekia viyahulike mbuli izo, kadega mawalo yake na kayawala maguniya kulagusa kuwa kana usungu, maabaho kengila muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Kawatuma Eliakimu yoyakalile mwimilizi wa kaye ya mfalume na mwandikaji Shebina na wakulu wa nhambiko walala, wose wayawala maguniya wahita kwa mulotezi Isaya mwana wa Amozi. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Wamulongela, “Hezekia kolonga, ‘Diyelo siku ihile, siku ya kukalikiligwa na kugumigwa chinyala. Cheye chiwa fana muke yolonda kuvumbula mwana, mbali kabule nguvu. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />Yodahika Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako kezahulika mbuli za mkulu wa watowang'hondo yatumigwe na mwenevale wake mfalume wa Ashulu. Kamtuma muladi yamulige Mulungu yeli mgima. Nayo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako kezamzuma kwa mbuli iyahulike. Lelo wapulile wanhu wasigale.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Wasang'hani wa mfalume Hezekia viwafikile kwa Isaya, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />Isaya kawalongela, “Mulongeleni mwenevale wenu kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Sekeudumbe mbuli zouzihulike, mbuli ziya ziwaniligile wasang'hani wa mfalume wa Ashulu. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Tegeleza, nizamtenda yahulike mbuli imwenga muladi vondayahulike mbuli iyo, yabwele muna iisi yake mwenyewo. Uko nizamtenda yakomigwe na zele.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Maabaho mkulu wa watowang'hondo viyahulike kuwa mfalume wa Ashulu kasegela bululu da Lakishi, kabwela na kamfika mfalume koitowa na bululu da Libina.<verse eid="ISA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Mfalume wa Ashulu kahulika kuwa mfalume Tilihaka wa Kushi kokwiza kuitowa nayo. Viyahulike mbuli ino, kawatuma wasenga wakamulongele Hezekia, <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />“Mulongeleni mfalume Hezekia wa Yuda, ‘Sekeutogole Mulungu wako youmuhuwila yakuvwizile kwa kukulongela kuwa bululu da Yelusalemu hadizasoligwa na mfalume wa Ashulu.’ <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Weye kuhulika kumala viya wafalume wa Ashulu viwawatendele wanhu wa zisi zimwenga zose na viwawanangile. Vino kogesa weye kwizahonyokwa? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Wasaho zangu wawanaga wanhu wa zisi za Gozani na Halani na Lesefu na wanhu wa Edeni wakalile Teliasali. Vino milungu yawo idaha kuwakombola? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Vino wakulihi wafalume wa mabululu ya Hamasi na Alipadi na Sefalivaimu na Hena na Iva? Wose wahabule.”<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekia kopula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Mfalume Hezekia kahokela usenga kulawa kwa wasenga na kuusoma, maabaho kengila muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu na kawika usenga uja haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Maabaho Hezekia kampula Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga,<verse eid="ISA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili ukala muna ichigoda cha chifalume hagati ya makelubi, weye muhala uli Mulungu youtawala falume za zisi zose, weye kulumba ulanga na isi. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, gubula meso yako ulole, kinga digutwi utegeleze maligo yose Senakelibu yoyokuliga weye Mulungu uli mgima.<verse eid="ISA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, kweli wafalume wa Ashulu wawananga wanhu wawo na isi yawo. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />Wayasa milungu yawo muna umoto kwaviya haikalile milungu ya kweli, mbali ikala nyang'hiti muhala za mibiki na mabwe yasongoligwe na makono ya wanhu. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Lelo weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu uchikombole kulawa muna yamakono ya mfalume wa Ashulu, muladi wanhu wa falume zose wavimanye kuwa weye wiidumwe niiyo Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Isaya kwa mfalume Hezekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Maabaho Isaya mwana wa Amozi katuma usenga kwa Hezekia, kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili kolonga, ‘Kwaviya kunipula kusonhela Senakelibu mfalume wa Ashulu, <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />uno uwo usenga wangu kusonhela mfalume iyo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">“Wanhu wa bululu da Sayuni, niijo Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">wokuzeha na kukuliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">wanhu wa Yelusalemu bululu dinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">wotingisa yamatwi kwa kukwehula.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Vino weye komuliga yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">Vino komkeweza yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">Lelo komwehula yelihi kwa magoda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">Niiyo niye Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Kuwasang'hanila wasang'hani wako muladi kunyehula niye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">weye kulonga, ‘Kwa matololi yangu mengi ya kubululigwa na falasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">nikwela milima mbaka ludonho lwa mulima wa Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">nikanha mibiki mitali ya mielezi ya Lebanoni na misonobali yake inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">nifika chila hanhu uko Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">nifika muna imibago yake imikulu.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Nihimba masima na ning'wa mazi ya zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:25">nizinyaza nyanda zose za Misili kwa nyayo zangu.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />“Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Vino weye Senakelibu hunahulika kuwa niilunga kutenda mbuli ino kwandusila umwaka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">Chonitenda sambi niilunga mwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">Nikwika uyatimbule mabululu yeli na mhongono yawe matongo.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Wanhu wa mabululu yayo wakeng'heneka nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">wazanywa na wagumigwa chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">wawa fana masavu ya kumgunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">fana mayani yosuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">fana mayani yokota kuna ichisuwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">yonyala yang'hali hayanakula.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />“ ‘Mbali niye nokumanya weye Senakelibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:28">noimanya chila mbuli iutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:28">noyamanya malungilo yako yehile kumwangu.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Kwaviya kuniwonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">na kwaviya nihulika vouigoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">lelo nikwikila ndwano yangu muna imhula yako na lijamu muna umulomo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">muladi nikulongoze konilonda uhite.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">Nizakubweleza kwa nzila iwizile.’<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Hezekia, nizakulongela chondachilawilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">Mwaka uno na mwaka ukwiza mwizakuja ndiya haihandigwe na munhu yoyose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">Mbali muna umwaka weketatu mwizahanda na kugobola ndiya zenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">Mwizahanda mizabibu na mwizakuja matunda yake.<verse eid="ISA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Wanhu wa Yuda wondawasigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:31">wezakongezeka fana viya mbiki viulava mazizi yake muna uulongo na kwima matunda yake.<verse eid="ISA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Kwaviya wanhu wondawasigale wezalawa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:32">na mabumbila ya wanhu wezaibanga kulawa kuna umulima Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:32">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kailunga kutenda ivo, kwaviya kana wivu.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga vino kusonhela mfalume wa Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">‘Hezakwingila muna dibululu dino na hezapigisa misale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">Hezakwiza muna dibululu ijo na ngao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">hebu kuzele watowang'hondo wa kudizinga.<verse eid="ISA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Nzila yondayezile niiyo yondayabwelele.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:34">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />‘Nizadigombela bululu dino na kudikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:35">kwa ichimu changu na kwa ichimu cha msang'hani wangu Daudi.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Senakelibu kokomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kengila muna dilago da Waashulu na kawakoma wanhu 185,000. Wayawo viwalamke imitondo, wafika mitufi chila hanhu. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Maabaho Senakelibu mfalume wa Ashulu kasegela, kabwela Ninawi na kukala uko.<verse eid="ISA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Siku dimwe Senakelibu viyakalile kotambika muna ikaye ya mulungu wake yotangigwa Nisiloki, Adalameleki na Shaleza wanage wamkoma na zele na wakimbilila Alalati. Mwanage imwenga yatangigwe Esalihadoni katawala hanhu hake.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Hezekia kougula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Siku izo Hezekia kaugula ng'hani na kawa habehi kudanganika. Baho mulotezi Isaya mwana wa Amozi kahita kumwake kumulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Ika vinogile vinhu vako, kwaviya hwizahona mbali kwizadanganika.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Hezekia kahindukila ubanzi umwenga na kampula Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nokulamba ukumbuke viya vinikusang'hanile kwa waminika na kwa moyo wangu wose na vinitendile mbuli zinogile haulongozi wako.” Hezekia kalila kwa usungu.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Isaya, <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />“Hita ukamulongele Hezekia, ‘Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa wasaho yako Daudi kolonga, “Nizihulika mbuli ziunipulile na niyawona masozi yako. Nizakongezela miyaka longo na mitano ya kuwa mgima. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Nizakukombola hamwe na bululu dino kulawa muna yamakono ya mfalume wa Ashulu. Nizadikaliza bululu dino. <verse eid="ISA 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />Chilaguso chino cholagusa kuwa niye Mndewa Mulungu nofikiza mbuli iniilagane. <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Nizaditenda sisila da zuwa kuna ividando vizengigwe na mfalume Ahazi dibwele hachisogo migulu longo.” ’ ” Ivo sisila da zuwa dibwela hachisogo migulu longo.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Mfalume Hezekia viyahonile, kemba wila uno wa kumtogoza Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />“Nilonga, ‘Nilondeka nidanganike ning'hali mbwanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:10">Niye nilungiligwa kuhita kuzimu siku zangu za kuwa mgima zing'hali.’<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Nilonga, ‘Sizamuwona kaidi Mndewa Mulungu muna iisi ya wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">iviya sizamulola kaidi munhu hebu kukala na wanhu wokala muna iisi ino.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Ugima wangu udumuligwa na kukomelezigwa fana hema vidibomoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">fana munhu viyodumula luzi lwa lili dimalile kusonigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">Imisi na ichilo Mulungu kakomeleza ugima wangu.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Nigozela kwa kufunya umoyo mbaka imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">mbali kaibena mivuha yangu yose fana simba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">Imisi na ichilo Mulungu kakomeleza ugima wangu.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Niye nilila fana chinega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">nilila fana huwa viyolila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">Nilola ng'hani kuulanga ivo nilegela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, niye nogaya, izo unitaze.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Lelo nilonge choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">Yeye mwenyewo kanilongela na katenda mbuli izo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">Nizagenda kwa kuinyendanyenda miyaka yose ya ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">kwaviya moyo wangu una usungu ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Mndewa Mulungu, wanhu wokala kwa mbuli ziutendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">niye iviya nokala kwa mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">weye kunihonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">muladi nikale goya.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Nipata manhesa ng'hani kwa faida yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">mbali kwaviya kunilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">kuukombola ugima wangu kulawa muna dikombo da kunangila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">kunilekelela uhasanyi wangu.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Kwaviya uko kuzimu munhu hadaha kukutogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">wanhu wadanganike hawadaha kukwing'ha hewela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">Iviya hawadaha kuhuwila uwaminika wako.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Munhu yeli mgima iyo yondayakutogoze weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:19">fana niye vonitenda diyelo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:19">Chila welesi wizaulongela welesi ukwiza uwaminika wako.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kezanikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:20">Cheye chizakwimba kwa via va wila vili na usingija siku zose za ugima wetu muna Ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Isaya kalonga, “Galeni ng'hambili ya nhini na muike muna diihu da mfalume, nayo kezahona.”<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Hezekia kauza, “Vino chilaguso chaki chondachilaguse kuwa nizafika muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu?”<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s">Wasenga wolawa isi ya Babeli wohokeligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Siku izo mfalume Melodaki Baladani wa Babeli, mwana wa Baladani, kamtumila Hezekia usenga na vitumetume, kwaviya kahulika kuwa Hezekia kaugula na kahona.<verse eid="ISA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Hezekia kawahokela vinogile wasenga waja na kawalagusa vinhu vikalile muna yamadungu yake, hela na zahabu na vilungo va kwambikila ndiya, mavuta ya bei ng'hulu, via vake vose va ng'hondo na vinhu vose vikalile muna zingama zake. Habule chochose hawalaguse muna ikaye yake ya chifalume hebu muna iisi yake.<verse eid="ISA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Baho mulotezi Isaya kahita kwa mfalume Hezekia na kamuuza, “Wanhu wawo walonga choni na walawahi?” Nayo mfalume Hezekia kamwidika, “Walawa isi ya kutali ya Babeli.”<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Mulotezi Isaya kauza, “Wawona choni muna ikaye yako?” Mfalume Hezekia kedika, “Wawona chila chinhu chili muna ikaye yangu. Habule chinhu siwalagusile muna ingama yangu.”<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Baho Isaya kamulongela Hezekia, “Tegeleza mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi. <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />Lola siku zokwiza, vinhu vose vili muna ikaye yako na vinhu vose viwakulekele wasaho zako, vizagaligwa isi Babeli. Habule chinhu chochose chondachisigale.” Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />Iviya wanago wamwenga wondauweleke wezagaligwa Babeli na wezakuwa wasang'hani muna ikaye ya mfalume wa Babeli.<verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Hezekia kamwidika Isaya, “Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu iulongile inoga.” Kalonga ivo kwaviya kagesa kezakala kwa tindiwalo na kezakala goya siku zose za ugima wake.<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Mulungu wogumigwa moyo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Mulungu wenu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:1">“Wagumeni moyo wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:1">hiteni mkawagume moyo.<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Longeni na wakaya wa Yelusalemu kwa uhole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">walongeleni kuwa utumwa wawo umala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">walekeleligwa uhasanyi wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">Mndewa Mulungu kawatagusa viilondeka kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wawo wose.”<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Dizi da munhu dolonga kuchuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:3">“Msasalileni Mndewa Mulungu nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:3">mgoloseleni dikulugumbi Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Chila kolongo dizakwinuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">chila mulima na chisugulu vizasesigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">Chila kombo dizasilizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">na hanhu hapaluzigwe hezakwikigwa goya.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Maabaho ukulu wa Mndewa Mulungu wizagubuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:5">na wanhu wose wezauwona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:5">Mndewa Mulungu kalonga mbuli izo.”<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Tegeleza, dizi da munhu yolonga, “Weye lila!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">Mbali niye niuza, “Nililile choni?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">Kalonga, “Lila, ‘Wanhu wose walinga fana mayani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">Unovu wawo ulinga fana luwa da kudibawe.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Mayani yonyala na maluwa yolagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:7">kwaviya mhumuzi ya Mndewa Mulungu yoyahuvila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:7">Kweli wanhu walinga fana mayani.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Mayani yonyala na maluwa yolagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:8">mbali mbuli ya Mulungu wetu yokala siku zose.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Mweye wanhu wa Sayuni, hiteni kuna umulima mtali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">mweye wanhu wa Yelusalemu, kagong'ondeni mbuli inogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">Landuleni ng'hani madizi yenu, sekemudumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">Walongeleni wanhu wa mabululu ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">“Mulungu wenu kokwiza.”<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kokwiza kwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">kotawala kwa mkono wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">Kokwiza na wanhu woyawakombole.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />Kezadidima bumbila jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">fana viya mdimi viyowakunzagiza wanang'hondolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">Kezawapapa hachaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">iviya ng'hondolo wokong'heza kezawalanguliza ugaluga.<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habule yalingile fana Mulungu wa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Vino yelihi yodaha kuyalinga mazi ya bahali kwa makono yake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">Vino yelihi yodaha kuulinga ulanga kwa makono yake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">Vino yelihi yodaha kuguma matimbwisi muna ichia cha kulingila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">Vino yelihi yodaha kuilinga milima kwa mizani?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Vino yelihi yodaha kumulongela Mndewa Mulungu cha kutenda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:13">Vino yelihi yodaha kumfundiza Mndewa Mulungu hebu kumwing'ha magesa?<verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Vino Mndewa Mulungu kampula yelihi yamtaze kuvimanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Vino yelihi yamfunzile nzila igoloke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Vino yelihi yamwing'hile kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">na yamulaguse viilondeka yawe na nzewele?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Wanhu wa zisi walinga fana dondo da mazi muna inongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">na fana timbwisi muna imizani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">Kumwake visiwa vibuha fana timbwisi.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Ngodi zose za Lebanoni ndodo na wanyama wake wose wadodo kwa nhambiko za kutimbula haulongozi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Zisi zose siyo chinhu haulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:17">kumwake yeye vinhu vose visakala na havifaya.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Vino Mndewa Mulungu mwizamulinganyiza na yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:18">Vino mwizamulinganyiza na choni?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Halinganyizigwa na nyang'hiti zisongoligwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">Fundi kozisongola na muhunzi kozigubika na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">na kuzihamba na minyololo yotendigwa na madini ya hela.<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Munhu yeli ngayengaye ng'hani hadaha kulava nhosa ya vinhu vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">kosagula mbiki hauwola na komulonda fundi yodaha kusongola nyang'hiti inogile.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Vino hamuvimanyile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Vino hamuhulika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Vino mweye hamunalongeligwa kwandusila mwanduso?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Vino hamuvimanyile kwandusila isi viilumbigwe?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Isi ilumbigwa na iyo yokala kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">kulawa uko wakaya wa isi walinga fana nyenyele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">Yeye kanzanza ulanga fana panzia na kuupumbulula fana hema.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Yeye kowahumulusa watawala weli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:23">kowatenda watawala wa isi kuwa hawafaya.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Wawo walinga fana maluwa yokwandusa kota.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">Wang'hali kota mizizi muna uulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">Mndewa Mulungu kowahuvila wonyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">vulavumbi dowahembelusa fana mayani yanyalile.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />Mulungu Yelile kouza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:25">“Vino yelihi yondamumulinganyize na niye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:25">Vino kuna munhu yalingile fana niye?”<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Loleni kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Vino yelihi yazilumbile nhondo izo zose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Lelo yelihi yozilongoza fana bumbila jake da watowang'hondo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Iyo yovimanya peta yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">na kuzitanga kwa mazina yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Habule nhondo iswela, kwaviya yeye kana udahi ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Mweye wanhu wa Isilaili muli welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">habali moiyalala na molonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">“Mndewa Mulungu hachigesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">Mulungu wetu hachigesa mbee?”<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Vino mweye hamuvimanyile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">Vino hamunahulika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Mulungu yokala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">iyo yalumbile ulanga na isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">Yeye halegela na hamalilwa na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">habule yodaha kuumanya udahi wake.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Koweng'ha nguvu wamalilwe na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:29">iviya koweng'ha nguvu waja walegele.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Mbaka wabwanga wolegela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:30">na wezakugwa na kuikwala.<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />Mbali wose womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kezawagangamiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">Wezaguluka uchanyha fana masumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">wezakimbila bila kulegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">wezagenda na hawezasinduka.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu koilaha kuwataza Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />Mulungu kolonga, “Mweye wakaya wa visiwa nyamaleni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">Mweye wanhu wa zisi zimwenga muwe magalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">mulawe na mulonge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">Mwize chihite hamwe kuhumizigwa.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />“Vino yelihi yamtangile mfalume yolawa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">munhu yohuma hanhu hohose hoyohita? Iyo niye Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">Niye noweka wanhu wa zisi zimwenga muna yamakono yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">nayo kowahonda wafalume hasi ya magulu yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">Kezawananga kwa mwele wake wawe fana timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">kezawananga kwa mhinde yake na wohembelusigwa fana makang'ha.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Kowawinga na kufosa vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:3">kokimbila ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Vino yelihi yatendile mbuli izo zose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">Vino yelihi yapangile lusita lwa chila mbuli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, nabahano kwandusila umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">na nizakuwa baha siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Wanhu wokala kutali wawona mbuli zonitendile na wadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:5">isi yose igudemeka kwa kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:5">wanhu wose weza kuiduganya hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Chila munhu yamtaze miyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:6">kwa kumulongela, ‘Igangamize!’<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Fundi chuma komtaza muhunzi wa zahabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">Munhu yohonda nyang'hiti za milungu kwa nyundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">komtaza yogongoma misumali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">komulongela yosomelela, ‘Sang'hano inoga.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">Maabaho koifunga nyang'hiti na misumali sekeihagaye.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />“Tegelezeni mweye welesi wa Isilaili wasang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">mweye welesi wa Yakobo woniwasagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">mweye welesi wa Bulahimu mbwiyangu.<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />Mweye niwalavile kulawa kuuhelelo wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">nimtangani kulawa kutali kuna zimhaka za isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">niwalongela, ‘Mweye wasang'hani wangu’,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">nimsagulani na simwasileni.<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Mweye sekemudumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">kwaviya niye nahamwe na mweye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">Sekemufe moyo kwaviya niye niiyo Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">Nizamgumani nguvu na nizamtazani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">nizamwamhani kwa mkono wa wangu wa kulume uli wa haki.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />“Kweli wanhu wose wawawonele ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">wezapata chinyala na kuhumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">wanhu wose woitowa na mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">wezakwaga na kunangigwa.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Mwizawazahila wehi wenu woitowa na mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:12">mbali hamwizawapata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:12">waja woitowa ng'hondo na mweye wezanangigwa.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">nimtendani mugangamale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">Nimulongelani, ‘Sekemudumbe, nizamtazani.’<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Mweye wanhu wa Yakobo mwili nyondenyonde fana wang'onyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">mweye Waisilaili sekemudumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">Kwaviya nizawataza,” Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">Yeye niiyo mulopozi wenu na Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />“Nizamtendani muwe fana chia cha kuhunila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">chili na meno ya sambi na yokutwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">Mwizahuna milima na kuihondahonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">mwizavidundadunda vilima kuwa fana makang'ha.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Mwizaibeta milima iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">na beho dizaihembelusila kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">Mweye mwizasekelela kwa ichimu changu niye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">mwizanitogoza niye Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />“Ngayengaye na wanhu wolonda kutazigwa, wozahila mazi mbali hawayapata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">malakali yawo yonyala kwa ng'hilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">Mbali niye Mndewa Mulungu nizawedika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">niye Mulungu wa Isilaili sizawaleka.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Nizagubula vizanda va mazi kuna ivilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">na nzasa hagati ya makolongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">Nizagalusa chuwala kuwa lamba da mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">na hanhu baho hanyalile kuwa nzasa za mazi.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Nizahanda mibiki kuna ichuwala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:19">Nizahanda mibiki ya mielezi na mibiki ya mikakaya na mibiki ya mijoholo na mibiki ya mizaituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:19">nizaika uko kwiichuwala mibiki ya mibeloshi na mivinje na misonobali,<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />muladi wanhu wawone na wavimanye kuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">niye Mndewa Mulungu nitenda mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">niye Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili niiyo nilumbile.”<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu koilema milungu ya uvwizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />Mndewa Mulungu, mfalume wa Isilaili kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:21">“Galeni mbuli zenu kumwangu na mwize mwiigombele.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Galeni nyang'hiti za milungu yenu ichilongele choni chondachilawilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">Ichilongele mbuli za umwaka zikala vilihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">muladi chidahe kuyagelegeza na kumanya chondachilawilile kuuhelelo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">Hebu ichigong'ondele mbuli zondazize.<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />Mweye milungu chilongeleni chondachilawilile hamwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">muladi chidahe kuvimanya kuwa mweye mwa milungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">Tendeni mbuli yoyose inogile hebu ihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">muladi chipate kudumbizwa na kwazanywa.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Mweye si chinhu mbee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:24">hamudaha kutenda mbuli yoyose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:24">Munhu yosagula kumtambikilani mweye kotibusa.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />“Nimsongeza munhu wa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa yodihishimu zina jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">nayo keza kulawa ubanzi wa kasikazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">Yeye kezawabojoga wafalume fana nhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">fana viya munhu viyobojoga ulongo.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Vino milungu ilihi ipetile mbuli ino kwandusila mwanduso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">muladi chivimanye kuwa mbuli ino ya kweli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Habule yalongile mbuli ino na habule munhu yahulike mbuli ino kulawa kumwenu.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Niye nikala wa mwanduso kudilongela bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">‘Lola wabaha!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">Nimtumila msenga wa mbuli inogile muna dibululu da Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Nilola vinogile ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">mbali simuwone mulungu yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">habule mulungu muna imilungu iyo yodaha kunidika.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Lola milungu iyo yose ya uvwizi, haidaha kutenda mbuli yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:29">nyang'hiti zawo hazifaya chinhu mbee.”<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s">Msang'hani wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Mulole msang'hani wangu yonimtaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">yonimsagule na yoninogeligwe nayo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">Nimguma muhe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">kezawahumiza wanhu wa zisi voilondeka.<verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Hezalila na hezaguta ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:2">iviya hezaguta muna dikulugumbi.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Hezausegeza mtete ubeneke</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:3">na utambi ufuka yosi hezaluzima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:3">Kezahumiza voilondeka kwa kwaminika.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />Yeye hezalegela na hezakufa moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">mbaka vondayahumize voilondeka muna izisi zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">Wanhu weli kutali wogozela mafundizo yake.”<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kalumba ulanga na kautanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">iviya kailumba isi yose na vinhu vose vili umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">yeye koweng'ha mhumuzi wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">na kuwatemela mate wose wokala umo wawe wagima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">Yeye kolonga,<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />“Niye Mndewa Mulungu nikutanga utende voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">nizakwing'ha nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">kufosela weye nizakwika lagano na wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">weye kwizakuwa bung'hulo da wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />Kwizawatenda vipofu walole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:7">kwizawafungulila wafungwa muna ivifungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:7">kwizawalekela waja wakalile wafungigwe muna diziza.<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />Niye zina jangu Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">Sizamwing'ha imwenga ukulu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">na sizatogola nyang'hiti za milungu zitogozigwe fana niye.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Mbuli zinilongile zilawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">lelo nogong'onda mbuli za sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">zing'hali hazinalawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">nowagong'ondela mbuli izo.”<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtogoza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu wila wa sambi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">Wanhu wa zisi zose wembe nyila za kumtogoza yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">mweye wanhu mugenda muna ibahali na chila chinhu chili umo chimtogoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">zisi za kutali na wanhu wokala umo wamtogoze.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Wanhu weli muna dibwilingu na muna yamabululu yose walandule madizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">wakaya wa vibululu va Kedali wamtogoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">wakaya wa bululu da Sela wembe kwa kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">walandule madizi kulawa uchanyha ya mulima.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Wanhu wose wamtogoze Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:12">wagong'onde nhogolwa zake kuna ivisiwa.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kalawilila fana galu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">fana mtowang'hondo yoiyoha kuitowa kuna ing'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">na kulagusa kuwa kodaha kuwahuma wehi wake.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">“Lusita lutali ninyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">nikala hupi na niikimilila kulonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">Mbali sambi nizalila fana viya mama voyaibasula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">noguta lwangi na nohumuzika.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Nizainanga milima na vilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">mayani yose nizayanyaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">Nyanda nizazigalusa kuwa isi inyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">na malamba nizayanyaza.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Nizawalanguliza vipofu muna inzila hawaimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">nizawalongoza muna inzila hawanaifosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">haulongozi wawo nizadihindula ziza kuwa bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">iviya hanhu hadala hezakuwa hahuha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">Mbuli izo nizazitenda na sizapotwa.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Wanhu wose wohuwila nyang'hiti za milungu na wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">‘Mweye niiyo milungu yetu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">wezabwelezigwa kuchisogo kwa chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili walinga wasuwamagutwi na vipofu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />“Tegelezeni, mweye wasuwamagutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:18">loleni mweye vipofu, mudahe kuwona.<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Vino yelihi yeli chipofu ng'hani fana msang'hani wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Vino yelihi yeli msuwamagutwi fana msenga yonimtuma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Vino yelihi yeli chipofu fana munhu ino yonimwikile hakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Vino yelihi yeli chipofu fana msang'hani wangu?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Mweye mowona mbuli nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:20">mbali hamuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:20">magutwi yenu yagubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:20">mbali hamuhulika.”<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:21">kayatenda malagilizo yake yatogozigwe na yahishimigwe.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Mbali isi ya wanhu wake itekigwa na ihokigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">wose wanamata muna dikombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">wafungigwa muna ivifungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">walinga fana ukala ulibule munhu wa kuwalopola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">Watekigwa na habule munhu yolonga, “Walekelelwe.”<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Vino mwizakinga magutwi mutegeleze mbuli ino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:23">Vino yelihi vimwili yotegeleza goya mbuli zondazilawilile hamwande?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Vino yelihi yawagumile wanhu wa Isilaili muna yamakono ya wehi wawo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">Vino yelihi yawalekile wahokigwe vinhu vawo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">Niiyo Mndewa Mulungu ichimuhasanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">kwaviya walala wetu walema kutegeleza mafundizo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">iviya hawayazindilile malagilizo yake.<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Ivo kawawonela ludoko ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">kawaleka wakumbigwe na ng'hondo ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">Ludoko lwake lufika chila ubanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">mbali wawo hawavimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">ludoko lwake lukala fana moto wouwasomile, mbali hawaizindilile mbuli iyo.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kokwika chilagano cha kuwakombola wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Mndewa Mulungu yamulumbileni mweye wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">yeye yamtendileni mweye wanhu wa Isilaili, kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">“Sekemudumbe, kwaviya niye nimkombolani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">nimtangani kwa zina jenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">mweye wanhu wangu.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Muhafosa muna yamazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">nizakuwa hamwe na mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">muhafosa muna zinyanda hamwizakulusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">iviya mwahagenda muna umoto hamwizalunguzigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">lambi da moto hadizamulunguzani.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Kwaviya niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">Mulungu wenu, Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili, mkombola wenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">Nizailava isi ya Misili iwe fidia yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">nizazilava zisi za Kushi na Seba badala ya mweye.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Kwaviya mweye munoga ng'hani haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">na kwaviya nimwing'hani ukulu na nomulondani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">ivo nizawaleka wanhu wa zisi zimwenga muladi nimpateni.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Sekemudumbe kwaviya niye nahamwe na mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">nizawabweleza wanenu kulawa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">nizawazahila kulawa ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Nizailongela isi ya kasikazi, ‘Waleke wasegele,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">na isi ya kusi, ‘Sekeuwagomese.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">Wabwelezeni wanhu wangu kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">kulawa chila hanhu muna izisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />Wabwele wanhu wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:7">woniwalumbile muladi wanitogoze.”<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Wagaleni kuulongozi wanhu wano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">wanhu weli na meso mbali hawalola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">weli na magutwi mbali hawahulika.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Zisi zose ziiting'hane hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">wanhu wose waiting'hane hamwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Vino yelihi yodaha kuchilagusa mbuli zilawilila sambi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Vino yelihi yodaha kuchilagusa mbuli zondazilawilile hamwande?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Wawagale wakalangama.<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">“Mweye Waisilaili wakalangama wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">nimsagulani muwe wasang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">mudahe kunimanya na kunihuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">niiyo niidumwe Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">Ning'hali niye hakukalile mulungu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">iviya hakwizakuwa na mulungu imwenga.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />Niye niidumwe niiyo Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:11">habule mkombola imwenga.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Nigong'onda mbuli zondazilawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">maabaho niza kuwalopola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">Habule mulungu imwenga yadahile kutenda ivo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">Mweye wakalangama wangu.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />Niye niiyo Mulungu na nizakuwa Mulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">Habule yodaha kukwepa nguvu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">habule yodaha kugalula chonitenda.”<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Isilaili wezakomboligwa muna iisi ya Babeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mkombola wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">“Kwa ichimu chenu nizadituma bumbila da watowang'hondo wakaitowe isi ya Babeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">Nizazibena nyivi za bululu jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">nyangi za kudeng'helela za wanhu wa Babeli zizagaluka matanga.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu Yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:15">Niye niiyo mfalume wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:15">mulumbaji wa wanhu wa Isilaili.”<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Mndewa Mulungu katenda nzila muibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:16">hanhu ha kufosa heli na mazi mengi.<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />Kaditowa bumbila da watowang'hondo weli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">hamwe na watowang'hondo weli na matololi ya kubululigwa na falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">kawagwisa sekewadahe kwinuka kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">kawazima fana utambi ukwaka.<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />Yeye kolonga, “Sekemuzikumbuke mbuli zifosile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:18">iviya sekemuzigese mbuli za umwaka.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Lola nizatenda chinhu cha sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">chizatendeka sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">sambi mwizadaha kuchiwona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">Nizatenda nzila muna ichuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">na mazi yezalawa muna dibwilingu.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Wanyama wa kumbago wezanihishimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">kwaviya nizakwika mazi muna dibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">na nizalava mazi muna ichuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">muladi niweng'he mazi wanhu wangu woniwasagule,<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />wanhu waja niwalumbile kwa ichimu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:21">muladi wagong'onde nhogolwa zangu.<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />“Hamunitangile, mweye wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:22">mbali munilegela, mweye wanhu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Hamunigalile ng'hondolo wenu wa nhambiko za kutimbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">na hamunihishimu kwa nhambiko zenu za kutimbula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">Simuwangilizeni kulava nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">iviya simulegezeni kwa kulonda ubani.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Hamunigulile mavuta yonung'hila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">iviya hamunigutize kwa nhambiko zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">mbali uhasanyi wenu uwa mbahasha kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">na munilegeza kwa mbuli zenu zihile.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />“Mbali niye nisegeza ubananzi wenu kwa ichimu changu mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:25">iviya sizakumbuka uhasanyi wenu.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Nilongele mbuli zifosile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:26">leka chilonganye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:26">muladi upate haki yako.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Wasaho yenu wa mwanduso kahasanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:27">walangulizi wenu wanilema.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Ivo nizawaguma chinyala wakulu wa nhambiko wa kaye yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">nizawatenda wehi wawanange Waisilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">Niwaleka wawalige wanhu wa welesi wa Yakobo.”<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Mulungu yaidumwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />“Mbali tegelezeni mweye welesi wa msang'hani wangu Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:1">Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Isilaili wonimsaguleni.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Niye nimuumbileni kwandusila muna izinda za mami zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">niye nilonda kumtazani nolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">sekemudumbe mweye welesi wa msang'hani wangu Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">na mweye wonimsaguleni sekemudumbe.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Nizaitilila mazi isi ili na ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">na kukilima mazi hanhu hanyalile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">Nizawitila muhe wangu fana mazi muna uwelesi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">nizawatemela mate wanago.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Wezasuka fana mayani hana yamazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:4">fana mibiki mumgwazogwazo wa vizanda.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Wamwenga wezalonga, ‘Niye wa Mndewa Mulungu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">wezaitanga kwa zina da Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">iviya wezayandika muna yamakono yawo, ‘Niye wa Mndewa Mulungu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">na kuitanga kwa zina da Isilaili.”<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />Mndewa Mulungu yeli mfalume na mkombola wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">“Niye wa mwanduso na uhelelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">habule Mulungu imwenga ila niye.<verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Vino yelihi yeli Mulungu fana niye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">Muleke yagong'onde na kulonga ukweli haulongozi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">Vino yelihi yagong'onde baho umwaka mbuli zondazilawilile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">Yachilongele mbuli zondazilawilile na wazigong'onde.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Mweye wanhu wangu sekemudumbe na sekemuwe na lugano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Vino simulongeleni umwaka mbuli zondazilawilile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Mweye wakalangama wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Vino kauko Mulungu imwenga hebu niye muhala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Vino kuna mulungu imwenga yeli na nguvu hebu niye muhala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Habule.”<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubozi wa kutambikila nyang'hiti za milungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Wanhu wose wosongola nyang'hiti za milungu ni wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">vinhu ivo viwovideng'helela haviwafaya chochose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">Wanhu woihuwila milungu iyo ya uvwizi watulika yameso na wabozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">Ivo wanhu wawo wezagumigwa chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Vino yelihi yotenda nyang'hiti ya mulungu ili haidaha kumtaza chochose?<verse eid="ISA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Kweli wanhu wose wotambikila nyang'hiti wezagumigwa chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">Nyang'hiti zosongoligwa na wanhu muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">Lelo waiting'hane wose na wailaguse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">wezadumba na kupata chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Muhunzi kosola madini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">koyalumbula muna umoto na kufuwa nyang'hiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">koihondahonda na nyundo muladi kuitenda itelele kwa makono yake yeli na nguvu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">Lusita ulwo lose kowona nzala na kolegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">kowona ng'hilu na komalilwa nguvu.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Selemala kolinga chihande cha mbao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">kochichola na sizi jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">maabaho kochisongola na kuchitenda chiwe fana munhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">Maabaho koika nyang'hiti iyo ya mulungu hana ihanhu hoyotambikila.<verse eid="ISA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Kokanha mbiki wa mwelezi muladi yausang'hanile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">na kosagula mbeloshi hebu mwaloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">Kouleka ukule hamwe na mibiki ya kumbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">iviya kohanda msonobali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">nayo mvula youtenda ukule.<verse eid="ISA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Kosang'hanila chihande cha mbiki uwo kuwa ngodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">muladi yabwinhe moto yotele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">kobwinha moto na kokoka magate.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">Kosang'hanila chihande chimwenga cha mbiki uwo muladi kuisongolela nyang'hiti ya mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">koiteleza na kuitambikila.<verse eid="ISA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Maabaho kosola ngodi zake na kubwinha moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">kokoka nyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">koja na kokwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">maabaho kokala baho na kokotela moto kuno kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">“Kweli mhata vuke, uwo niuwo moto!”<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Kosang'hanila chihande chisigale cha mbiki uwo, muladi kuisongolela nyang'hiti yake ya mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">maabaho koihuwila na kuitambikila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">Koipula, kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">“Weye niiyo mulungu wangu.”<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Wanhu wawo hawamanyile chinhu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">wagubikigwa yameso sekewalole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">iviya nzewele zawo sekewavimanye chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Habule yodaha kugelegeza hebu kuwa na nzewele na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">“Nusu ya mbiki uwo nikwachila moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">maabaho nyoka magate muna yamasizi na nyoka nyama nija.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">Vino nisang'hanile chihande chisigale kutenda nyang'hiti na kuitambikila?”<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Koja maivu, moyo womvwizila na womwagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">hadaha kuikombola mwenyewo hebu kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">“Chinhu chino choniwa nacho muna umkono wangu ni uvwizi muhala.”<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu hezawazimiza Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">“Mweye welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">muvimanye kuwa mweye Waisilaili wasang'hani wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">Niwalumba muladi muwe wasang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">niye sizawazimiza hata chidogo.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Nizilava mbuli zako zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">nazo zizasegela fana mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">niusegeza uhasanyi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">nawo wizasegela fana kungugu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">Bweleni kumwangu kwaviya niye niwakombola.”<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Imbeni kwa deng'ho kulu mweye ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">kwa mbuli iyatendile Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Mutowe nyangi mweye milima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Mutowe ng'henze mweye mbago na mibiki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kawakombola welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">na kaulagusa ukulu wake.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu, mkombola wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">nikulumbile muna umunda wa mami yako, nolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">“Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu nilumbile vinhu vose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">Niye muhala niyanzanza mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">nizilumba zisi zose kwa makono yangu.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />Niye nolagusa kuwa walotezi wa uvwizi wolonga mbuli hazifaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">Iviya nolagusa kuwa wanhu wose wosang'hanila mbuli za uhawi kulonga mbuli zondazilawilile hazifaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">Noyatenda magesa ya wanhu weli na ubala kuwa ubozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">Wanhu wogesa kuwa mbuli zawo za chibozi.<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Mbali nizaugangamiza usenga wa wasang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">na kufikiza malungilo ya wasenga wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">Niye niiyo nidilongele bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">‘Weye Yelusalemu, wanhu wezakala mgati yako kaidi.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">Na yoniyalongele mabululu ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">‘Mweye mwizazenga kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">matongo yenu yezazengigwa kaidi.’<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />Niye nilagiliza bahali, ‘Nyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:27">nizanyaza nyanda zenu.’<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />Niye nilonga kusonhela mfalume Koleshi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">‘Weye uwadima wanhu kwa ichimu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">weye kwizafikiza malungilo yangu.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">Niye nilonga kusonhela bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">‘Weye Yelusalemu kwizazengigwa kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">kaye yako ya nhambiko izazengigwa kaidi.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu komsagula mfalume Koleshi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />Mndewa Mulungu komulongela mfalume Koleshi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">“Nikusagula weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">nizakugangamiza muladi uzihume zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">iviya kuzibena nguvu za wafalume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">Niye nizazivugula nyivi za bululu haulongozi wako.<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Nizakulongolela na kusegeza milima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">Nizazibenabena nyivi ng'hulu za shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">na kukanhakanha mhalalingwe za chuma.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Nizakwing'ha ngama zozifisigwe hanhu hahamanyike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">muladi uvimanye kuwa niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">yonikutanga kwa zina jako.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Kwa ichimu cha welesi wa Yakobo msang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">na kwa ichimu cha wanhu wano woniwasagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">nikutanga kwa zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">nikwing'ha zina da hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">ingawa weye hunimanyile.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, habule imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">habule Mulungu imwenga mbali niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">Nokugangamiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">mbali weye hunimanyile,<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />muladi wanhu wose kulawa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa na kulawa ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">wavimanye kuwa habule Mulungu imwenga mbali niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Niye notenda bung'hulo na kulumba ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">nogala tindiwalo na tibwilitibwili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">Niye Mndewa Mulungu notenda vinhu ivo vose.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />“Weye ulanga, tonya haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">weye mawingu lagaza haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">muladi isi igubikigwe na mazi na ilele ukombola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">Niye Mndewa Mulungu nilumbile vinhu ivo.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udahi mkulu wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />“Kezagaya munhu yoihuma na yamulumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">munhu iyo kalinga fana chizae cha ulongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">Vino ulongo womuuza munhu yoyaumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">‘Koumba choni hano?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">Hebu kumulongela, ‘Sang'hano yako haifaya.’<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Kezagaya munhu yomulongela tati yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">‘Vino kweleka choni?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">Hebu munhu yomulongela mami yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">‘Vino kuvumbula chinhu chaki?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">Mulungu yalumbile Isilaili kolonga kusonhela mbuli zikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">“Molonda kuniuza kusonhela wanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">hebu kuniwangiliza sang'hano zangu mwenyewo?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />Niye iyo nizitendile zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">iviya nimulumba chila munhu yokala umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">Makono yangu yayo yanzanze mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">iviya zuwa na mwezi na nhondo zose vabaho kwa mbuli yangu.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Nimulongela mfalume Koleshi yatende vinhu vonilonda yavitende.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">Nizazigolosa nzila zake zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">Iviya kezadizenga kaidi bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">na kuwalekelela wanhu wangu wakalile kuuhami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">mbali hezalonda maliho hebu vitumetume.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">“Utajili wa Misili na vinhu va Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">hamwe na wanhu wa Seba weli watali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">vizakwiza kumwako weye isi ya Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">vose vizakuwa vako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">Wanhu wawo wezakusang'hanila kuno wafungigwa minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">wezakutumbalila mavindi na kukutogola kuno wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">‘Mulungu wa kweli kahamwe na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">habule Mulungu imwenga mbali yeye.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Kweli weye niiyo Mulungu uifisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:15">weye niiyo Mulungu na mulopozi wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Wanhu wose wosongola nyang'hiti za milungu wezapata chinyala na kwazanywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:16">wose wezakwingilwa na chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Mbali wanhu wa Isilaili wezakomboligwa na Mndewa Mulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:17">hawezagaya na hawezagumigwa chinyala siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Yalumbile ulanga niiyo Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">katenda isi na kuilumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">iviya keka vandusilo vigangamale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">Hailumbile isi muladi iwe yabule chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">mbali kalumba muladi ikaligwe na vilumbe wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">Niiyo yeye yolonga, “Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">habule imwenga.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Silongile chinyele hanhu heli na ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">na siwalongele welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">wanizahile hanhu helibule chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">Niye Mndewa Mulungu nolonga ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">mbuli yangu yokwaminika.”<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />Mweye wanhu wa zisi zimwenga womuhonyoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">iduganyeni hamwe mwize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">mweye mulibule nzewele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">Mweye mopapa nyang'hiti za milungu za mibiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">kuno moipula milungu ija haidaha kulopola wanhu.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Izoni mulonge mbuli zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">mulonganye muladi mufunge imwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Vino yelihi yanduse kugong'onda mbuli kwandusila umwaka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Vino yelihi yalongile mbuli zino umwaka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Siyo niye Mndewa Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Habule Mulungu imwenga mbali niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Niye Mulungu wa haki na mulopozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Habule imwenga mbali niye muhala.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />“Nihindukileni niye mupate kukomboligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">hohose hamwili muna iisi yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">Kwaviya niye niiyo Mulungu, habule imwenga.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Niye niilaha kwa moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">mbuli yangu yonilonga igoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">mbuli yonilonga haizabwela hachisogo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">Chila mavindi yezatumbala haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">na chila munhu kezailaha kunisang'hanila.<verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Wezalonga kusonhela niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">‘Haki na nguvu vopatika kwa Mndewa Mulungu yaidumwe.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">Wose wamuwonele ludoko Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">wezamwizila kwa chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kezawatenda welesi wa Isilaili wahume na wezadeng'helela.”<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s">Milungu ya uvwizi ya Babeli na Mulungu yeli na nguvu wa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Weye mulungu Beli kugwa, weye mulungu Nebo koidulika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">Lusita lumwe ng'ombe wapapa nyang'hiti zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">sambi wanyama walegele wazipapa muna imigongo.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Milungu iyo yogwa na yoidulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">haidaha kuitaza hebu kuilopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">iviya igaligwa kuutumwa.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />Mukungu kolonga, “Tegelezeni, mweye welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">tegelezeni, mweye Waisilaili musigale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">Niye nimkalizani kwandusila vimwelekigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">nimpapani kwandusila muna izinda za mami zenu.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Niye Mulungu wenu sizagaluka mbaka vondamulale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">nizampapani vondamuwe mbaka vondamuwe na uhenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">nitenda ivo umwaka na sambi nizatenda ivo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">Nizampapani na kumkombolani.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />“Vino mwizanilinganyiza na yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:5">Vino kuna imwenga yalingile fana niye?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Wanhu wokwasa zahabu kulawa muna imikoba yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">wolinga hela muna ziningo zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">wamgoneka muhunzi yatende nyang'hiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">maabaho waitumbalila mavindi na kuinonela.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Woitwika nyang'hiti iyo na kuigala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">maabaho woika hanhu hake nayo yokala uko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">Haidaha kugenda haja haikigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">one munhu yahalila haidaha kumwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">na haidaha kumkombola munhu muna yamagayo yake.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />“Kumbukeni mbuli ino na kuiuzagiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:8">igeseni ng'hani muna imizoyo yenu mweye wahasanyi.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Kumbukeni mbuli zinitendile umwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">Niye niiyo Mulungu na habule imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">ona niye niiyo Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">habule imwenga yalingile niye.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Kwandusila mwanduso nilonga mbuli za uhelelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">iviya nigong'onda mbuli zondazilawilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">Lungilo jangu dizafika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">Nizakomeleza mbuli zangu zose.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Nizamtanga munhu kulawa ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">kezanyang'hula fana masumula viyonyang'hula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">iyo kezafikiza lungilo jangu kulawa isi ya kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">Niye nilonga na nizatenda.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Nitegelezeni, mweye muli na mizoyo midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:12">nitegelezeni, mweye mulema haki.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Siku ya kuwakombola haili kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">siku ya kumkombolani yahabehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">nizadikombola bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">na kugala hishima muna iisi ya Isilaili.”<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s">Kuhumizigwa kwa Babeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">“Weye mwali wa Babeli, humuluka ukale muna ditimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">weye mwali wa Babeli, kala hasi hanhu helibule chigoda cha chifalume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">Kwandusila sambi hwizatangigwa kaidi lumondo na yonogeza.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Sola mabwe ya kudundila na udunde mhule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:2">vula chitambala chako na ukwese ng'hanzu yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:2">Kwesa ng'hanzu yako muladi uloke ulwanda.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Ukengele wako wizagubuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">chinyala chako chizawoneka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">Nizalihiliza na sizamuwonela ubazi munhu yoyose.”<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Mulopozi wetu niiyo Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:4">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi ijo zina jake.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">“Weye isi ya Babeli, nyamala hupi na uhite kuna diziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">kwaviya hwizatawala kaidi falume nyingi.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Niwehila wanhu wangu Waisilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">niwatenda wambule mwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">niwaleka muna yamakono yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">mbali huwawonele ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">kuwapapiza walala mbahasha zizamile.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Kulonga muna umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">‘Nizakuwa mtawala siku zose.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">Weye hugesile mbuli zondazilawilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">na hugesila uhelelo wake.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />“Lelo tegeleza, weye ulonda madambwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">weye wiigesa kuwa kokalizigwa vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">iviya kolonga, ‘Niye muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">habule imwenga mbali niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">sizakuwa mgane na sizafiligwa na wanangu.’<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Mbuli zino mbili zizakupata siku dimwe kwa kusinhukiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">kwizakwagiza wanago na kuwa mgane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">ingawa weye kwa muhawi galu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">na kuna nguvu nyingi za uganga.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />Kuzihuwila mbuli zako zihile na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">‘Habule munhu yoniwona.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">Ubala wako na kuvimanya kwako kukuvwizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">kulonga muna umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">‘Niye iyo niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">habule munhu yalingile fana niye.’<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Mbali mahulo yezakupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">hwizadaha kuyakimbila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">Kwizapata hulo hudaha kudigwaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">Mahulo yezalawilila kwa kusinhukila na hwizadaha kuyakimilila.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />Gendelela na uhawi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">uwanduse kuudodo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">yodahika kwizahuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">yodahika kwizawadumbiza wehi wako.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Weye kuilegeza kukala na vinyandama wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">lelo walawilile wawo weli na nzewele wakukombole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">Wakukombole wawo wolola ulanga muladi kulotela mbuli zondazilawilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">wozipelemba nhondo na kulotela chila chondachilawile chila mwezi.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Wawo walinga fana mabuwa yanyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">moto wizawatimbula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">Hawadaha kuikombola wenyewo na nguvu za milambi ya moto uwo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">Moto uwo siyo wa kugala vuke na siyo wa kotela.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Ivo niivo vondawawe wanhu waja wolola ulanga wouwahuwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">waja woukalile nawo kwandusila viukalile mbwanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">Wezawegela chila imwe nzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">habule yondayadahe kukukombola.”<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowazuma Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">mweye womutangigwa kwa zina Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">mweye welesi wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">Mweye moilaha kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">mweye mopula kwa zina da Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">mbali momkeweza.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />Mweye womuitanga wanhu wa bululu jelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:2">molonga momuhuwila Mulungu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:2">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi niijo zina jake.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />Nigong'onda mbuli za mwanduso, kwandusila umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">nizigong'onda niye mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">iviya nizitenda zimanyike kumwenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">Bahobaho nizitenda na zilawilila.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Mbali mweye niwamanya vimuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:4">mizoyo yenu midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:4">molema kutegeleza.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Ivo niwagong'ondela mbuli kwandusila umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">zing'hali mbuli zino hazinalawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">muladi sekemwize kulonga nyang'hiti zenu za milungu izo zitendile mbuli izo.<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Mweye muzihulika na muziwona mbuli zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">Vino habali humzitogola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">Kwandusila sambi nizawalongela mbuli za sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">mbuli ziya zifisigwe hamzimanyile mbee.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Mbuli izo zilawilila diyelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">hamuzihulike umwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">Lelo hamudaha kulonga, “Ona chizimanya mwaka.”<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Hamuzihulike na hamuzimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">kwandusila umwaka magutwi yenu hayahulike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">Nivimanya kuwa mweye wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">momanyika molema kutegeleza kwandusila umwaka.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Kwa hishima ya zina jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:9">nizaleka kumuwonelani ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:9">nizaikimilila sekenimnangeni.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Nimsafyani, mbali siyo fana hela muna umoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:10">nimgezani muna umoto wa manhesa.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Nizatenda ivo kwa ichimu changu mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">Vino habali nidileke zina jangu jehuligwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">Sizamwing'ha ukulu wangu munhu imwenga.<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />Munitegeleze mweye welesi wa Yakobo, munitegeleze mweye Waisilaili woniwatangile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">Niye iyo wa mwanduso na uhelelo.<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Mkono wangu mwenyewo wika chandusilo cha isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">iviya mkono wangu wa kulume uwanzanza ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">na nihaitanga, isi na langa vokwima haulongozi wangu.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />“Iduganyeni mose munitegeleze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Yelihi muna imilungu yenu yondayalole vinhu vino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Ija yolondigwa na Mndewa Mulungu kezafikiza mbuli ziya Mulungu ziyalondile kwa Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">yeye kezawatowa Wababeli.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Ona, niye nilonga na nimtanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:15">nimgala nayo kezafikiza lungilo jake.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />Izoni habehi na niye, muhulike mbuli ino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Kwandusila mwanduso nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">‘Mbuli izo vizanduse, niye nikala baho.’ ”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Lelo Mndewa Mulungu kanituma na kaning'ha nguvu ya muhe wake.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lungilo da Mulungu kwa wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">mkombola wenu, kolonga vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">“Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">nomfundizani mbuli zifaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">nomulongozani muna inzila yomulondeka kufosa.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />One muhazindilile ndagilizi zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">muhawile na tindiwalo siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">fana mazi yogendelela kukilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">muhapatile haki siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">fana mawimbi ya bahali yogendelela.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Welesi wenu wezakuwa wengi fana msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">kweli wezakuwa wengi fana vidundulu va msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">zina jenu hadizasegezigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">Nyelesi zenu zizagendelela kuulongozi wangu.”<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Lelo segeleni Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">kimbileni kulawa Babeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">Peteni kwa madizi ya kwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">gong'ondeni mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">longeni mbuli izo mbaka uhelelo wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">longeni, “Mndewa Mulungu kamulopola msang'hani wake Yakobo.”<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Viyawalongoze kuna dibwilingu hawawone ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">kagala mazi kulawa muna uluwe kwa ichimu chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">katobola luwe mazi yalawa kwa nguvu.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:22">“Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawezakala kwa tindiwalo.”<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s">Msang'hani wa Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Nitegelezeni mweye wanhu wa zisi zili kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">kingeni digutwi mweye wanhu muli kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">Mndewa Mulungu kanitanga ning'hali sinavumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">kanitambula zina jangu ning'hali muna iinda ya mami yangu.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Kazitenda mbuli zangu zikutwe fana zele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">kanifisa kwa mkono wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">Kautenda usenga wangu usongoke fana msale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">kanifisa fana msale muna umkwiji wake.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />Kanilongela, “Weye msang'hani wangu Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:3">kwa ichimu chako, nizawatenda wanhu wanitogoze.”<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Mbali niye nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">“Nisang'hana bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">niiyoha kusang'hanila bila kupata chochose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kaning'ha haki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">gweko da sang'hano yangu kezaning'ha Mulungu mwenyewo.”<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kanisagula kwandusila ning'hali muna iinda ya mami yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">muladi niwabweleze welesi wa Yakobo kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">niwaduganye welesi wa Isilaili kumwake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">Mndewa Mulungu koning'ha hishima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">Mulungu wangu kaning'ha nguvu.<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">“Haifaya kulonga weye msang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">muladi uyabweleze makabila ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">na kuwabweleza wanhu wa Isilaili wasigale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">Mbali iviya nizakutenda uwe bung'hulo muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">muladi wanhu wa zisi zose wakomboligwe.”<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Mndewa Mulungu yeli Mkombola na Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">kamulongela ija yehuligwe ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">ija yehiligwe na wanhu wa zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">yeli msang'hani wa watawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">“Wafalume wezakuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">nawo wezakwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">wakulu wezakuwona na wezakutumbalila mavindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">kwa kunihishimu niye Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">Niye Mulungu nizafikiza vilagano vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">niye Mulungu Yelile wa Isilaili, niiyo yonikusagule weye.”<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Yelusalemu wobwelezigwa ukaye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">“Lusita lufaya nizawedika chompula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">lusita lwa ukombola nizawataza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">Nizawakaliza na kutenda lagano na wanhu wa zisi zose kufosela mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">mwizaizenga kaidi isi ino na kuibweleza isi ino ibanangigwe.<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Mwizawalongela wafungwa, ‘Laweni muna ichifungo,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">iviya mwizawalongela waja wakalile muna diziza, ‘Izoni kunze kuna dibung'hulo.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">Chila hanhu howohita wopata ndiya hata kuna ivilima wopata ndiya.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Hawezawona nzala hebu ng'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">vulavumbi da vuke hebu zuwa havizawasoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">niye niwawonele ubazi nizawalongoza na kuwagala muna zinzasa.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Nizaitenda milima yangu yose kuwa makulugumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:11">nizatenda nzila ng'hulu za kufosa wanhu wangu.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Wanhu wangu wezabwela kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">wamwenga wezalawa ubanzi wa kasikazi na ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">wamwenga wezalawa isi ya Sinimu ili ubanzi wa kusi.”<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Imba kwa deng'ho, weye ulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">Deng'helela weye isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">Weye mulima, imba na kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kawaguma moyo wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">kawawonela ubazi wanhu wake wogaya.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Wanhu wa Sayuni wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:14">“Mndewa Mulungu kachileka chiidumwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:14">Mndewa Mulungu kachizimiza.”<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">“Vino mama kodaha kumzimiza mwana iyomong'heza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">na kumwihila mwana iyamvumbule?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">Mbali one yahamzimiza mwanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">niye sizamzimizani.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Weye Yelusalemu, zina jako nijandika muna diganza jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:16">ng'huta zako noziwona kuulongozi wangu siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Wondawazenge kaidi wokwiza himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:17">waja wokubananga wezasegela.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Inula meso ulole banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">wanhu wako wose woiting'hana na kukufikila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">Noilaha niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">wanhu wako wezakuwa fana mahambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">kwizawavala fana viya muke viyovala usalu wake na kunogeza.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />“Weye bululu da Yelusalemu kusigala matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">ukazi wako usigala wabule chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">iviya isi yako idanganizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">mbali sambi izakuwa ndodo ng'hani kwa wanhu wokala umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">Wanhu wakunangile wezasegezigwa kumwako.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Wanago waleligwe kuna uuhami wokuyalalila, wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">‘Isi ino ndodo ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">uching'he hanhu ha kukala.’<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Ivo kwizaiuzagiza mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">‘Vino yelihi yanyelekele wana wano wose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Nifiligwa na wana bila ya kupata wamwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Nigaligwa kuuhami na nyasigwa kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Vino yelihi yowalola goya wana wano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Niye nilekigwa niidumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">lelo wano walawa kulihi?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">“Nizawatanga wanhu wa zisi zimwenga kwa kuwagolosela mkono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">nizawasimikila bendela weze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">Nawo wezawabwelela wanenu kuno wowapapa hachaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">iviya wanenu wa chike wezapikigwa.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Wafalume wezawasang'hanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">na wake zawo wezawalela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">Wezakutumbalila mavindi na kukwing'ha hishima na kwamha migulu yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">Baho kwizavimanya kuwa niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">wanhu wonihuwila hawezagumigwa chinyala.”<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Wanhu wa Yelusalemu wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:24">“Vino galu kodaha kuhokigwa vinhu viyatekile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:24">Hebu wafungwa wa munhu msede wodaha kukomboligwa?”<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">“Kweli, vinhu viyatekile galu vizabwelezigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">Wafungwa wa munhu msede wezakomboligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">niye mwenyewo nizaitowa na wehi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">niye mwenyewo nizawakombola wanenu.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Nizawatenda wanhu womuwonelani waje nyama yawo wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">wezakoligwa damu yawo wenyewo fana divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">Wanhu wose wezavimanya niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">Mulopozi wenu, Mulungu wa Yakobo Nili na Udahi.”<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">“One nimwing'ha chibuwa cha nyasa Yelusalemu mami yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">lelo chibuwa cha nyasa chakulihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">One nimuuzani kuutumwa, kakulihi ija yonimchuuzile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">Mukumbuke kuwa muchuuzigwa kuutumwa kwa uhasanyi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">mami yenu kawingigwa kwa mbuli zenu zihile zimtendile.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Lelo habali vinizile sifikile munhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Habali viniwatangile hamunidike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Vino mkono wangu mguhi sidaha kuwalopoleni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Vino niye, nabule nguvu ya kuwakombolani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Lola, nihaikalikila bahali yonyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">iviya nyanda nozitenda kuwa bwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">somba weli umo wofa na wonung'ha vundo, kwaviya wapuwa mazi.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Niye nodigubika langa kwa ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:3">fana viya munhu yovala guniya kulagusa kuwa kamuna indilo.”<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msang'hani wa Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kanifundiza chinhu cha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">muladi niwagume moyo waja walegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">chila imitondo koning'ha hamu ya kutegeleza mbuli zoyolonda kunifundiza.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kagubula magutwi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:5">na niye siulemile usenga wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:5">na sibwelile kuchisogo.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Wanhu waja wanitowile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">niwalekela mgongo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">na wanhu waja wang'olile ndevu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">niwalekela makanza yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">Mbali viwanitowile na kunibwajulila mate, sichifile chihanga changu.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Mndewa Mulungu konitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">ivo sidaha kupata chinyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">Niye nigangamala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">Novimanya kuwa sizapata chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Yonigombela kahabehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">vino yelihi yoitowa na niye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Yeze chime muna ichitala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Vino, mwihi wangu yelihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Iyo yeme haulongozi wangu.<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Lola Mndewa Mulungu konitaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">Vino yelihi yodaha kulonga niye nihasanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">Wehi wangu wose wezasakala fana walo na mhembele wezawagegeda.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Vino yelihi yomdumba Mndewa Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">Vino yelihi yozindilila mbuli za msang'hani wake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">Yeye yogenda muna diziza na kabule chitasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">yamuhuwile Mndewa Mulungu na kumulolela yeye.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Mbali mweye mubwinha moto na moitendela mawenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">mugende kwa bung'hulo da moto uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">milambi ya moto womuukong'hile mweye wenyewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">Chondampate kulawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu niicho chino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">mweye mwizagaya ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kuwaguma moyo wanhu wa Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">“Munitegeleze mweye womulonda haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">mweye womunizahila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">Muloleni Ibulahimu yakalile fana luwe luja womusongoligwe.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Mkumbukeni Bulahimu wasaho yenu na Sala yonimwing'hile welesi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">Bulahimu kakala kabule wana lusita vinimtangile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">mbali nimtemela mate na nimwing'ha welesi mwingi.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Kweli Mndewa Mulungu kezawaguma moyo wanhu wa bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">kezayawonela ubazi matongo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">kezaditenda bwilingu jake diwe fana mgunda wa Edeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">na chuwala chake fana chizi cha Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">Umo wanhu wezadeng'helela na kutowa ng'henze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">na nyila za kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu zizahulikika umo.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />“Nitegelezeni mweye wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">kingeni digutwi mweye wanhu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">Malagilizo na haki volawa kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">ivo vizakuwa bung'hulo kwa zisi.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Nizakwiza himahima kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">lusita lwangu lwa kuhuma lwahabehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">Niye mwenyewo nizazitawala zisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">Wakaya wa zisi za kutali wonigozela niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">wohuwila niwataze.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Mwinule meso yenu mulole kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">loleni isi uko hasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Ulanga wizakwaga fana yosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">isi izasakala fana walo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">iviya wakaya wake wezadanganika fana wang'onyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Mbali ukombola wondaniugale wizakala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">utawala wangu wa haki hawizamala.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />“Kingeni digutwi mweye womuvimanya kutenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">mweye mwikile malagilizo yangu muna imizoyo yenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">Sekemdumbe wanhu wahamwehulani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">na sekemuwe na lugano vondawamdununzeni.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Kwaviya wawo wezadigwa na mhalata fana viya walo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">kupatu wezawaja fana viwoja mazoya ya ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">mbali haki yangu izakala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">ukombola wangu hawizakuwa na uhelelo.”<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, lamuka uchitaze kwa nguvu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">fana viutendile umwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">Vino siyo weye udikanhile ng'onyo dikulu ditangigwa Lahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">na kuditula zoka ijo dikulu da kudumbiza?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Weye iyo uinyazile bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">iyo utendile nzila muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">muladi waja wouwalopole wafose umo.<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Wanhu wouwakombole weye Mndewa Mulungu wezabwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">wezakwiza Sayuni kuno wokwimba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">Wezamema deng'ho siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">wezasekelela na kwimba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">Wanhu hawezakuwa na manhesa na hawezakuwa na usungu kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">“Niye kweli iyo niwaguma moyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">Vino mweye momdumba munhu yodanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">munhu yeli fana mayani?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Mweye monizimiza niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">yonyanzaze ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">yonikile vandusilo va isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">Lelo modumba siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">kwa ichimu cha ludoko lwa mwihi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">iyo kailungila kuwananga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">Vino ludoko lwake lwizafika kulihi?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Wafungwa wezalekelelwa himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:14">hawezadanganika na kuhumuluka muna dileme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:14">hebu hawezapuwa ndiya.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">noitibula bahali muladi beho jake dibume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi ijo zina jangu.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Nizika mbuli zangu muna imilomo yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">na kuwagubika kwa mkono wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">Niwanzanza ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">na nika vandusilo va isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">nowalongela mweye wanhu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">‘Mweye mwa wanhu wangu.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhelelo wa manhesa ya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Lamka weye Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">Lamka weye ugonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">Mndewa Mulungu kakung'wiza chihamha cha ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">weye kung'wa lusikasika mbaka kuzazalika.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Muna iwana wose wouweleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">habule hata imwe wa kukutawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">Habule mwanago yoyose youmweleke yondayakwamhe mkono kukulongoza.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Mahulo maidi maidi yakupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">kunanga na kudanganiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">na nzala na ndilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">Vino yelihi yondayakuwonele ubazi?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Wanago wasinduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">wagona mumgwazo wa makulugumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">fana mhala yenzeke muna ulwavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">Mndewa Mulungu kawakalikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">Mulungu wako kawatagusa.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Lelo tegeleza weye Yelusalemu yougaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:21">tegeleza weye ukoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:21">mbali siyo kwa divai.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako yowagombela wanhu wake kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">“Nikusegezela chihama chikutenda uzazalike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">hwizakung'wa kaidi chihama cha ludoko lwangu.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Chihama icho nizaweng'ha wanhu wokugaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">waja wakulongele ugone hasi wafose uchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">wautenda mgongo wako fana ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">fana nzila yawo ya kufosa.”<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kezaikombola bululu da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Lamuka, Lamuka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Igangamize weye bululu da Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Uvale walo jako dinogile, weye Yelusalemu bululu jelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">kwaviya wanhu hawengile ulungwana na wambule mwiko hawezakwingila kaidi kumwako.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Kung'hunha matimbwisi na winuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">weye Yelusalemu ukalile ufungigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">Uifungule minyololo yako muisingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">uizuhule weye usoligwe mateka.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Mulavigwa bila hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:3">iviya mwizakomboligwa bila kuliha hela.”<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Mweye umwaka mukimbilila isi ya Misili na mukala uko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:4">Maabaho Waashulu wamuwonelani bila chimu chochose.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Vino sambi nopata faida yaki kuwona wanhu wangu wogaligwa kuutumwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">Wawo wowatawala woigoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">iviya zina jangu dogendelela kwehuligwa chila siku.<verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Lelo wanhu wezavimanya niye yelihi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:6">Siku ijo wezavimanya kuwa niye niiyo nilonga, ‘Niye nabaha.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Lola viinogeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">msenga kolawilila kuna umulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">kogong'onda mbuli za tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">kogala mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">koupeta ulopozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">Kodilongela bululu da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">“Mulungu wako kotawala.”<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Tegeleza madizi ya wakalizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">wokwimba hamwe na wodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">kwaviya wolola kwa meso yawo wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">Mndewa Mulungu viyobwela muna dibululu da Sayuni.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Toweni ng'henze, mweye matongo ya Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kawaguma moyo wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">kadikombola bululu da Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kalagusa nguvu zake muna izisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:10">kezawakombola wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:10">iviya isi yose izawona mbuli izo.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Segeleni, segeleni, laweni hano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Sekemudalise chinhu chochose chambule mwiko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Segeleni kuno Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">muisafye mweye womupapa via va kaye ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Lusita luno hamwizalopola kulawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">na hamwizasegela himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezamulongolelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">na Mulungu wa Isilaili kezamkalizani kuchisogo.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msang'hani yogaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />Lola msang'hani yotenda kwa ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:13">kezatogozigwa na kwinuligwa kuchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:13">iyo kezakuwa kuchanyha ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Wanhu wamuwone wasinhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:14">kwaviya chihanga chake chibanangika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:14">mbaka hawoneke fana munhu.<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />Mbali lelo kawazaganya wanhu wa zisi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">wafalume wezanyamala hupi kwa ichimu chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">kwaviya wawona mbuli ziya hawalongeligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">na wozimanya mbuli ziya hawanazihulika.<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Vino yelihi yahuwile mbuli zochihulike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:1">Vino yelihi yawonile nguvu ya Mndewa Mulungu?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />Kwaviya haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, msang'hani wake kagoloka fana sukuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">kalinga fana zizi muna iisi inyalile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">Hakalile na chihanga chinang'hane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">na hakalile na unovu wowose wa kunogeza.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Kazehigwa na kulemigwa na wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">Kakala munhu wa manhesa na yazowele mawine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">kakala munhu yozehigwa na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">kehuligwa na chimuwona mbozi.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Mbali kafunyila umoyo usungu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">iviya kaitwika lugano jetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">cheye chigesa Mulungu kamtagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">kamtowa na kumgaza.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Mbali kalumizigwa kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">katagusigwa kwa ichimu cha wihi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">nhaguso yake ichigalila tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">viyatowigwe, cheye chihona.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Cheye chose chaga fana ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">chila imwe wetu kasondelela nzila yake mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kamtagusa nhaguso ichilondeke kutagusigwa.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Kagazigwa na kawoneligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">mbali kafunya umoyo na halongile mbuli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">Kalinga fana mwanang'hondolo viyogaligwa kuchinjigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">fana ng'hondolo viyonyamala, lusita viyokanhigwa mazoya yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">Iviya halilile.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Kabamanyigwa na katagusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">kagaligwa kukomigwa na habule munhu yagesile mbuli zimpatile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">Kawingigwa kulawa isi ya wanhu weli wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wa wanhu wangu.<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Viyadanganike wamuwanda hamwe na matajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">kekigwa hamwe na wahasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">ingawa hatendile usede wowose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">iviya halongile mbuli yoyose ya uvwizi.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kalonda kumulumiza na kumtenda yakale moyo yau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">Kamulava kuwa nhambiko ya kusegeza uhasanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">Mbali msang'hani wa Mulungu kezawona welesi wake na kezakala siku nyingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">Yeye kezafikiza lungilo da Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Mulungu kolonga, “Msang'hani yahakomeleza kugazigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">kezadeng'helela viyovimanya mbuli impatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">msang'hani wangu kezawatenda wanhu wengi wanoge haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">kwaviya kezatagusigwa kwa uhasanyi wawo.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Ivo nizamuhanganya hamwe na wakulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">Kezavigola vinhu vitekigwe hamwe na weli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">kwaviya kailava mwenyewo yadanganike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">kekigwa hamwe na wahasanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">Katagusigwa kwa uhasanyi wa wanhu wengi na kawapulila wahasanyi.”<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu hezaileka kaidi bululu da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">“Weye Yelusalemu, muke mgumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">landula dizi jako kwa kwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">towa lukenze, weye muke hunakweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">kwaviya wanago weye ulekigwe wezakuwa wengi kufosa wana wa ija yasoligwe na mulume.<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />Galamula hema jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">tagamula mahema yako houkala mbaka yenele kutali na sekeuyakimilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">Zigolole nzabi zake na kugangamiza vigingi vake.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Kwaviya kwizagalamula chila ubanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:3">welesi wako wezahazi zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:3">mabululu yakalile matongo yezamema wanhu.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />“Sekeudumbe kwaviya hwizagumigwa chinyala kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">sekeuwe na lugano, kwaviya hwizazehigwa kaidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">Kwizazimiza chinyala chiupatile viukalile mwali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">iviya hwizakumbuka kaidi viwehuligwe lusita viukalile mgane.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Kwaviya Mulumbaji wako kezakuwa mulumako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">zina jake Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">Mkombola wako niiyo Yelile wa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">Yeye kotangigwa Mulungu wa isi yose.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Weye Yelusalemu, Mndewa Mulungu kakutanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">fana viya muke yalekigwe na koiyalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">fana muke yasoligwe yang'hali mwali viyokwasigwa.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">Mulungu wako kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />“Nikuleka kwa lusita luguhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:7">mbali nizakubweleza kwa ubazi ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Kwa ludoko ng'hani nikufisa chihanga changu kwa lusita ludodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">mbali kwaviya nokulonda kwa kufunya umoyo, nizakuwonela ubazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">Mndewa Mulungu mkombola wako kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />“Nizatenda fana vinitendile lusita lwa Nuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">lusita luja niilaha kuwa sizaigubika kaidi isi yose kwa mazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">Lelo noilaha kuwa sizakuwonela ludoko na sizakukalikila kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Hata milima ihatingisika na vilima vihasegezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">ulondo wangu wa kufunya umoyo hawizamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">na lagano jangu da tindiwalo hadizasegezigwa.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">Mndewa Mulungu yomuwonelani ubazi kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />“Weye Yelusalemu ugazigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">ugaiye na upuwile munhu wa kukuguma moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">nizakuzenga kaidi kwa mabwe ya bei ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">vandusilo vako vizakuwa va mabwe ya bei ng'hulu yotangigwa samawati.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Malingo yako nizayazenga kwa mabwe ya akiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:12">nyivi zako nizazizenga kwa madini na ng'huta yako nizaizenga kwa mabwe ya bei ng'hulu.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />Wanhu wako wezafunzigwa na niye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:13">wezakuwa na tindiwalo ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Kwizagangamizigwa kwaviya kohumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">hwizawoneligwa na hwizadumba chochose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">Hakwizakuwa na chinhu cha kukutenda udumbe hata chidogo.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Munhu yoyose yaheza kukutowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">kezakuwa hatumigwe na niye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">Munhu yoyose yaheza kuihuma na weye, kwizamuhuma.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />Niye iyo nimuumbile muhunzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">yopuguta moto wa makala na kuhonda via va ng'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">Iviya niye niiyo nimuumbile mdanganyi.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Habule chia cha ng'hondo chondaulungiligwe chondachikupate.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Munhu yahakulongeleza kwizahuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Haki iyo niweng'ha wasang'hani wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Haki zawo izo zilawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowagoneka wanhu kukala goya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />“Lelo chila munhu yowona ng'hilu yeze kuna yamazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">Izoni wose mulibule hela mugule ngano muje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">mugule divai na maziwa bila hela bila ya maliho.<verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Habali mosang'hanila hela zenu kugula vinhu havidigwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">Habali mosang'hana muladi kupata vinhu havigala shibe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">Nitegelezeni vinogile muladi muje ndiya inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">mwizadeng'helela kuja ndiya inogile ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />Kingeni magutwi yenu na mwize kumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">nitegelezeni muladi muwe wagima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">Nizatenda na mweye lagano da siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">Nizamulondani kwa kufunya umoyo fana vinimulaganile Daudi.<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Nimtenda Daudi kuwa mulangulizi wa wanhu wa zisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:4">muladi yanilavile ukalangama kwa wanhu wa zisi.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Sambi mwizawatanga wanhu wa zisi hamuzimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">wanhu wa zisi izo wezamwizilani himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">kwa ichimu changu niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">kwa ichimu changu niye Yelile wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">nimtendani mtogozigwe.”<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />Mzahileni Mndewa Mulungu kwaviya kopatika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:6">mtangeni, kwaviya kahabehi.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile waleke mbuli zawo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">iviya wolondeka waleke magesa yawo yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">na wambwelele Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kezawawonela ubazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">Wabwele kwa Mulungu wetu, nayo kezawalekelela ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:8">“Magesa yangu siyo magesa yenu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:8">Nhendelo zangu siyo nhendelo zenu.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />Fana ulanga viuli kutali ng'hani kufosa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">niivo nhendelo zangu vizili kutali na nhendelo zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">iviya magesa yangu yakutali na magesa yenu.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Fana viya mvula na seluji vivilagala kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">na havibwela kaidi uko, ving'hali voing'hwiza isi na kuitenda mimea isuke na kutimula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">Ivo isi yoweng'ha wahandaji mbeyu na yoweng'ha wanhu ndiya.<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />Iviya mbuli yangu inilonga haizabwela bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">mbali izatenda vonilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">izafikiza lungilo jangu.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />Mwizalawa Babeli kuno modeng'helela na kulongozigwa kwa tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">milima na vilima haulongozi wenu vizalandula dizi na kwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">mibiki yose muna imigunda izamtowelani mang'huwa.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Badala ya michongoma, isi izakota misonobali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">badala ya mbigili, isi izakota muhalita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">Mbuli ino izakuwa chilaguso cha ukulu wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">Chizakuwa chilaguso cha siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">chiya chikala siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s">Ulopozi kwa wanhu wose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">“Muzindilile malagilizo yangu na mutende mbuli zinogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">Kwaviya ulopozi wangu wahabehi kwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">mwizawona vonitenda voilondeka.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Kamweda munhu yosondelela mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">kamweda munhu yozindilila ng'hani siku za mhumulo kwa hishima na kuleka kutenda wihi wowose.”<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />Manyambenyambe woilumba na niye Mndewa Mulungu sekewagese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">“Ukweli Mndewa Mulungu kachigwaza na wanhu wake.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">Iviya matowashi sekewalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">“Cheye mibiki inyalile.”<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">“Matowashi wozindilila malagilizo yangu ya siku ya mhumulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">waja wotenda mbuli zininogeza na kwamha lagano jangu,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />nizaweng'ha hanhu ha kukumbukigwa muna ikaye yangu na ng'huta zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">wezakumbukigwa hata wahawa wabule wana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">Nizaweng'ha mazina ya kukumbukigwa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">yayo hayezasegezigwa hata chidogo.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Manyambenyambe wondawailumbe na niye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">kwa kunisang'hanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">na kwa kudilonda zina jangu na kuwa wasang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">wanhu wose wondawazindilile siku ya mhumulo bila kwambula mwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">wanhu wondawamhe lagano jangu,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />wawo nizawagala kuna umulima wangu welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">kuwadeng'heleza muna ikaye yangu ya kumpula Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">nhosa zawo na nhambiko za kutimbula zizatogoligwa hana ulupango lwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">Kwaviya kaye yangu izatangigwa kaye ya kumpula Mulungu kwa ichimu cha wanhu wose.”<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />Mndewa Mulungu yowakunzagiza Waisilaili wapwililike kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">“Nizawakunzagiza wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">kufosa waja woniwakunzagize.”<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walangulizi wa Isilaili wolongelizigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Mweye wehi wa Waisilaili mulingile fana wanyama wa kumbago, izoni muwaje wanhu wangu.<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Kwaviya walangulizi wawo wose vipofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">wose wahungukiligwa na nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">Wose walinga fana mbwa bubu hawabwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">wogona na wolota nzozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">wokukila lusita lwose.<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Wawo walinga fana imbwa weli na usu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">hawadaha kwiguta hata chidogo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">Wawo walinga fana wadimi welibule nzewele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">Chila imwe kolonda nzila yake mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">chila imwe kolonda yapate gweko jake.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Wawo woilongela, “Izoni, chihite kuzahila divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">ching'hwe chikoligwe divai ikangale ng'hani.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">Igolo izanoga kufosa diyelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">dizakuwa dugila kulu ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowakalikila wanhu wake kwa ichimu cha kutambikila milungu ya uvwizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile yahadanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">habule munhu yogesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">munhu yanogile yahasegezigwa muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">habule munhu yoimanya mbuli iyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">Munhu iyo yanogile kahamizigwa muladi sekeyapatigwe na mbuli ihile.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Yeye kokwingila muna ditindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:2">Wanhu wosondelela nzila igoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:2">wezadanganika kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />Mbali Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:3">“Mweye wahawi, izoni hano munitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:3">mweye munilekile na mutambikila milungu imwenga.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Mweye monisekela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">monizumila na kunizeha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">Mweye wenyewo wadugi kwandusila mwanduso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">mweye wavwizi.<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Mweye molonda kuibandama hasi ya mibiki ya kutambikila ya miyaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">iviya hasi ya chila mbiki uli na mayani mabisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">mowakoma wanenu na kuwatendela nhambiko muna yamakolongo na muna zimbane za mabwe.<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Mosagula mabwe yahuhile muna yamakolongo na moyatenda kuwa milungu yenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">Moyetilila nhosa ya upele na moyagalila nhosa ya usage.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">Vino sizamtagusani kwa mbuli izo?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Moibandama uchanyha ya milima mitali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:7">iviya mohita uko kutambika.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Mutumbika nyang'hiti zenu kuchisogo ya nyivi zenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">Mweye munileka niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">muvula mawalo yenu na mukwela muna yamakomwa yenu yamakulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">Mulagana na waja mulonda kuibandama nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">maabaho muibandama nawo.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Moiboboda mavuta yonung'ha goya na mavuta mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">maabaho mohita kumtambikila mulungu Moleki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">Mowatuma wasenga wenu uko na uko woizahila milungu ya kuitambikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">wafika mbaka kuzimu.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Mulegela na miyanza yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">mbali hamufile moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">muing'ha nguvu zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">lekamana hamusinduke.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />“Vino mumdumba yelihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">mbaka mulonga uvwizi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">Hamunikumbuke niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">na hamugesile mbuli zino muna imizoyo yenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">Vino muleka kunidumba kwaviya simzumileni siku nyingi?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Mogesa motenda goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:12">mbali nizagong'onda mbuli zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:12">iyo milungu yenu haizamfayani.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Vondamulilile kutazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">chilole fana nyang'hiti zenu zodaha kumkombolani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Beho dizamuhembelusani kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">mhumuzi izamwasani kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Mbali wanhu wonihuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">wezaihazi isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">iviya mulima wangu welile wizakuwa wawo.”<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowataza wanhu woinyendanyenda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:14">“Zengeni, zengeni, sasaleni nzila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:14">Segezeni ng'walo zose muna zinzila za wanhu wangu.”<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Mulungu yokala uchanyha ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">yeye yokala siku zose na yotangigwa Yelile, kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">“Niye nokala uchanyha, hanhu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">nokala na wanhu wosama na woinyendanyenda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">Niye nizawaguma moyo wanhu woinyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">na kuwaguma moyo wanhu wosama.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Kwaviya sizaihuma nawo siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">na sizawawonela ludoko siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">buleivo, wawo woniwaumbile wezasinduka haulongozi wangu.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Niwawonela ludoko ng'hani kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">niwatagusa na nichifisa chihanga changu na kupata ludoko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">Mbali wawo wagendelela kutenda vinhu viwailungile.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Niziwona nhendelo zawo, mbali nizawahonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:18">nizawalongoza na kuwaguma moyo wanhu wolila.<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />Niwatenda wembe wila wa nhogolwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">Niye nizaweng'ha tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">nizaweng'ha tindiwalo wanhu weli kutali na weli habehi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">“Niye nizawahonya.”<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile walinga fana bahali ikumbigwe na beho kulu na haidaha kutindiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:20">mazi yake yogala nhope na unyolodo.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />Mulungu wangu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:21">“Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawapata tindiwalo.”<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s">Kufunga kuja kwa kweli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />“Guta nyangi na sekeuleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">landula dizi jako fana mhalati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">Wagong'ondele wanhu wangu kubiduka kwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">walongele welesi wa Yakobo uhasanyi wawo.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Kwaviya chila siku wonizahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">wowoneka wolonda kuzimanya nhendelo zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">fana viya wawo wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">hawalekile malagilizo ya Mulungu wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">Wolonda Mulungu yawahumize voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">wodeng'helela kumkwenhukila Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Wawo wolonga, ‘Habali cheye chifunga kuja mbali weye hulola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">Habali choinyendanyenda mbali weye hulola?’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:3" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">“Siku yenu ya kufunga kuja motenda vomulonda mweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">kuno mowabamanya wanhu wosang'hana kumwenu.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Lola mofunga kuja kuno mogomba na kuitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">moitowa ng'honde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">Muhafunga kuja fana ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">muvimanye kuwa mbuli zimupula hazizafika kumwangu.<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Vino nisagula kufunga kuja kulingile ivo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Vino nisagula siku imwe muhala ya munhu kuinyendanyenda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Iviya mogonela mawalo ya maguniya na moibuga maivu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Kutenda ivo mokutanga kufunga kuja?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Vino ino iyo siku itogoligwa na Mndewa Mulungu?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />Niye nolonda mufunge kuja fana vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">muwafungule wanhu wafungigwe kwa kuwoneligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">mufungule nzabi za utumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">muwalekelele wailegehe wowoniligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">mubene vinhu vose va chitumwa.<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Kufunga kuja kwa kweli ni kuwagolela weli na nzala ndiya zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">kuweng'ha hanhu ha kukala ngayengaye welibule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">kuweng'ha mawalo wanhu welibule mawalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">sekemuleke kuwataza wakaya wayenu.<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Muhatenda ivo mwizanang'hana fana bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">mwizahona himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">Mndewa Mulungu yeli na haki kezamulongolelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">kezamkalizani kulawa kuchisogo kwa ukulu wake.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Baho mwizampula Mulungu, nayo kezamwidikani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">mwizalila yamtazeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">nayo kezalonga, ‘Nabaha.’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">“One muhasegeza vinhu va chitumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">muhaleka kuwazeha wamwenga na kulonga mbuli zihile,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />muhaweng'ha ndiya wanhu weli na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">muhakomeleza chowolonda weli na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">bung'hulo dowamwemwesela lusita lwa ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">ichilo yenu izakuwa fana imisi.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />Mndewa Mulungu, kezamulongozani siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">kezamwing'hani chimulonda lusita lwa zuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">Kezamgangamizani ng'huli zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">iviya mwizakuwa fana chizi chitiligwe mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">fana nzasa ya mazi haiyanyala.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Wanhu wenu wezazenga hanhu hakalile matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">wezazenga kaidi vandusilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">mweye mwizatangigwa, ‘Wene kuzenga kaidi ng'huta zibomoke,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">iviya ‘Wene kubweleza kulugumbi da kukala.’<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />One uhaleka kutenda sang'hano zihile siku ya mhumulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">one uhaleka kutenda mbuli zihile siku yangu yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">one uhaitanga siku ya mhumulo siku ya kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">one uhaihishimu siku iyo yelile ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">one uhaihishimu kwa kuleka kutenda mbuli zako mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">one uhaleka kulonga mbuli zako mwenyewo,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu nizakutenda udeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">nizakutenda uhume mbuli ndala zose muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">nizakwing'ha isi inimwing'hile wasaho yako Yakobo.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s">Mulotezi koduwila uhasanyi wa wanhu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Lola, mkono wa Mndewa Mulungu siyo mguhi mbaka yapotwe kukukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:1">na gutwi jake hadipola mbaka dipotwe kuhulika.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Mbali uhasanyi wenu umtendani muwe kutali na Mulungu wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:2">uhasanyi wenu uchifisa chihanga chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:2">muladi sekeyawone na sekeyahulike.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Kwaviya makono yenu yambula mwiko kwa kukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">iviya vidole venu vambula mwiko kwa mbuli zihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">Milomo yenu yolonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">iviya milimi yenu yolonga mbuli zihile.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Habule munhu yogesa haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">hebu yoigombela kwa ukweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">Muhuwila mbuli muhala na molonga uvwizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">Muilunga kudanganya na kutenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Malungilo yenu yolumiza fana mafinga ya zoka dili na sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">kwaviya mazoka yeli na sumu yolawa muna yamafinga yayo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">Mowategela wanhu mtego fana viyotega buibui.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Malungilo yenu hayafaya fana viya walo viditendigwa na lutandabui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">wanhu hawadaha kuigubika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">Sang'hano zenu ziha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">sang'hano zenu za udugi.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Migulu yenu yokimbilila muna uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">muhuha kuwakoma wanhu bila chimu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">Mogesa mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">hohose homuhita mobananga vinhu na mowatenda wanhu wagaye.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Mweye hamuimanyile nzila ya tindiwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">hamuzindilila malagilizo ya Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">Muitendela nzila ya ubozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">munhu yoyose yofosa umo hapata tindiwalo.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wosama uhasanyi wawo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Lekamana haki yakutali na cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">haki haifika kumwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">chihuwila kupata bung'hulo, mbali ziza muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">chihuwila kugenda muna dibung'hulo, mbali chogenda muna diziza.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Chobabasa muna ing'huta fana vipofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">chobabasa muna zinzila zetu fana wanhu watulike yameso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">Imitondo choikwala fana lusita lwa ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">hagati ya wanhu weli na nguvu, cheye chilinga fana wanhu wadanganike.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Chotongoloma fana mnyama dubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">cholila kwa giyogiyo fana huwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">Chowinza haki, mbali habule haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">chololela ukombola, mbali ukombola wakutali.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Kwaviya ubananzi wetu mwingi haulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">iviya uhasanyi wetu wochilagusa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">Kwaviya ubananzi wetu wahamwe na cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">iviya wihi wetu choumanya.<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Cheye chikulema na chikubela weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">iviya chikuhinduka na chilema kukutegeleza weye Mulungu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">Cholonga mbuli zihile na mbuli za kulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">muna imizoyo yetu choilunga mbuli za uvwizi.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Wasemi hawahumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">na wanhu hawatenda voilondeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">Wanhu hawalonga ukweli hana iwanhu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">wanhu wokwaminika wosegela.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Ukweli uhunguka ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">iviya munhu yoyose yoyepula na mbuli zihile kogaluka kuwa ukala.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 59:15" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">Mndewa Mulungu kalola na kapata ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">kwaviya wanhu hawahumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Kawona habule hata munhu imwe yogesa mbuli iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">kazanywa kuwa habule munhu yoyose yengilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">Mbali mkono wake mwenyewo umgalila ukombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">Lelo kasang'hanila udahi wake mwenyewo kuwakombola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">Haki yake mwenyewo imtaza.<verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />Kavala haki fana viya walo da kuikimilila muna imhambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">iviya kavala pama fana ulopozi muna iditwi jake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">Kavala walo da kulihiza chisasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">na kaifunga wivu fana joho.<verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Kezawatagusa wehi kwa mbuli iwatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">kezawawonela ludoko wehi wake na kuwalihiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">kezawatagusa wanhu wokala zisi zimwenga zili kutali.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Kwandusila ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">wanhu wezadidumba zina da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">na kwandusila ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa, wanhu wezadihishimu zina jake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezakwiza fana lwanda lumemile mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">lwanda lusung'higwa kwa muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />Mulopozi kezakwiza Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:20">kwa wanhu wosama wa welesi wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:20">Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">“Nizatenda na mweye lagano dino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">Muhe wangu yokala hamwe na mweye, hezamulekani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">Mbuli zangu zonikile muna imilomo yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">zizakala muna imilomo yenu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">na zizasigala muna imilomo ya wanenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">na muna imilomo ya welesi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">kwandusila sambi na kugendelela.”<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />Weye bululu da Yelusalemu, ima umwemwese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:1">kwaviya bung'hulo dolawa kwa ichimu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:1">ukulu wa Mndewa Mulungu uwoneka kumwako.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Ziza dogubika isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">ziza totolo dogubika makabila yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kakwizila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">bung'hulo jake diwoneka kumwako.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Wanhu wa zisi zose wezakwiza kuna dibung'hulo jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:3">na wafalume wezakwegigwa kwaviya viubung'hula.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />Inula meso yako ulole banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">wose woiting'hana na wokwizila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">wanago wa chilume wezafika kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">iviya wanago wa chike wezapapigwa.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Baho kwizawona mbuli iyo na kwizadeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">kwizakwazanywa na kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">vinhu vose vifosezigwa muna ibahali vizakwizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">utajili wa zisi zose wizagaligwa kumwako.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Wachuuzi na ngamia wopapa vinhu vawo, wezamema muna iisi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">ngamia wolawa isi ya Midiani na isi ya Efa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">wawo wose wezakwizila kulawa isi ya Sheba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">Wezakugalila zahabu na ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">kuno wozigong'onda nhogolwa za Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Mabumbila yose ya ng'hondolo yolawa Kedali yezaiduganya kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">mabebelu ya ng'hondolo ya Nebayosi yezalavigwa kuwa nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">yezatogoleka kuwa nhambiko muna ulupango lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">niye nizaitenda kaye yangu ihishimigwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />Welihi wawo wofosa himahima fana mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:8">fana nziwa viwozumha muladi kwingila muna ivisanza vawo?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Kweli wanhu wa visiwa wonilolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">ngalawa za Talishishi zokwandusa kulongolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">zowagala wanago hamwe na hela zawo na zahabu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">kwa nhogolwa ya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">kwa ichimu cha Yelile wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">kwaviya kakutenda uhishimigwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />Nyambenyambe wezazizenga kaidi ng'huta zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">wafalume wawo wezakusang'hanila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">Vinikalile na ludoko nikutowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">mbali sambi nokuwonela ubazi kwaviya nokulonda.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Nyivi zako zizavuguliwa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">hazizahindigwa ichilo na imisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">muladi wanhu wadahe kukugalila utajili wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">kuno wafalume wawo wowalongoza.<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Kwaviya isi na ufalume uja haukusang'hanila wizanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:12">zisi izo zose zizanangigwa ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />Nhogolwa ya mbago ya Lebanoni izakwizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">misonobali na mivinje hamwe na misoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">muladi kuhahamba hanhu hangu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">na niye nizahanogeza hanhu baho hondanikale.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Welesi waja wakubamanye wezakwiza kumwako na kukutumbalila mavindi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">Wanhu wose wokuzeha, wezakutumbalila mavindi mbaka vihanga vawo vidalise hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">na wezakutanga Bululu da Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">Yelusalemu bululu da hoyokala Yelile wa Isilaili.<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />Weye kulekigwa na kwehuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">habule munhu yalondile kufosa kumwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">Mbali sambi nizakutenda uhishimigwe siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">Kwizakuwa bululu da kudeng'heleligwa na nyelesi zose.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Kwizagaliligwa ndiya na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">wafalume wezakwing'ha ndiya inogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">Baho kwizavimanya kuwa niye Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mulopozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">niye Nili na Udahi, Mulungu wa Isilaili, niiyo mkombola wako.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Badala ya shaba nizagala zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">badala ya chuma nizagala hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">badala ya biki nizagala shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">badala ya mabwe nizagala chuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">Nizawatenda walangulizi wako watawale kwa tindiwalo na haki.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Udugi hawizahulikika kaidi muna iisi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">ubananzi na kudanganiza havizalawilila muna iisi yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">Nizakukaliza na kukugombela fana viya ng'huta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">wanhu wose wofosela nyivi zako wezanitogoza.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />Imisi zuwa hadizakuwa bung'hulo jako kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">iviya ichilo mwezi hawizakubung'hulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">kwaviya niye Mndewa Mulungu niijo bung'hulo da kumwemwesa siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">niye Mulungu wako nizakuwa ukulu wako.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Zuwa hadizahonga kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">iviya mwezi hawizabwela kaidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">Niye Mndewa Mulungu nizakuwa bung'hulo jako siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">na siku zako zose za ndilo zizamala.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Baho wanhu wako wose wezakuwa wanoga haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">wawo wezaihazi isi na izakuwa yawo siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">Wawo niijo sukila donihandile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">sang'hano ya makono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">muladi kulagusa ukulu wangu.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Munhu yeli na wana wadodo kezakuwa na lukolo lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">munhu yeli mdodo kufosa wose kezakuwa isi ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">lusita lwahafika nizazikong'hela mbuli izo himahima.<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli inogile ya ulopozi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Muhe wa Mulungu kahamwe na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kanituma niwagong'ondele mbuli inogile wanhu woinyendanyenda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">Kwaviya kanituma niwahonye wanhu wabeneke moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">niwagong'ondele kuilegeha wanhu waja watekigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">na wafungwa wafunguliligwe.<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />Kanituma kugong'onda mwaka wa ulopozi wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:2">na siku ya kuwalihiliza wehi wa Mulungu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:2">Kanituma niwagume moyo wanhu wose wolila,<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />niweng'he vilondeka waja wolila umo Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">muladi kuweng'ha kombelo da maluwa badala ya maivu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">kuweng'ha mavuta ya kudeng'helela badala ya kulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">kuweng'ha walo da nhogolwa badala ya kufa moyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">Kwaviya watenda mbuli zinogile, wezatangigwa mibiki ya miyaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">iyahandile Mndewa Mulungu kulagusa ukulu wake.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Wezazenga kaidi hana yamatongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">wezahazenga kaidi hanhu halekigwe bila chinhu kwandusila umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">wezayazenga kaidi mabululu yabomoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">yalekigwe bila chinhu kwa nyelesi nyingi.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Baho nyambenyambe wezamdimilani mabumbila ya wanyama wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:5">nyambenyambe wezamsang'hanilani muna imigunda yenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:5">na wezamuloleselani goya migunda yenu ya mizabibu.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Mbali mweye mwizatangigwa, “Wakulu wa nhambiko wa Mndewa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">Mwizatangigwa, “Wasang'hani wa Mulungu wetu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">Mwizapata utajili wa zisi zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">kwa ukulu wawo mwizamweda na kwiitogoza.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Badala ya chinyala chenu, mwizatemeligwa mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">badala ya kuzehigwa, mwizadeng'helela uhazi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">muna iisi yenu mwizahazi vinhu vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">na mwizadeng'helela siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">“Nolonda wanhu wahumize voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">nokwihila kuhoka na wihi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">Kwa uwaminika wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">nizawagweka wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">nizatenda nawo lagano da siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Nyelesi zawo zizamanyika muna izisi na muna yamakabila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">Chila munhu yondayawawone, kezavimanya kuwa wanhu wawo watemeligwa mate na Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />Nodeng'helela ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">moyo wangu womsekelela Mulungu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">kwaviya kanivaza mawalo ya ulopozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">kanigubika mawalo ya haki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">fana munhu yosola viyoihamba na kombelo dili na maluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">fana muke yosoligwa viyoihamba na mahambo ya zahabu.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Kwaviya fana viya isi viyoteza mimea yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:11">iviya ulongo muna imigunda viusiliza mbeyu zihandigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:11">Mndewa Mulungu kezatenda haki na nhogolwa zote muna izisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Kwa ichimu cha Sayuni sizanyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">na kwa ichimu cha Yelusalemu sizakala hupi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">mbaka haki yake vondaimulike fana ichilo vichikunguzuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">ivo ulopozi wake fana chitasa vichikwaka.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Wanhu wa zisi zose wezaiwona haki yako weye Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">Wafalume wose wezauwona ukulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">iviya kwizatangigwa zina da sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">zina dondadilavigwe na Mndewa Mulungu mwenyewo.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Na weye kwizakuwa kombelo dinogile muna umkono wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:3">kombelo da chifalume muna umkono wa Mulungu wako.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Hawezakutanga kaidi, “Yalekigwe.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">Iviya isi yako haizatangigwa, “Uchiwa.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">Mbali kwizatangigwa, “Mulungu kanogeligwa nayo.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">Nayo isi yako izatangigwa, “Yoyasoligwe na mulume,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kanogeligwa na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">nayo kezakuwa fana mulume wa isi yako.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Fana viya mbwanga viyomsola mhambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">niivo wanago vondawakusole weye Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">fana munhu yosola viyomdeng'helela mhambe wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">niivo Mulungu wako vondayakudeng'helele weye.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Kuchanyha ya ng'huta zako weye Yelusalemu niweka wakalizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">imisi na ichilo hawezanyamala hupi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">Mweye womumkumbusa Mndewa Mulungu chilagano chake, sekemunyamale hupi.<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />Sekemumuleke yahumule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">mbaka vondayadibweleze bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">na kuditenda ditogoligwe na wanhu wa zisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kailaha kwa ukulu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">kailaha kwa mkono wake wili na nguvu, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">“Sizaweng'ha kaidi wehi wako ndiya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">iviya wageni hawezakung'wa kaidi divai yako ya sambi youilavile vuke.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Mbali wawo wahunile ngano iyo wezaija na kuditogoza zina jangu niye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">wawo woduganya zabibu wezakung'wa divai yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">wezakung'wa divai yake muna uluwa lwa kaye yangu yelile.”<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Mweye wakaya wa Yelusalemu vuguleni nyivi mulawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">muwasasalile nzila wanhu wenu wobwela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">Limeni, limeni, kulugumbi na musegeze yamabwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">Simikeni bendela iwe chilaguso kwa ichimu cha wanhu wa zisi waimanye nzila.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kagong'onda mbaka muna uhelelo wa iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">walongeleni vino wandele wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">“Lola mulopozi wenu kokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">yeye kokwiza na maliho mumkono wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">na maliho yake ni wawo wanhu wakomboligwe.”<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Wawo wezatangigwa wanhu welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">wanhu wakomboligwe na Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">Iviya bululu da Yelusalemu dizatangigwa, “Bululu dodizahiligwe na Mulungu,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">na “Bululu ijo Mulungu hadilekile.”<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowatagusa wehi wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Vino ino yelihi yokwiza kulawa isi ya Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">yofika kulawa bululu da Bosila na mawalo yeli na mawolawola madung'hu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">Vino ino yelihi yayawale mawalo ya nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">kogenda kwa nguvu ng'hulu?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 63:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">“Niye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">nogong'onda kuhuma kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">nina nguvu ya kukombola.”<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Habali kuna walo dung'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:2">fana munhu yobojoga zabibu muladi yazikame?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />“Kweli, nikama zabibu niidumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">habule munhu yezile kunitaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">Nizibojoga zisi kwa ludoko lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">nizihonda kwa ludoko lwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">Mawalo yangu yamema damu za wanhu wa zisi izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">zifizile mawalo yangu.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Kwaviya siku ya kulihiliza ifika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:4">lusita lwa kuwakombola wanhu wangu lufika.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Iviya nilola, mbali hakukalile na munhu wa kunitaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">nyazaganyika kwaviya habule munhu wa kuniguma moyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">Ivo nihuma kwa mkono wangu mwenyewo na ludoko lwangu lufika.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Niwahonda wanhu wa zisi kwa ludoko lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:6">niwatenda wakoligwe kwa ludoko lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:6">damu yawo niitila hasi.”<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowawonela ubazi Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />Nizakumbuka unovu wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">nizalonga mbuli zose za kumtogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">kwa ichimu cha mbuli zose ziyachitendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">viyawawonele ubazi Waisilaili kwa unovu wake.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Kwaviya kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">“Kweli wano wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">wanangu, wawo hawanivwizila.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">Iyo kawa mulopozi wawo.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Muna yamagayo yawo yose yeye iviya kagaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">hamtumile msenga imwenga yawataze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">mbali yeye mwenyewo keza kuwalopola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">Kawakombola kwa kulonda kwake na kwa ubazi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">kawapapa na kawasola kwandusila umwaka.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Mbali wawo wakala wadugi na wamguma luholozi Muhe wake Yelile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">Ivo Mulungu kagaluka kuwa mwihi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">yeye mwenyewo kaitowa nawo.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Baho wazikumbuka siku za umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">lusita lwa Musa msang'hani wa Mndewa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">Wauza, “Kakulihi Mndewa Mulungu yawalopole wadimi wa bumbila jake muna ibahali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">Vino kakulihi yekile Muhe wake Yelile mgati yawo?<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Vino siyo yeye yatendile mauzauza na mawewedeko kwa mkono wake uli na nguvu kufosela Musa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">Vino siyo yeye yatulile bahali na kuwalongoza wanhu wake muladi yatogozigwe siku zose?<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Kawalongoza hagati ya mazi ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:13">fana falasi muna iisi inyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:13">hawaikwalile.<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Fana ng'ombe viwogaligwa kuja mgina kuna dibawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">niivo Muhe wa Mulungu viyawahumuze wanhu wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">Niivo Mulungu viyawalangulize wanhu wake, muladi yatogozigwe.”<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wopula kutazigwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Weye Mulungu, uchisungulile kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">uchilole kulawa hanhu hako helile heli na ukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">Zakulihi nguvu zako na kuiyoha kwako kwa ichimu chetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">Hachiwona kaidi ulondo na ubazi wako.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Kwaviya weye niiyo Tati yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">Bulahimu wasaho yetu hachigesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">nayo Isilaili hachimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu niiyo Tati yetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">Weye kutangigwa Mulopozi wetu kwandusila umwaka.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, habali kochagiza nzila yako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">Habali kochitenda chiwe na mizoyo midala sekechikudumbe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">Weye Mndewa Mulungu, ubwele kwa ichimu cha wasang'hani wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">makabila yakalile yako siku zose.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Cheye wanhu wako chiihazi isi lusita ludodo muhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:18">Mbali wehi wetu weza kubananga kaye yako yelile.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Chiwa fana wanhu ung'hali hunawatawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">fana wanhu hawamanyike kwa zina jako.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Muhavu uhatulile ulanga uhumuluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:1">milima igudemeke kwa kukudumba.<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Humuluka ukawatende wehi wako waziwone nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">muladi wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wagudemeke kwa kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">fana moto viutimbula ngodi na kutenda mazi yakimule.<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Viutendile mbuli za kudumbiza hachizihuwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">kuhumuluka na milima igudemeka kuulongozi wako.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Kwandusila umwaka habule munhu yadahile kuhulika kwa magutwi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">na habule munhu yamuwonile mulungu yoyose yalingile weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">Weye kutenda mbuli zilingile izo kwa ichimu cha wanhu womuhuwila weye.<verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Weye kokwiza kuwataza wanhu wotenda voilondeka kwa kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">wanhu waja wozindilila malagilizo yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">Vichihasanye kuchiwonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">lelo chizakomboligwa vilihi?<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Cheye wose chiwa fana wanhu wafilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">sang'hano zetu zose zinogile zilinga fana mawalo yambule mwiko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">Wose chonyala fana mayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">wihi wetu wochihembelusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">fana mayani viyohembelusigwa na vulavumbi.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Habule munhu yoyose yokwiza kukupula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">habule yoiyoha kuzindilila malagilizo yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">Kwaviya weye kuchifisa chihanga chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">kuchileka chifungigwe na mbuli zihile zochitendile.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Mbali weye Mndewa Mulungu, weye niiyo Tati yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">cheye ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">weye niiyo muumbaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">cheye chose kuchiumba weye.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, sekeuchiwonele ludoko ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:9">sekeukumbuke uhasanyi wetu siku zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:9">Ukumbuke kuwa cheye chose wanhu wako.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Mabululu yako yelile yawa mabwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:10">Sayuni iwa matongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:10">bululu da Yelusalemu ditimbuligwa na moto.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Kaye yako yelile iviya inoga, muja mowakutambikile wasaho zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">itimbuligwa na moto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">Vinhu vetu vose vinogile vibanangika.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Vino kwa mbuli izo zose kwizaikimilila sekeutende chinhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:12">Vino weye Mndewa Mulungu kwizagendelela kunyamala na kuchitagusa?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kotagusa na kukombola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">“Niigubula kwa wanhu waja hawauza mbuli zangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">Niwoneka kwa wanhu hawanizahile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">Kwa wanhu hawanipulile niwataze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">nilonga, ‘Nabahano.’<verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Imisi yose nigolosa makono kuwataza wanhu wonilema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">kwaviya wanhu wawo wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">na wosondelela magesa yawo wenyewo.<verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Wanhu wawo lusita lwose wonisovula kuno nolola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">kuno woilavila nhambiko milungu yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">na woifukizila ubani uchanyha ya chila lupango lwa matafali.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Wokala muna yamaleme na ichilo wogona hanhu hawo haholile ha kutambikila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:4">Woja nyama ya nguluwe na waguma msuzi wa wanyama wambule mwiko muna ivyano vawo.<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />Wanhu wolonga, ‘Kala kutali sekeunikwenhukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">kwaviya niye nyela ng'hani!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">Wanhu fana wawo walinga fana yosi vidingila muna zimhula zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">yosi ijo dolawa muna umoto ugendelela kwaka.”<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">“Muvimanye kuwa mbuli izo zandikigwa haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">sizanyamala, mbali nizawaliha yombe jawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">nizawaliha yombe jawo voilondeka.<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />Nizawaliha kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wenu na uhasanyi wa tati zenu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">Walava nhambiko za kutimbula kuna umulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">wanisovula uchanyha ya vilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">ivo nizawalingila muna zimhambaga zawo maliho yolondeka kwa nhendelo zawo za umwaka.”<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">“Fana viya divai ya sambi ing'hali yopatika muna ichipambo cha zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">wanhu wolonga, ‘Sekeuchibanange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">kwaviya ing'hali na chinhu chinogile mgati.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">Ivo niivo vondaniwatendele wasang'hani wangu, muladi sekeniwanange.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Nizamtenda Yakobo yawe na welesi wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">iviya nizamtenda Yuda yawe na welesi wondawahazi isi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">na wasang'hani wangu wezakala uko.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Bawe da Shaloni dizakuwa hanhu ha kudimila wanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">iviya bawe da Akoli dizakuwa hanhu ha kuhumula ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">kwa ichimu cha wanhu wonizahila.<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />“Mbali nizatenda choni na mweye munileka niye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">hamugesa Sayuni mulima wangu welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">mweye momtambikila mulungu yotangigwa ‘Sudi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">na momulavila nhosa ya divai mulungu yotangigwa ‘Dondokela.’<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />Nizamulungilani ifa kwa zele, mose mwizachinjigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">Kwaviya vinimtangileni hamunidike na vinilongile hamunitegeleze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">Mutenda mbuli zihile haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">musagula kutenda mbuli sizilonda.”<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Lelo niye Mndewa Mulungu nolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">“Wasang'hani wangu wezakuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">mbali mweye mwizawona nzala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">Wasang'hani wangu wezakung'wa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">mbali mweye mwizakuwa na ng'hilu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">Wasang'hani wangu wezadeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">mbali mweye mwizakugwa chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Wasang'hani wangu wezakwimba kwa kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:14">mbali mweye mwizalila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:14">na mwizaguta ng'hondo kwa usungu ng'hani.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Waja woniwasagule nizaweng'ha zina da sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:15">mbali wezadisang'hanila zina jenu kuduwila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:15">Wezalonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu yamkomeni.’<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Munhu yoyose yopula kutemeligwa mate muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">kezapula kutemeligwa mate na Mulungu wa kweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">Munhu yoyose yoilaha muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">kezailaha kwa Mulungu wa kweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">Kwaviya magayo ya umwaka yafosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">yaga ng'hani haulongozi wangu.”<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya Sambi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />“Lola, nolumba ulanga wa sambi na isi ya sambi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:17">Mbuli zifosile hazizakumbukigwa kaidi.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Deng'heleleni na musekelele siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">kwa ichimu cha vinhu vinilumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">Nizaditenda bululu da Yelusalemu kuwa bululu da kusekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">na wanhu wake wezadeng'helela.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Niye nizadideng'helela bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">nizawadeng'helela wanhu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">Dizi da ndilo hadizahulikika kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">na masozi ya manhesa hayezakuwa uko.<verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />Hakwizakuwa kaidi na ndilo za wana ving'hele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">walala hawezadanganika lung'hali lusita lwawo halunafika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">Munhu wa miyaka gana yahadanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">kadanganika yang'hali mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">yahadanganika hanafika miyaka gana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">kopetigwa kuwa kaduwiligwa.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />Nawo wezazenga kaye na kukala umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:21">wezalima mizabibu na kuja matunda yake.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Hawezazenga kaye za kukala wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">iviya hawezalima ndiya ya kuja wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">kwaviya wanhu wangu wezakala lusita lutali fana mibiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">wanhu wangu woniwasagule wezadeng'helela vinhu vondawapate kwa sang'hano zawo.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Hawezasang'hana bila kupata chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">na wanawo hawezapata mahulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">Kwaviya wezatemeligwa mate hamwe na welesi wawo.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Wang'hali hawananitanga, niye nizawedika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:24">wang'hali hawanakomeleza kulonga, niye nizawahulika.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Mbwizi na ng'hondolo wezakuja hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">simba wezakuja mgina fana ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">iviya nyoka wezakuja timbwisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">Muna umulima wangu welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">habule yondayalumize hebu kunanga chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">Niye Mndewa Mulungu nolonga ivo.”<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu kowatagusa wanhu wa zisi zimwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">“Ulanga niicho chigoda changu cha chifalume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">na isi niicho chigoda cha kwikila magulu yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">Vino mweye mwizanizengela kaye ilingile vilihi hanhu hondanihumule?<verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Niye mwenyewo nivitenda vinhu ivo vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">iviya vinhu vose vangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">Mbali nomgesa munhu nyondenyonde yeli na usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">munhu yogudemeka kwa kudumba viyohulika mbuli yangu.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Wanhu wonilavila nhambiko ya ng'ombe walinga fana wanhu wowakoma wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Wanhu wonilavila nhambiko ya mwanang'hondolo walinga fana wanhu wombena umbwa isingo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Wanhu wonilavila nhosa ya ndiya walinga fana wanhu wolava damu ya nguluwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Wanhu wosoma ubani walinga fana wanhu wohita kumtambikila mulungu wa uvwizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Wawo wasagula kusondelela magesa yawo wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">iviya wodeng'helela mbuli zitibusa.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Lelo nizawagalila mahulo makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">nizawagalila vinhu vidumbigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">Kwaviya vinitangile, habule munhu yanidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">vinilongile, habule munhu yanitegelezile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">Watenda mbuli zihile haulongozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">na wasagula mbuli zonihila.”<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Tegelezeni mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">mweye mugudemeka kwa ichimu cha mbuli yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">“Ndugu zenu womwihilani na womuwingani kwa ichimu changu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">Womsekani kuno wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">‘Mulungu yalaguse ukulu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">na cheye chiwone mweye mohuma,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">mbali wawo wenyewo wezakugwa chinyala.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Dizi da tibwilitibwili dolawa muna dibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">tegelezeni nyangi kulawa muna Ikaye ya Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">Dizi da Mndewa viyowalihiliza wehi wake.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />“Bululu jangu jelile dilinga fana mwanamke yoibasula bila usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">usungu haunaluma kaibasula mwana kamala.<verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Vino yelihi yahulike mbuli ilingile iyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Vino yelihi yawonile mbuli ilingile iyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Vino isi yose yodaha kwelekigwa siku dimwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Vino isi yodaha kulawilila kwa lusita luguhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Kwaviya Sayuni viyapatile usungu kavumbula mwanage bahaja.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Vino niwalole goya wanhu wangu mbaka habehi ya kwelekwa na niwakimilile sekewelekwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">Hebu niye mwenyewo niweng'ha wana na niwafunge sekewalele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">Niye Mndewa Mulungu nolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />Mweye mudilonda bululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">deng'heleleni hamwe najo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">mweye mukalile mudililila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">lelo deng'heleleni hamwe najo.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Yelusalemu komong'hezani fana mama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">na mweye mwizakwiguta na kudeng'helela.”<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">“Nizamgalilani tindiwalo fana lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">utajili wa zisi ulinga fana chizanda chikilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">mwizakong'ha na kunyamuligwa muna yamakono yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">na kuhembelezigwa muna yamagulu ya mami yake.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Fana mama viyomuhembeleza mwanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:13">iviya nizawahembeleza wanhu wa bululu da Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Muhawona mbuli zino, mizoyo yenu izadeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">mivuha yenu izapata nguvu fana mayani mabisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">Baho izamanyika kuwa niye Mndewa Mulungu nowakaliza wasang'hani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">mbali nizawawonela ludoko wehi wangu.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Mndewa Mulungu kezakwiza na moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">iviya matololi yake ya ng'hondo yalinga fana vulavumbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">Kezatagusa kwa ludoko lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">na kezakalikila kwa milambi ya moto.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kezahumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:16">kezawatagusa wanhu wose kwa zele na moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:16">kezawakoma wanhu wengi.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, “Kuna wanhu waisafya na kuisunha muladi wadahe kwingila muna zinhambiko za milungu ya uvwizi. Womtegeleza munhu yoja nguluwe na mhuku na vinhu vambule mwiko, wezakomigwa hamwe kuuhelelo.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />“Niye noyamanya magesa yawo na nhendelo zawo, nokwiza kuwakunzagiza wanhu wa zisi zose na makabila yose, waikunzagize hamwe na wauwone ukulu wangu.<verse eid="ISA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />“Nizakwika chilaguso hagati yawo, nizawagala wanhu wahonyokwe kuhita muna izisi zimwenga uko Talishishi na Puli na Ludi isi imanyike kwa wanhu wake magalu wa kukwega mhinde, iviya wezahita isi ya Tubali na Giliki na visiwa va kutali uko wanhu hawanahulika mbuli zangu na hawanauwona ukulu wangu. Wezagong'onda ukulu wangu hagati ya zisi zose.<verse eid="ISA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />“Nawo wezawagala ndugu zenu wose wokala muna izisi zimwenga, mbaka kuna umulima wangu welile uko Yelusalemu kuwa nhambiko kwa Mndewa Mulungu. Wezakwiza kwa kukwela falasi na matololi ya ng'hondo na matololi makulu, wezakwela uchanyha ya nyumbu na ngamia.” Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo. “Wezawagala fana Waisilaili viwogala nhosa zawo za ndiya muna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu, muna ivia velile na kuzindilila malagilizo ya nhambiko. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Wamwenga wawo nizawasagula wawe wakulu wa nhambiko na wamwenga wawe Walawi,” Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />“Fana viya ulanga wa sambi na isi ya sambi vondaniviuse vondavikale siku zose kwa udahi wangu, niivo nyelesi zenu na mazina yenu vondavikale siku zose. <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Chila dugila da kwima kwa mwezi na chila Siku ya Mhumulo, wanhu wose wezakwiza kunitambikila,” Mndewa Mulungu kolonga ivo. <verse eid="ISA 66:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />“Wawo wezalawa kunze kulola mitufi ya wanhu wanilemile niye. Wang'onyo wondawaije mitufi iyo hawezakufa na moto wondauisome hawizazimika. Wanhu wose wezayehula mitufi iyo.”<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>